<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fea8ad133be17a9d9f7902cb32ddc6e4d470d568> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:d3aa10e81e6de3c4cb909104ec25d443 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:c377de51a53638ec47b46e17e706b495 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fea8ad133be17a9d9f7902cb32ddc6e4d470d568> <http://schema.org/description> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) has been commissioned by Greater Gabbard Offshore Winds Ltd (GGOWL) to undertake a coastal process study for the proposed Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) development. This report focuses on providing a baseline understanding of the coastal process regime in the Thames SEA with particular emphasis on the proposed area of development." .
_:c377de51a53638ec47b46e17e706b495 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames SEA" .
_:d3aa10e81e6de3c4cb909104ec25d443 <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard Offshore Winds Ltd" .
_:c377de51a53638ec47b46e17e706b495 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
