_:ca619815a75ef9bb6f0facdc35e68495 <http://schema.org/value> "Unknown method survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fe685b20d8171c76b64b3439216de50c66f751b0> <http://schema.org/description> "This processed bathymetric data set has been derived from an Unknown method survey. The source data was collected, validated and processed for the purpose of Safety Of Life At Sea (SOLAS). The data set must not be used for navigation or to create products that could be used for navigation." .
_:b15603f4ea8b39d06b5710cea1b77a06 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fe682fa1a66f19d3571604954377f5912c102256> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b15603f4ea8b39d06b5710cea1b77a06 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fe682fa1a66f19d3571604954377f5912c102256> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the document in this series is to report upon the acquisition, processing and rendering of\r\nbathymetric survey data in support of the asset integrity multibeam survey undertaken at the\r\nGunfleet Sands 1 &amp; 2 Windfarm in the Thames Estuary.\r\nThe survey data was collected utilising the PLA survey vessel s/v Maplin fitted with a high\r\nresolution R2Sonic 2024 multibeam echosounder operated in a single head configuration. In\r\norder to best utilise favourable tide and weather period’s, acquisition was accomplished on\r\n13th December 2016.\r\nNo H&amp;S incidents, near misses or unsafe acts occurred during the project.\r\nThe acquired and processed data was of high quality and coverage and sounding density\r\nand associated specifications set by the client were met.\r\nThe scope of the GFS 01&amp;02 survey was to survey the Offshore Substation (OSS)." .
_:b15603f4ea8b39d06b5710cea1b77a06 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fe682fa1a66f19d3571604954377f5912c102256> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b15603f4ea8b39d06b5710cea1b77a06 .
_:b8f8d586c5a6440abfee54b61b1e1a85 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fe47176d0049cbad68d09683f78f6ce9cc35e6a5> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic monitoring of the sea bed adjacent to the fish farm as a requirement of the CAR licence for the site. Grab samples collected in proximity to the farm and at two reference locations. Samples analysed for: benthos, redox, psa, carbon." .
_:d48e50dbe318bc353e19fab143162302 <http://schema.org/name> "migratory marine species" .
