<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fde91fa537328d299105324324ee54ad06a50636> <http://schema.org/description> "A sublittoral dive west of Lee Bay focusing on habitat. This was a reconnaissance dive and therefore the survey was incomplete and probably justifies a second visit. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder." .
