<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fcce0c82188bb5dc9eb2bb8279835650d4536b3b> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral survey of locations in and around Prawle, Stoke Point and Erme Estuary. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 1992-97 Devon Wildlife Trust Prawle Littoral survey and the 1992-97 Devon Wildlife Trust Stoke Point and Erme Estuary littoral survey." .
