<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fb6830cdb922aa62f0cdfbb5878b00439244fb2e> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during May 1975. It includes casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and hourly STD lowerings made over a 14 hour period at 57N, 9W. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
