<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fa8fe494282479986242520dc13d1be5a7825403> <http://schema.org/description> "Aerial bird survey conducted over the Ormonde wind farm and adjacent areas in order to fulfil conditions set out in the project Marine Licence (L/2011/00201/10).\r\n\r\nThe survey work was scheduled to occur in December (2013) and January (2014). However, due to poor weather conditions, the survey was undertaken during January and February, 2014." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fa8fe494282479986242520dc13d1be5a7825403> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
