<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f86369edbbb55757f58ed5493deaea15550809f1> <http://schema.org/description> "Species counts from holdfasts collected on Lundy. \r\n \r\n Species were counted during a series of shore surveys around the island which are detailed in the report. The data was extracted from handwritten record cards compiled by L.A. Harvey" .
