_:f4e9bc311bd89439e6b75ad870c7aca9 <http://schema.org/value> "Bay of Biscay" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f840258584884152d0379bafbe36cc9d92524ef5> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise No. 18 to the underwater canyons off the north coast of Spain in the Bay of Biscay. Most samples were collected using an Agassiz dredge with one (12th July) being collected using an anchor dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
