<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f816590f0563a1c124464c3a4fc07bad78203beb> <http://schema.org/description> "A project which aimed to 'develop a viable sediment dynamic model for artefact based sites [which] is crucial both in terms of site formation process study;a priori archaeological investigation; and latterly the effective management of marine sites to ensure their future stability.' (Dix, J.K. et al 2007, Final project report). The project was funded by the Aggregate Levy Sustainability Fund. Coodinates given are approximate NGR locations for the northern and western extents of the study area along the coast, and are described more fully in the project report. Further information about the project can be accessed via the Archaeology Data Service - http://archaeologydataservice.ac.uk" .
