_:e1049fa03ccfb5e9846f84709a056978 <http://schema.org/value> "Barrow-in-Furness" .
_:a79be9308cc7db970379e323cad172e2 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:e1049fa03ccfb5e9846f84709a056978 <http://schema.org/value> "West Duddon Sands" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f74a5f1c9767c3f59d8aa1c9fba3a14ac46a8013> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e1049fa03ccfb5e9846f84709a056978 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f74a5f1c9767c3f59d8aa1c9fba3a14ac46a8013> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a79be9308cc7db970379e323cad172e2 .
_:a79be9308cc7db970379e323cad172e2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a79be9308cc7db970379e323cad172e2 <http://schema.org/value> "Gardline Geosurvey Limited" .
_:e1049fa03ccfb5e9846f84709a056978 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f74a5f1c9767c3f59d8aa1c9fba3a14ac46a8013> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey Limited was contracted to survey the proposed West Duddon Sands Cable\r\nRoute Survey, between 13-Jul and 27-Jul 2011. The geological data acquisition programme was\r\ncarried out by MV Confidante, which sailed from Barrow-in-Furness and returned to Barrow-in-\r\nFurness upon completion of survey operations." .
_:e1049fa03ccfb5e9846f84709a056978 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e6d48e8042e3f3003b0c5b4142cab593 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f738eadd6f3ed983b4c2c771bbd42751174133e9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f738eadd6f3ed983b4c2c771bbd42751174133e9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e6d48e8042e3f3003b0c5b4142cab593 .
_:e6d48e8042e3f3003b0c5b4142cab593 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewable Energy Limited" .
_:e6d48e8042e3f3003b0c5b4142cab593 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f738eadd6f3ed983b4c2c771bbd42751174133e9> <http://schema.org/description> "The Central Science Laboratory (CSL) Bird Detection Radar was commissioned\r\nby Centrica Renewable Energy Limited to undertake a ten-day monitoring\r\nexercise during October 2004 into offshore bird flight activity in the vicinity of the\r\nproposed Lincs wind farm (LWF). The aims of the study were: &gt; To provide a radar assessment of bird flight activity and direction within radar range from the coast out towards the Lincs site, &gt; To describe the bird movement in relation to weather conditions, &gt; To compare visual observations and boat based observations with radar. During the 10 days of operation bird detection radar detected, tracked and\r\nrecorded 53772 avian radar tracks. Visual observations from the coast, and boat-based transect surveying, were also undertaken. This series contains the survey report and associated maps showing the radar tracks." .
_:e6d48e8042e3f3003b0c5b4142cab593 <http://schema.org/value> "Central Science Laboratory" .
_:cd2cdfbb93a144610f266286c35ad24a <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:bb69cdbe8a2a87cc6ac9f8544e68ccd2 <http://schema.org/value> "Norwegian Sea" .
