<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f6f573bd5e40562e581734669dda76fa57649cff> <http://schema.org/description> "In July 2013 two\r\nOCEANOR Seawatch Midi wave buoys were deployed at the Westermost Rough offshore wind farm site, North-East\r\nEngland. These buoys are referred to as WMR10 and WMR20." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f6f573bd5e40562e581734669dda76fa57649cff> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ae3f3ae616dbd3923d6b2b64247ce842 <http://schema.org/value> "North-East\r\nEngland" .
