_:e069c1d23dd04578ab9603c3d06ffbab <http://schema.org/value> "Kyle Rhea Tidal Array" .
_:a5f0d3301025894e27845164e2f76dd1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
