<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f33cec3067f5083eab5832f813949e05e2f59100> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f5e31d9ba19009f6c7b043d39b56017 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f33cec3067f5083eab5832f813949e05e2f59100> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c0e5b3fa5bb1ed2f56802c8caa5424ac .
_:f5e31d9ba19009f6c7b043d39b56017 <http://schema.org/value> "Irish Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f33cec3067f5083eab5832f813949e05e2f59100> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in April 2015 by DONG Energy to carry out a geophysical survey\r\non a selection of areas located in the Walney Offshore Windfarm (WOW), and a bathymetric survey\r\non the West of Duddon Sands (WoDS) windfarm. The survey comprises of mapping the seabed\r\nsurrounding the offshore sub-stations (OSS), a number of the wind turbines (WTGs), inter-array cables,\r\nand associated export cables. The sites are located in Morecombe Bay, Irish Sea. The surveys were\r\ncompleted under existing framework terms and conditions, with some alterations. The survey were\r\nundertaken between 1st and 20th April 2015. This series contains reports/data relating to the West of Duddon Sands array and export cable route only." .
_:f5e31d9ba19009f6c7b043d39b56017 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
