<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f2c3ca08e5d636440db8cbf4c3b05012e6ec94d9> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys in and around Stoke Flemming, Beer Head, Chesil Cove, Exmouth, Burton Bradstock and Lyme Bay. A detail survey of offshore reef previously identified as being damaged by fishing gear. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 1993-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Stoke Fleming littoral survey, 1994 Devon Wildlife Trust Beer Head to Chesil Cove Lyme Bay survey, 1994 Devon Wildlife Trust Exmouth to Burton Bradstock Lyme Bay survey, 1994-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Exmouth to Chesil Lyme Bay survey, and 1998 Devon Wildlife Trust Lyme Bay sublittoral rock survey." .
