_:cffe7dbca62d112ffc940c993a209ac4 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f22b902cb401df0ac3a93358a6845736e2e9076b> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the landscape and seascape visual assessment carried out by RPS at the site of the London Array offshore wind farm.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of this study was to describe, classify and evaluate the existing landscape likely to be affected by the scheme at the construction and operational phases of the project; To identify visual receptors with view of the proposed development; To assess the significance of the direct and indirect impacts on landscape character and visual resources taking into account the measures proposed to mitigate any impacts identified." .
_:ab27b48487370c063134893bcc027f2c <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:cffe7dbca62d112ffc940c993a209ac4 <http://schema.org/value> "London Array" .
