<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f21cee351a457ad74788bc954240e11f8aa39004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:dcbeb76dd5c3458db6b60aec97388349 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
_:dcbeb76dd5c3458db6b60aec97388349 <http://schema.org/value> "MEDIN Data Archive Centre" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f21cee351a457ad74788bc954240e11f8aa39004> <http://schema.org/description> "Data from Marine Conservation Zone (MCZ) surveys are archived in the MEDIN Data Archive Centre (DAC) for Geology and Geophysics at the British Geological Survey. This includes geology (Particle Size Analysis) data and multibeam backscatter data. Data are delivered via the BGS Offshore GeoIndex. Additional data are available on request enquiries@bgs.ac.uk. Other data types are archived with the other MEDIN DACs as appropriate (UKHO DAC for bathymetry data and DASSH DAC for biological data). https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/marine-conservation-zone-designations-in-england." .
_:dcbeb76dd5c3458db6b60aec97388349 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f21cee351a457ad74788bc954240e11f8aa39004> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dcbeb76dd5c3458db6b60aec97388349 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f217cee74699a0265994bdb9bad5bd1489538ecc> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 17 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during December 1993 - January 1994 from stations in the North East Atlantic between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 E. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Bremen, Center for Marine Environmental Sciences as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:fac4203d1345689d647b70969b97eddd <http://schema.org/value> "Center for Marine Environmental Sciences" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f217cee74699a0265994bdb9bad5bd1489538ecc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
