<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f10474693a2b85a4931426e1568f2995ccd36c3f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e2f51155c0dc11e11cb5d8ee8ea07dba .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f10474693a2b85a4931426e1568f2995ccd36c3f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e2f51155c0dc11e11cb5d8ee8ea07dba <http://schema.org/value> "NWP Offshore Ltd." .
_:e2f51155c0dc11e11cb5d8ee8ea07dba <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f10474693a2b85a4931426e1568f2995ccd36c3f> <http://schema.org/description> "This project concerns the monitoring undertaken during 2005-6 to comply with the conditions of the Food and Environment Protection Act (FEPA) 1985: Part II (as amended), licence reference 31579/02/0 (as amended), issued to NWP Offshore Ltd. for the North Hoyle Offshore Wind Farm. This report represents the second year of post-construction monitoring and the 4th of a 5th year monitoring programme. As the most recent environmental monitoring results are assimilated and compared against those of previous monitoring campaigns at the site, it is now becoming possible to make preliminary conclusions on the overall impact from construction and operation of the wind farm on the physical and biological environment." .
_:e2f51155c0dc11e11cb5d8ee8ea07dba <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0f34a3d5903951b8767060323481afccdabb3db> <http://schema.org/description> "This report has been prepared by Subacoustech Ltd for Barrow Offshore Wind Ltd. It describes a series of underwater acoustic measurements undertaken in and around the Barrow Offshore Wind Farm site, on the 30th January and 1st February 2007. The purpose of the measurement programme was to characterise any increase in the ambient subsea noise due to the presence of the operational wind farm, and to assess the range over which any increase in noise occurred." .
_:e05ad8073851effb15723b8bdff6f0c8 <http://schema.org/value> "Barrow Offshore Wind Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0f34a3d5903951b8767060323481afccdabb3db> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e05ad8073851effb15723b8bdff6f0c8 .
