_:e05ad8073851effb15723b8bdff6f0c8 <http://schema.org/value> "Subacoustech Ltd" .
_:e05ad8073851effb15723b8bdff6f0c8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
