_:e06f1e5632c334aa0f22e5b01a24bc37 <http://schema.org/value> "Roosecote sub-station" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f04d2ee6cd902e8e228d82cdcb44c480cb330548> <http://schema.org/description> "This data has been collected as part of the North West Coast Connections project (NWCC), Morecambe Bay. A geotechnical survey was undertaken to investigate the marine section of a tunnel corridor between landfalls at Rampside and Heysham near the proposed head house locations at Roosecote sub-station and Middleton sub-station. Data acquisition and coverage were divided into 2 phases." .
