_:fa8a131fa5883b131fc0801a98ca9037 <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard Offshore Winds Limited" .
_:ac2b7b022ece9ce0bb4249ecea8d4209 <http://schema.org/value> "Orford Ness" .
