<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:effa11070b98f035fe88da34f29575a445de6702> <http://schema.org/description> "Biotope, quadrats, transects of Wembury followed by a report for zonation patterns and GIS. Includes 1997/10/31 All Wembury Stuff, 2000/05/05 Wembury Report Acetate workspace Jenny G, and 1998/2/06 All diving stuff, Wembury stuff, Refuges stuff Jenny data. Includes electronic 'Wembury2 - Keep' data a Devon Wildlife Trust 'Monitoring the Seashore' survey 1998." .
