_:cd4c69def98bbd8dd1d335a9caaa2fd0 <http://schema.org/value> "Lynn" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:efe9f3ec4222e7837fedd0c276dcc1834529e7b4> <http://schema.org/description> "Titan Environmental Surveys were commissioned by Centrica Renewable Energy Ltd to\r\ncollect current and suspended particulate matter from four sites around the Lynn and\r\nInner Dowsing Wind Farms over the course of three deployments during the construction\r\nof the two wind farms, namely pre, during and post construction.\r\nThe report in this series describes an inter-comparison of the turbidity and water sample data\r\ncollected, and attempts to assess if there is any evidence for a change in the suspended\r\nsediment transport regime of the area as a result of the construction of the two offshore\r\nwind farms." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:efe9f3ec4222e7837fedd0c276dcc1834529e7b4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
