<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:efa46946d613ce7407557945a933530b95fc871c> <http://schema.org/description> "Monthly boat based bird surveys were undertaken at the Ormonde OWF. Surveys were conducted in May, July, August and October (September was proposed but the survey was delayed due to weather)." .
_:f6e8eaf2221ca92f5f7bff8b08c15cfc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f6e8eaf2221ca92f5f7bff8b08c15cfc <http://schema.org/value> "Marinelife" .
