_:b58bacca37e101029646ebe51c2b4c10 <http://schema.org/value> "Aberdeen Marine Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef5cc696f4a1d9ea10d74e3fae9cf117f9508b67> <http://schema.org/description> "This project concerns the five designated wreck sites situated in the Isles of Scilly: Tearing Ledge, HMS Association, Bartholomew Ledges, HMS Colossus and the Wheel Wreck. The first phase of the project collected high resolution multi-beam data for each of the five sites. The second phase entailed production of photographs and video from four of the sites (not including HMS Colossus). The final phase was the creation of web-based virtual site tours for the Tearing Ledge, HMS Association, Bartholomew Ledges and the Wheel Wreck, and the enhancement and integration of the existing HMS Colossus virtual dive trail." .
_:cbf32b211b9867ebfae5b366af5f537 <http://schema.org/value> "Isles of Scilly" .
_:cbf32b211b9867ebfae5b366af5f537 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
