_:f237bbc52b9cbf2c05a7f093aa3a4d3 <http://schema.org/value> "La Chapelle Bank" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef4e7e47ed3215b232f6b66932b69e26aa4f22ee> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f237bbc52b9cbf2c05a7f093aa3a4d3 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef4e7e47ed3215b232f6b66932b69e26aa4f22ee> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f80daed9cabdb483cdf769cbace2ff2 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef4e7e47ed3215b232f6b66932b69e26aa4f22ee> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 33 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1993 from stations in La Chapelle Bank and Biscay between 47 - 48 N, 5 - 10 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Bordeaux 1, Department of Geology and Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:f237bbc52b9cbf2c05a7f093aa3a4d3 <http://schema.org/value> "Biscay" .
_:f80daed9cabdb483cdf769cbace2ff2 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
