<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d3b36ad39c052967adbad4b20edee30c .
_:d3b36ad39c052967adbad4b20edee30c <http://schema.org/value> "CAR licence" .
_:ec1b50216e78228d96ceeb4239e759e2 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic monitoring of the sea bed adjacent to the fish farm as a requirement of the CAR licence for the site. Grab samples collected in proximity to the farm and at two reference locations. Samples analysed for: benthos, redox, psa, carbon and sea-louse medicine residues." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec1b50216e78228d96ceeb4239e759e2 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2c7c7f29364bfe30f087e1747c03917c32de85> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c215e52ba5e73af4bd68745e5416c699 .
_:dfb88bae21d8e4b637b6b7577e4b5778 <http://schema.org/value> "acoustic survey" .
_:dfb88bae21d8e4b637b6b7577e4b5778 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2c7c7f29364bfe30f087e1747c03917c32de85> <http://schema.org/description> "Preliminary engineering design work and discussions with stakeholders highlighted a number of issues relating to the cable corridor and the indicative cable routes submitted in the original consent applications for both the proposed Docking Shoal and Race Bank Offshore Wind Farms. Three additional seabed areas were surveyed to allow minor alterations to the original cable routes. EMU Ltd undertake a full acoustic survey with ground-truthing, to determine benthic habitats, bathymetry, topography, subsurface geology and the locations of any magnetic anomalies within these areas." .
_:c215e52ba5e73af4bd68745e5416c699 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:c215e52ba5e73af4bd68745e5416c699 <http://schema.org/value> "EMU Ltd" .
_:c215e52ba5e73af4bd68745e5416c699 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
