<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef0fce277077e6c3f3378785eb45f24dd2163b62> <http://schema.org/description> "This map shows the UK continental shelf and the regional seas boundaries as determined by JNCC." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef0f00bab65b935897de35bba5f281b7bdbe05d6> <http://schema.org/description> "Crab survey carried out by St Andrews Primary School Plymouth along with MBA staff. Part of the EU-funded Crab Watch project." .
