<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eefc97596cf18760ce664351fdc6b7124337d6c5> <http://schema.org/description> "Statistical analyses of Hi-Def aerial survey marine mammal observation survey data for the Dogger Bank development zone between 2009-2011. The scope of work requested from DMP Statistical Solutions UK Limited was a package of outputs that reflect the spatial distribution of several species/groups through time. The scope of species and species-groups were agreed with Forewind prior to analysis. The requirements were:\r\n1. Annual relative abundance surfaces where possible for identified groups.\r\n2. Relative and absolute abundance surfaces, over all surveys, for:\r\na. Harbour porpoise.\r\nb. ‘Potential harbour porpoise’ grouping.\r\nc. Harbour porpoise &amp; ‘Potential harbour porpoise’ grouping combined.\r\nd. White-beaked dolphin.\r\ne. Minke.\r\nf. Grey seal." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eefc97596cf18760ce664351fdc6b7124337d6c5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
