<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee91c64929b4884b03d59ac1a332077021980ce5> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of a report to Natural England, the NERC Sea Mammal Research Unit conducted and investigated the Grey Seal population status of Berwickshire and North Northumberland Coast European Marine Site. The report includes detailed counts of grey seals around various known populations along the site of interest. These totals are compared with previous studies estimate pup production rate and breeding potential for each population." .
_:d6d5444afe3cb8f49fe81aa1edbe9463 <http://schema.org/value> "counts" .
_:dfa3ba065933e67d335a33de9e8bd20b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e2a79316a99fe509fef747abf84db871 <http://schema.org/value> "North Northumberland Coast" .
