_:b8712d9f4a02b9c3c8e6f91c36d2df59 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:ddda05303e93d967e74502a977e4990d <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee769461a0d732436a54b8aca5f2142217f477d5> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 24 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section from east of the seamount to Rockall, plus a north-south section over the seamount. The data were collected during May of 1982. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:ddda05303e93d967e74502a977e4990d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee769461a0d732436a54b8aca5f2142217f477d5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a4df9d88ab85abae0ede07710ed6fab8 .
