_:f7ba58a2b43d11f030280872b3c2e798 <http://schema.org/value> "Northern Ireland inshore region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee4fd641d3f2a80231363cbb35296bdede0eda86> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset is a collation from subtidal ground-truthing surveys carried out in Strangford Lough SAC and MCZ between 2016-2019. This part of DAERA biodiversity and MPA monitoring programme in the Northern Ireland inshore region. A drop camera was either dropped and towed or mounted in a sledge and towed to gather broad scale habitat information and groundtruth Side scan sonar data and previous seabed habitat mapping. Evidence gathered in these surveys will also support designation of pMCZ features in Strangford Lough and inform management decisions within the MPA." .
_:ee066a24649404207f083bde249de589 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:c56a9c331d733b3662a06c7d5997d03a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee480073d3ff59a3372b1cfd49bf04187b80f272> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:aeaa6f1a0e0fc359c5a439b61baad6de <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:c56a9c331d733b3662a06c7d5997d03a <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee480073d3ff59a3372b1cfd49bf04187b80f272> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 24 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Norwegian Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically in Faroese waters during June 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Faroes Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Monitoring the Atlantic Inflow toward the Arctic (MAIA) project." .
_:c56a9c331d733b3662a06c7d5997d03a <http://schema.org/value> "Norwegian Sea" .
