_:a3881dc6003c31ab2e6498c0b7cbbdd2 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica" .
_:a3881dc6003c31ab2e6498c0b7cbbdd2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee44774a429df2d38615ad8d71d9fd4c6380d994> <http://schema.org/description> "An Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) was undertaken by Centrica as part of the consenting process for the proposed Race Bank Offshore Wind Farm. This series contains Volume 1 of the Environmental Statement, its annexes and the Non-Technical summary." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee44774a429df2d38615ad8d71d9fd4c6380d994> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a3881dc6003c31ab2e6498c0b7cbbdd2 .
