<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee223e56e74aa739a0697e67aea3a4699e042f03> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically sections between the Isle of Man and the Scottish, English/Welsh coast, during March of 1987. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
