_:dfcd60bab28045548e5abdb6cb1fd17a <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ede8a26b7001204ab221c8c905920b15c5a1f11d> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 30 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during November - December 1993 from stations on the World Ocean Circulation Experiment section SR1b in the Drake Passage. Section SR1b end points are south of the Falkland Islands to Elephant Island at the north end of the Antarctic Peninsula. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the James Rennell Centre for Ocean Circulation as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
