<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:edcf414574f4382df5fdb6a1fccd2ac2e8868dc0> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a0abe3b0ea6ade1843c6477da48f3f55 .
_:a0abe3b0ea6ade1843c6477da48f3f55 <http://schema.org/value> "Duddon Sands" .
_:a0abe3b0ea6ade1843c6477da48f3f55 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:edcf414574f4382df5fdb6a1fccd2ac2e8868dc0> <http://schema.org/description> "This report presents results of the surveys in and around West of Duddon Sands in 2015, which represent the first post-construction survey year, following pre-construction (baseline) surveys carried out in 2012 and during-construction surveys in 2013 and 2014. Some comments on the results are provided, although the focus of the report is on presentation of the survey data." .
_:e0f04530d33fd9d333652c65bb778fc8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
