<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed9839ccb48d4db5b3ee92a80c250ecf89952588> <http://schema.org/description> "This series contains the vessel monitoring data and photographs from Eday and Sanday. This survey was carried out at the same time as the marine mammal survey. As this is more of a ad-hoc vessel sightings survey, no report is available but further details can be found in the marine mammal survey reports regarding locations and timings." .
