_:d4872a4addd737e78db1429844fc2a1d <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed4e36997b7f1c40913105a3eae1d813e890e877> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d5368f16fd52738f5ae80ba22d26294a .
