<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed08714bde02067f1cf94f5383e832996cc44bed> <http://schema.org/description> "A polygon subset of sea areas around the UK taken from The SeaVoX Salt and Fresh Water Body Gazetteer (v14 published April 2013). Sea areas included are Iceland Sea, Norwegian Sea, North Sea, Inner Seas off the West Coast of Scotland, Irish Sea and St. George's Channel, Bristol Channel, English Channel, Celtic Sea, Bay of Biscay and Skagerrak." .
_:c33afdfe7a71d6722d4aa4f8455b8c7d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:c2b406932eb9efda41245ef5097232e5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c33afdfe7a71d6722d4aa4f8455b8c7d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed033a0c56625ebc19515346d5ec3d4addcb8d54> <http://schema.org/description> "This project has been prepared by Subacoustech Environmental Ltd for DONG Energy Power (UK) Ltd. It describes a series of high quality underwater acoustic measurements undertaken in and around the operational Gunfleet Sands Offshore Wind Farm site. on the 17th, 18th and 19th April 2011. The purpose of the measurement programme was to characterise any increase in the ambient subsea noise due to the presence of the operational wind farm, and to assess the range over which any increase in noise occurred." .
_:c33afdfe7a71d6722d4aa4f8455b8c7d <http://schema.org/value> "Gunfleet Sands" .
