<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ecba628f4f4ee2e113745f7e9e1c48c6de9719b1> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 12 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically west of the Isle of Man, from Northern Ireland to the north west of Ireland. The data was collected during June of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
