_:bceb28fdf44e79f1ecb186430fa4f6ac <http://schema.org/value> "AMEC Wind Energy" .
_:f23f32d03222ca98517b4d76cf275a25 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ebd6a2da18eca82f80067352f9b72661f2e8880b> <http://schema.org/description> "A report on the history of the Zostera beds as a part of an ongoing study to determine the current health. Comparing literature, graphic illustrations and distribution within the Exe Estuary. The Final report is available in Word and PDF format. Mapping and GIS data available on Floppy disc." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ebd6a2da18eca82f80067352f9b72661f2e8880b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f23f32d03222ca98517b4d76cf275a25 .
