<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eaa41e7a836b49810d71dfea077106e9cbc78d44> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March 1990. It incorporates five CTD profiles from the eastern end of the section between Mull and Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line). The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
