<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e9a34573032bf86a218731db7932ed724d5bfcbc> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 55 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area including the Celtic Sea, North Channel and the Clyde Sea, during the month of March 1985. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
