<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e90407be1e5f3a27dc3b18ec2ef4615877bde28b> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 7 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically East and West Coast, Fladen and Shetland areas, during January of 2007. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
