<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8db8c74e693dc02e601b4e86132694ebf257d6a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d8ed224a9089f294257d68561958db2 .
_:d8ed224a9089f294257d68561958db2 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8db8c74e693dc02e601b4e86132694ebf257d6a> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in July 2016 by DONG Energy to carry out a survey after a rock\r\ndumping campaign at West of Duddon Sands Windfarm (WDS01), and an Asset Integration\r\nManagement (AIM) survey at Burbo Bank Windfarm (BBW01). The surveys was carried out between 30th July 2016 and 31st August\r\n2016. A bathymetric AIM survey on all WTG positions, array cables and both SSS and MBES on the export cables, along with two further cross lines." .
_:d8ed224a9089f294257d68561958db2 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
