<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e89c7d019615b86d4c14289b0470b7171ccfc149> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:be9f5d940610b59ad837005a4637f9a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e89c7d019615b86d4c14289b0470b7171ccfc149> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e89c7d019615b86d4c14289b0470b7171ccfc149> <http://schema.org/description> "This document investigates whether the presence of the Oyster WEC array is likely to impact the natural\r\nerosion and sediment transport processes in the vicinity of the development area. Particular attention is\r\ngiven to the potential for impacts to the Skara Brae World Heritage site, and other sensitive receivers in the\r\nvicinity.\r\n\r\nAquamarine Power Ltd is currently developing a hydro-electric wave energy converter (WEC) called Oyster. The Oyster is located in shallow water close to the shore. The WEC consists of a bottom-hinged, surface-piercing flap which oscillates due to wave action. Double acting pistons on each side of the WEC pump water through a high pressure pipeline to a hydro-electric plant on the shore. The high pressure water drives a Pelton wheel turbine connected to an electrical generator. The flow from the Pelton wheel discharges to a header tank and returns to the WEC via a low pressure return pipeline." .
_:be9f5d940610b59ad837005a4637f9a <http://schema.org/value> "Oyster" .
_:c0e007ecf154f1b4ba127c79fe4c91dd <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:c0e007ecf154f1b4ba127c79fe4c91dd <http://schema.org/value> "survey region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e877cf77e2b1d4229273c98107f3edd158b193b5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e877cf77e2b1d4229273c98107f3edd158b193b5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c0e007ecf154f1b4ba127c79fe4c91dd .
_:a953c5d552658bed716dd573a02e16d2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a953c5d552658bed716dd573a02e16d2 <http://schema.org/value> "bird abundances" .
_:a953c5d552658bed716dd573a02e16d2 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e877cf77e2b1d4229273c98107f3edd158b193b5> <http://schema.org/description> "Statistical analyses were conducted for the Strangford bird sighting data. One set of analyses\r\nis presented for terns exclusively, another for the remaining bird species combined. The analyses were to quantify the fluctuations in bird abundances with environmental and\r\ntemporal conditions (e.g. tidal or seasonal effects), as well as potential effects associated\r\nwith the MCT turbine installation and operation. Both the terns and remaining bird species exhibited strong seasonal and tidal fluctuations in\r\nrelative abundance. There is evidence of a possible displacement of the general bird species out of an area\r\nimmediately adjacent to the turbine installation. There is however no evidence of an overall\r\ndecline in relative bird abundances for the survey region, with some other areas exhibiting a\r\nrelative increase. There is evidence of lower relative tern abundances, for the days that the turbine is in\r\noperation. Tern abundance has however increased significantly overall within the survey\r\nregion, over the course of the study. This series contains one report detailing the analyses." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e877cf77e2b1d4229273c98107f3edd158b193b5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a953c5d552658bed716dd573a02e16d2 .
_:c0e007ecf154f1b4ba127c79fe4c91dd <http://schema.org/value> "survey\r\nregion" .
_:c0e007ecf154f1b4ba127c79fe4c91dd <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
