<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8094901e210abe2014988a1c757ebff05053426> <http://schema.org/description> "The objectives of the investigation were as follows:\r\n• To provide a magnetic survey to identify any potential UXO prior to further\r\ndata acquisition\r\n• To perform seismic investigations with the purpose of providing an informed\r\nbasis for the planning of two horizontal directional drillings in order to get the\r\nexport cables from Race bank safely into land without interfering more than\r\nnecessary with the salt marsh. The geophysical investigation was carried out between 15th July and 1st September,\r\n2014" .
_:ebb3835d1f0b0be6111e23de1b77c4c2 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
