<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e6e49c7491516cf099644b4f15409c16490a3d0c> <http://schema.org/description> "Beam and otter trawl surveys between Morwellham Quay and West Mud of the River Tamar, southwest England, for smelt and shad, between 2015-08-06 and 2016-03-14 recording total length and representative weights of targeted species and other fishes as part of contract EC18234 between Natural England, the Marine Biological Association and the Environment Agency." .
