<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e60b6e4024993a3d265eaabe9b553e3dea8d8316> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ef4ae51dad9153297a58d5005557c09f .
_:f9e45ab8952bef2a7bd0c91431713e03 <http://schema.org/value> "Vattenfall" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e60b6e4024993a3d265eaabe9b553e3dea8d8316> <http://schema.org/description> "Royal Haskoning was commissioned by Vattenfall to undertake an\r\nEnvironmental Impact Assessment (EIA) for the offshore and onshore\r\nelements of the project. The Environmental Statement (ES) is the principal\r\nreporting document of the EIA process. The ES is prepared in order to\r\nsupport the consent application process for the wind farm extension and is\r\nrequired under the Infrastructure Planning Regulations (Environmental Impact\r\nAssessment) Regulations 2009 (which transpose the EIA requirements of the\r\nEU Directive (EIA Directive) 85/337/EEC (as amended by Directive 97/11/EC\r\nand Directive 2003/35/EC). (Further detail regarding the legislative\r\nbackground is in Section 3 Legislation and Regulatory Context). This ES is divided into three main elements, the non-technical summary, environmental statement text and figures, and the appendices." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e60b6e4024993a3d265eaabe9b553e3dea8d8316> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f9e45ab8952bef2a7bd0c91431713e03 .
_:f9e45ab8952bef2a7bd0c91431713e03 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
