<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e4f464be6d49c0ae5dad37477644505ad01b047d> <http://schema.org/description> "Series Description: A re-interpretation of single-channel seismic data along a sub-set of survey profiles across the SE part of Celtic Array Wind Farm in the Irish Sea. This was followed by the SE Stage 2 Ground Model (report number SE-D-EN-078-0117-501038-023)\r\nCentrica Project: Round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development;\r\nProject Phase: Consenting;\r\nSurvey Title: South East Celtic Array Stage 1 Ground Model \r\nSurveyor: Reynolds International Limited;\r\nSurvey Date: 2013\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document No: SE-D-EN-078-0000-501038-004 and SE-D-EN-078-0000-501038-004-Att1\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1.Log Analysis (.dat, .xls, .csv) ; 2.Maps (.pdf); 3. Map Packages (.mpk); \t4.Type sections (.pdf, .png); \t5. Images(.pdf, jpg) ; 6. Survey Documentation: Borehole reports, Reports, (.pdf)" .
_:a62b3914458ac9289f1d466a1744016e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
