<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e411c2adc9b29a66d1063c3d811b2431e13932a2> <http://schema.org/description> "Shore based monitoring at the Brough Head Wave Farm Limited Agreement for Lease (AfL) area. The data collected will allow the numbers and distribution of seabirds and cetaceans using the waters surrounding the proposed deployment site to be characterised, along with their behaviour. This information will be used to inform an Environment Impact Assessment" .
_:d3f46ddfd044d217754773cbc09d4b4 <http://schema.org/value> "Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science" .
