<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e3f8279b2823768959ccf1fde94dd3e15cab66a4> <http://schema.org/description> "Brown &amp; May Marine Ltd. in association with Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd was commissioned by Thanet Offshore Wind Ltd to undertake the Spring and Summer Adult Fish Surveys for the proposed Thanet Offshore Wind Farm located off NE Kent Coast." .
_:f6012d6ea7c2be41eefef6a45c1fcd94 <http://schema.org/value> "NE Kent Coast" .
