<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e3adf11d497329f8cb199f18a106d2cc6593122b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e3adf11d497329f8cb199f18a106d2cc6593122b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b943febc79d407a18a20f65eb5da3135 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e3adf11d497329f8cb199f18a106d2cc6593122b> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the ongoing assessments for the Humber Gateway offshore wind farm periodic video survey have been carried out in the vicinity of the met mast installed in August 2009 in order to provide some indication of scour. In addition, some further video work has been undertaken at the inshore end of the cable route in order to address sonar contacts recorded during the geophysical surveys which were originally identified as potential areas of the sabellaria reef. This report provides a summary of the work undertaken to date with the representative stills from the video surveys and some assessments of the status of the seabed area and covered by the surveys." .
_:d4d6494679ac08c976a0e4e8c8c0778c <http://schema.org/name> "marine regions" .
