<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e393d997cfa83b7db5004911eb4b37a05da3c4d0> <http://schema.org/description> "This document has been produced as part of the archaeological consultancy services provided to Gunfleet Sands Ltd (owned by Dong Energy Ltd) by Maritime Archaeology Ltd (MAL). MAL is acting as the Retained Archaeologist for the project in compliance with the implementation of the Archaeological Written Scheme of Investigation (WSI) which has been produced in line with the requirement of the FEPA license (Wessex Archaeology 2008a)." .
