_:a44355bd0f6218970f229e87299193aa <http://schema.org/value> "Sheringham Shoal" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e37a33ea3ecc95453386cc880517eee8745d56ed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e37a33ea3ecc95453386cc880517eee8745d56ed> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines geological and sea level change baseline studies carried out at the site of the Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm as part of the Environmental Impact Assessment. The report within the project presents a brief outline of geology and sea level change of the wider southern North Sea. The lower, middle and early upper Paleolithic sea levels as well as late upper Paleolithic and Mesolithic sea levels are examined." .
_:a44355bd0f6218970f229e87299193aa <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
