<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e37543e721da3bdeda7b96a3c31ae5b1a5e10ce4> <http://schema.org/description> "A comparison between urban and non-urban rockpools at Gwithian and Porthmeor (Feb-April 2015) comparing the three data sets were relating to Salinity, pH and biodiversity. The overall conclusions were significant differences between the two sites." .
