_:dbbe8324212c0408ecd2081dcba6e311 <http://schema.org/value> "epifaunal assemblages" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e3318350ef801264c2734c41805a6534050f4b08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:fd9649e6d8bb4f68b672731e9645d43f <http://schema.org/value> "benthic communities" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e3318350ef801264c2734c41805a6534050f4b08> <http://schema.org/description> "The report shows the post construction monitoring of benthic communities around the Gunfleet Sands Demonstration Project (GFS3) export cable. The aim of the monitoring programme was to identify any change in benthic infaunal and epifaunal assemblages relating to the installation and operation of the GFS3 export cable, in order to validate the predictions made in the Environmental Statement (ES), and the associated addendum." .
