<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e2e4b7f2b45bec91a45b7a218081bf7ce87c0e0b> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 79 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically along the Fair Isle-Munken, Faroe and the Nolso, Faroe-Flugga, Shetland sections and along the JONSIS and the EC lines. The data were collected during June of 1992. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
