<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e28a59d0960614d722918bdefb8b35ac5bad4076> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ad63e7a42131cd6646dea1a8f52b2d02 .
_:b9ead04f09d8c97ce7feec9e21ffc9d6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e28a59d0960614d722918bdefb8b35ac5bad4076> <http://schema.org/description> "Description: Geophysical and Environmental Survey Export Cable Area of the seabed between the southeast area of the Round 3 zone OWF site off the west coast of the UK in the east Irish Sea, known as the Irish Sea Zone and the north Anglesey coast, with the primary objective of surveying the area for potential export cable routing. \r\nCentrica Project: Round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development\r\nProject Phase: Consenting;\r\nSurvey Title: Celtic Array Export Cable Marine Geophysical and Environmental Survey\r\nSurveyor: EGS (International) Ltd ; with Seastar Survey Ltd as Sub-contractor \r\nSurvey Date: 2012-2013\r\nSurvey vessels ; EGS Pioneer, SV Otarie\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document No: R3-D-EV- 020-0117-501031-001 (phase 1), R3-D-EV-020-0117-501031-002 (phase 2) R3-D-EV-020-0117-501031-005 (test site)\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1. GIS (.shp, .gdb, .mxd, .gmp, .tif) ; 2. CAD (DWG) \t3. Raw and processed data -Ancillary Data, MBES, Navigation logs, Geophysical: Magnetometer, Sub-bottom profiler and Side-scan Sonar. Operations and Interpretatuve reports are also provided." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e28a59d0960614d722918bdefb8b35ac5bad4076> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b9ead04f09d8c97ce7feec9e21ffc9d6 .
