_:f6a43e923d20ec5cd9f044da42aae1d5 <http://schema.org/value> "coring area" .
_:cb93189c4c8698e8c25ca0cb3aa50500 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
_:c9e5ed033e4d9526152cdd283455ba7f <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
_:c9e5ed033e4d9526152cdd283455ba7f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
