<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e1fb9225c0a2bcdcc4ebd0541f16f6aacdf20b05> <http://schema.org/description> "A ground investigation has been carried out by Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited (FAOL) on the\r\ninstructions of DONG Energy Power (UK) Limited (DONG) for the development of the Walney\r\nExtension offshore windfarm site in the Irish Sea. The site is located between approximately 21 km to\r\n45 km west of the Isle of Walney and the west coast of Cumbria in the Irish Sea. The Walney\r\nExtension windfarm site is adjacent to the Walney Phase 1 and Phase 2 windfarm sites to the north\r\nand the north-east.\r\nThe ground investigation was carried out from 13 October 2012 to the 12 January 2013 on the\r\ngeotechnical drill ship Fugro Commander and the jack-up barge the Excalibur." .
