<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e175578773cbfa9545685724b708acdb8ffd3b78> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1981. It incorporates a survey of the Porcupine Slope. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of a study of mid-water and near-bottom nepheloid (high concentrations of suspended sediment) layers." .
