<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e09b5b60e0d0e1ebfdbc559257344d3c849bc7da> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:de46f37b4b7cebbc811bcbd51c0e9e3b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
