<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:deb84f72b60e7754322b372d9d860359d2040594> <http://schema.org/description> "A search for sublittoral colonies of the polychaete Sabellaria spinulosa was carried out in Morecambe Bay. The surveys used a towed underwater video camera and grab sampling, together with acoustic data gathered using a RoxAnn acoustic seabed discrimination system. No specimens of Sabellaria were found during the survey." .
