_:df44b37e9a6abd132b48570351915f3e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c7a822b130bfb5b7231baecacee86092 <http://schema.org/value> "otter trawl" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dd68a54939e4f93b528715f88ea12576b1626eaa> <http://schema.org/description> "A series of pre-construction and post-construction surveys have been undertaken within and\r\nadjacent to the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms in order to meet the requirements outlined\r\nwithin FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing wind farms\r\nrespectively. A range of surveys were undertaken, including otter trawl, beam trawl, shrimp trawl, potting and longlining. This series contains the data from the pre-construction surveys." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dd68a54939e4f93b528715f88ea12576b1626eaa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c7a822b130bfb5b7231baecacee86092 .
