<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dd32d55bd15dd6f5930ceae58cf35a07089ed25d> <http://schema.org/description> "A series of offshore surveys conducted at the Ormonde site. Fieldwork included environmental and geophysical surveys.\r\n\r\nEnvironmental Statement Appendix 5 and 15." .
