<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dc4db576eba2887c0bd525e6dee143bcaf29f542> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG\r\nEnergy to undertake a seabed monitoring survey of a designated section of the four export\r\ncable routes from the LAWF that cross the Princes Channel.\r\n\r\nThis series covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 15th February 2013.\r\n\r\nThe survey work was carried out using the PLA survey vessel ‘Yantlet’, with bathymetric\r\ndata being collected using a hull-mounted Reson SeaBat 8125H MBES.\r\n\r\nMBES data was missing from delivery." .
_:dc4472c021d2edee8ab9aa626f895a21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
