<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dc349771f523fc4f05b169e4dc58941bb03ddd0b> <http://schema.org/description> "This collection comprises the Digital Archive (photogrammetry and site images) from an aerial survey at Fort Charles undertaken by Aerial-Cam Ltd in November 2020.\r\n Low-level aerial photography and video were recorded by UAS. Vertical and oblique photos were taken. A series of overlapping images were taken and processed in the office using Agisoft Metashape to create a 3D model. Several control points were placed on and around the site and pinpointed using GPS. A 3D model of Fort Charles was created following the survey." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dc349771f523fc4f05b169e4dc58941bb03ddd0b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
