<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dbd0b649b15f6f083381af124e8816861263ef7d> <http://schema.org/description> "Single day survey for Atrina fragilis in exposed Zostera marina bed during very low spring tide on 18 April 2007, following initial find of an intertidal specimen on 21 March 2007. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
