<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:db9dc2f4f52e94287a9124f74780ae9f64cfcc88> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 21 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in November 1995 from stations in the inner seas off the west coast of Scotland and the North East Atlantic. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:db9dc2f4f52e94287a9124f74780ae9f64cfcc88> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
