<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:daa78bbb9c942065ae8dba30562494ffb7d7d587> <http://schema.org/description> "Visual inspection of the designated site was undertaken and most artefacts recorded during an earlier 1994 survey were seen and recorded using video and digital stills photography. 'The reported findspot of a recently discovered Bellarmine vessel was also extensively investigated [without result].' (WA 53111.03m) The dives took place in November 2003." .
