_:e78e4d5ef4d75a49073c1119b678ef7e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8de14f25dea173b5089bfd0b66e4374e18e43bd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aee7a68c98313a824f15328fee9b2070 .
_:aee7a68c98313a824f15328fee9b2070 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8de14f25dea173b5089bfd0b66e4374e18e43bd> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 93 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically along the Fair Isle-Munken (Faroe), Nolso (Faroe)-Flugga (Shetland), the JONSIS, East Shetland (ES) and northern North Sea (EC) standard sections, during May of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:a596f723ea845604281ae7fc46c8d432 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:aee7a68c98313a824f15328fee9b2070 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
