<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8cd333ab2b74529b47de9119b5d574a2efa3de7> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the 1958 RV Sarsia cruise no. 6 to the European continental shelf off the west coast of France. Samples of benthos were collected using a mixture of 4ft rectangular dredge and bowed dredge. Records were supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
