<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d86d072c6fba467d0a120774012df08974c6d34e> <http://schema.org/description> "A report on a detailed investigation into the ecological health of the Falmouth estuary and surrounding area. The dataset contains water quality analysis, sediment samples, intertidal and subtidal habitat characterization listing species and community assemblages. Aerial photography was used to map out the survey sites and are used to display them in the report." .
