<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d7556309623a8c3408bf02fcd124a69873654e17> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d11c0efcae9209da939a4a8998560dbe .
_:d11c0efcae9209da939a4a8998560dbe <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
_:cdc0ba57698ed33de6f65a18286e2f7f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
