<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d7218fcec83a4e9ea2b8657e765daf386f369aec> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 94 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the north east coast and Dogger Bank, during October of 1999. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
