<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d6f72d38342570cc0ff2e8d704592c79e88f7ba6> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March 1992. It incorporates tidal cycle CTD anchor stations off Whitehaven and on a dump site in Liverpool Bay. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
