<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d60941fe476e1610ce67ad9afd8d26373b131cc0> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b2ae3376483254d01ee60435e578d5af .
_:b2ae3376483254d01ee60435e578d5af <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d60941fe476e1610ce67ad9afd8d26373b131cc0> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 75 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas including specifically along the standard Faroe-Shetland Channel sections and along the JONSIS standard section, in the vicinity of the Viking Bank. The data were collected during September of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:b36518e825f1dd02c171557906ca943a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
