<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d56a8bacd5193c4573785e36bfe75afe49e88501> <http://schema.org/description> "Forewind has installed 2 meteorological masts within the Dogger Bank Offshore Wind Farm Round 3 Development Zone. Dogger Bank East (DBE) was installed during March 2013 and Dogger Bank West (DBW) was installed during September 2013. \r\n\r\nBoth met masts were deployed by Fred Olsen United. The suction bucket foundation and lattice towers were put in place by the jack-up vessel Brave Tern. \r\n\r\nThis series contains the following datasets for the Dogger Bank West (DBW) met mast:\r\n\r\nRaw 10 minute data from 15 December 2013 to 19 September 2017\r\n\r\nCleaned 10 minute data from 24 July 2013 to 01 July 2014\r\n\r\nThe following reports are also included:\r\nCalibration certificates, Logger codes, Operations and Maintenance reports and General Dogger Bank met mast information\r\n\r\nThe raw data was cleaned and supplied to Forewind by the SSE wind assessment team." .
