_:a5983479694e06b83e21b53fb2a96214 <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea area" .
_:f53e327c0a0ef815803acaad7f313089 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d5307a5c5e658ed77f966d48b07395982f8a6909> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 109 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the east coast of Scotland, Moray Firth to the Tweed. The data were collected during January of 1992. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:a5983479694e06b83e21b53fb2a96214 <http://schema.org/value> "east coast of Scotland" .
_:f53e327c0a0ef815803acaad7f313089 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
