_:a4bf3aceeac85f89fa5bc490d5bab1c0 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:d3c3c2572c84c5e5665429590a10c6f4 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:d3c3c2572c84c5e5665429590a10c6f4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d3f2ece5c1b2d7c0a0551577ac58356e074cd687> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the assessment of the impact on shipping and marine activities as a result of the proposed development of the Rampion Offshore Wind Farm site, a 28 day traffic survey is carried out in the area of the proposed development. This survey is carried out over 2 x 14 day periods to cover seasonal and tidal variations.\r\n This report presents analysis which has been carried out from Shoreham during January and July 2011.\r\n The data was collected using radar, AIS and visual observations." .
_:a4bf3aceeac85f89fa5bc490d5bab1c0 <http://schema.org/value> "AIS" .
_:d3c3c2572c84c5e5665429590a10c6f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Shoreham" .
