<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d3264c9bc8a93a6e85ea271f9f44f6f9e900472b> <http://schema.org/description> "A Natural England commissoined verification survey of intertidal sediments within the Thanet Coast rMCZ. Phase I Biotope mapping was carried out across the rMCZ for broad scale habitats.The data was used to produce a EUNIS Level 3 boradscale habitat map of the Thanet Coast rMCZ." .
