<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d2c684e043a396e5010e025f6ebd8fa94dc73f37> <http://schema.org/description> "Records of the Features Of Conservation Importance (FOCI) species, short-snouted seahorse (Hippocampus hippocampus) found between 2006-07, supplied from the report \"Occurence of the short-snouted seahorse Hippocampus hippocampus in the central North Sea\". 2008. Pinnegar, John. K., Stelzenmuller, Vanessa., Van der Kooij, Jeroen., Engelhard, G. H., Garrick-Maidment, Neil. and Righton, David. A.' (2 records were also noted prior to 1900 but no coordinates were available)." .
_:a68885ddd7232b75801b0361c914c69a <http://schema.org/value> "Hippocampus hippocampus" .
_:bd2c830a5b6548bcbedff844c40ef8c2 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f68afc4b2edbaccbcf0d86d0a10f5ac6 <http://schema.org/value> "Dong Energy" .
_:f68afc4b2edbaccbcf0d86d0a10f5ac6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bd2c830a5b6548bcbedff844c40ef8c2 <http://schema.org/value> "Lincolnshire" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d2c10d31a7718bcbe277f80e4804a268fe20337b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f68afc4b2edbaccbcf0d86d0a10f5ac6 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d2c10d31a7718bcbe277f80e4804a268fe20337b> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions and acting on behalf of Dong Energy (the Client) a site investigation\r\nhas been carried out by Fugro at the proposed landfall location of a High Voltage (HV)\r\nexport cable for the proposed Race Bank Offshore Wind Farm, close to the town of\r\nSutton Bridge, Lincolnshire.\r\nThe objective of the investigation was to determine the ground conditions at the site and\r\nto provide information that would assist the Client in the geological and geotechnical\r\nappraisal of the site for the purposes of designing a potential Horizontal Directional Drill\r\n(HDD) route. Subsequently the Client also requested the assessment of the ground\r\nconditions for a potential shallow trenched/trenchless installation approach for the cable.\r\nThe scope of the investigation was determined by the Client in conjunction with Fugro." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d2c10d31a7718bcbe277f80e4804a268fe20337b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bd2c830a5b6548bcbedff844c40ef8c2 .
