_:f5a5875decfba00b98c97966f49235e8 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
_:fab43afab00483f837ee10baa7a5de72 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1eeac9718f4e611e140bbab2fd3750790b8f0cc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fab43afab00483f837ee10baa7a5de72 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1eeac9718f4e611e140bbab2fd3750790b8f0cc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1eeac9718f4e611e140bbab2fd3750790b8f0cc> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in July 2016 by DONG Energy to carry out at a survey after a rock\r\ndumping campaign at West of Duddon Sands Windfarm (WDS01), and an Asset Integrity Management\r\n(AIM) survey Burbo Bank Windfarm (BBW01). In addition to this, a variation order (VO 01) was\r\ncommissioned for a cable repair survey at WDS01 and a debris survey at the Walney Offshore\r\nWindfarm (WOW01). The surveys were undertaken between 30th July and 30th August 2016. The project has been separated out into four sections, with the main objectives of the surveys as\r\nfollows:\r\n2016-031a: Cable Repair at West of Duddon Sands Windfarm (H11-H12)\r\nMultibeam survey of H11 - H12 plus existing and proposed array cable linking the monopiles.\r\n2016-031b: Debris Clearance at Walney Offshore Windfarm (B04)\r\nMultibeam debris clearance survey at position B04, 300x300m box. 2016-031c: Rock Dumping Survey at West of Duddon Sands Windfarm\r\nBathymetric survey covering three areas on the export cable route, following a rock dumping\r\ncampaign.\r\nThis report presented 3 separate areas over 2 reports:\r\nSurvey 1a – Barrow Crossing Agreement (BCA) (this report)\r\nSurvey 1b – KP8.8 and Survey 1c – Cable Burial Areas (CBA)\r\n2016-031d: Asset Integrity Management Survey at Burbo Bank Offshore Windfarm\r\nA hydrographic AIM survey (bathymetry) on all WTG positions, array cables and both SSS and MBES\r\non the export cables, along with two further cross lines.\r\nThis report presented 3 separate areas, including:\r\n? Wind Turbine Generators (WTG)\r\n? Array cables\r\n? Export cables\r\nIn addition, data was also provided for 2 additional lines across the site." .
_:fab43afab00483f837ee10baa7a5de72 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:fab43afab00483f837ee10baa7a5de72 <http://schema.org/value> "Bibby HydroMap" .
