<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1e543c3f9924f3f6a1e85ed4c1c0ae3b72731b5> <http://schema.org/description> "Dive videos (only play larger, DVD Movie files) and photograph surveys of the Lyme Bay Reef and Seafans. Includes 2006/07/01 Lyme Bay Seafans, 2006-2007 Lyme Bay drop down under Seafan and reef survey, and 2007/07/16 Lyme Bay Mike Markey surveys. Lyme Bay Pink Sea Fan survey electronic data is available in PDF, Word, Excel, GIS and photographic format. Photographs available from DBRC." .
