<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1537fd1e6c8daf278e69640e4e8aab2a0ad2883> <http://schema.org/description> "A PhD was carried out at the University Marine Biological Station Millport (UMBSM) and presented to the University of London.\r\n The study assesses the composition and the fate of invertebrates which are regularly discarded in the Clyde Nephrops fishery." .
