<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d0e724eecaeea93ab71991c2b2cde047566dab16> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in September 2015 by EDF Energy Renewables to carry out geophysical and high-resolution bathymetric surveys of Teesside Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) as part of ongoing monitoring of the site. The survey was completed under Bibby HydroMapâ??s Terms and\r\n Conditions. The surveys were carried out between 8th and 22nd September 2015.\r\n The main objectives of the survey were as follows:\r\n â?¢ Monitor the state of the seabed\r\n â?¢ Identify any seabed debris\r\n â?¢ Identify areas (if any) of sediment accretion or scour\r\n â?¢ Produce high resolution images of the turbine bases" .
_:f5dd35aef14d3f2b1f9d1979514819dc <http://schema.org/value> "EDF Energy Renewables" .
