<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cff60cab68bbcdb20cd47d4af56eb6f60f80855a> <http://schema.org/description> "For the pre-construction baseline monitoring requirements of the FEPA licence, fish surveys have been carried out throughout the 2010 seasons. \r\nThis metadata file has been created by The Crown Estate for the purpose of publishing the dataset onto the Marine Data Exchange." .
