<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cff1aa76ec4837c00fb609e0fa98ee52e02a7d8b> <http://schema.org/description> "Scleractinian and Gorgonian records from the 1964 RV President Theodore Tissier cruise along the Moroccan and Iberian Shelf and to the Great Meteor Seamount. Records supplied by Jason Hall-Spencer and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
_:f4aca9c9e3ad0f0a0a93722005992371 <http://schema.org/value> "Moroccan and Iberian Shelf" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cff1aa76ec4837c00fb609e0fa98ee52e02a7d8b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
