<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf2dcd31f24ecc63fc00cdb059097e5037cfbb2b> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 12 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the Dogger Bank area, during June and July of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
_:cfa15d02e3190e3901880f64fc12e2d7 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
