<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ced5b94b9d7557cfb6c32b7eadfad9478dd912d5> <http://schema.org/description> "The Offshore Wind Round 4 Plan-level HRA was undertaken by The Crown Estate to assess the potential implications of the 2020 Offshore Wind Round 4 Plan on European sites, as required under the Habitats Regulations. \r\n \r\n The following documents have been produced by NIRAS Consulting Ltd and are provided within this Series: Principles, Screening, Report to Inform Appropriate Assessment, Record of Appropriate Assessment and Outline Strategic Compensation Plans." .
