<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cec8cc99d6b7a487546f8bb5882b6213a6e97322> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 78 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically within the Scottish North Sea coastal zone (Moray Firth-Firth of Forth), during May and June of 1992. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
