<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ce10658223a9ecc109d1503ba9036c8be06680bb> <http://schema.org/description> "The Hayes McKenzie Partnership Ltd. has been contracted by EDF Energy Renewables to undertake background noise monitoring in the town of Redcar in Yorkshire. The purpose of the monitoring is to provide supporting evidence for an increase to the allowable noise emissions from construction noise associated with piling activities at the Teesside Wind Farm." .
