<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cdd3ab5df53f7d89a568c7aebe24c1c471e51ee0> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 10 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in April 1994 from stations off Erris Head between 54 - 56 N, 10 - 12 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the National University of Ireland, Galway as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:a40d98cd46d6c81be57e15cb8776f82c <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
