_:e005fc68803782e2dfbb2f253d1594da <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cbeaf7dfb0b7c46b993989ee30f3c1d469d212bb> <http://schema.org/description> "This report has been prepared by Subacoustech Ltd for PMSS / Airtricity. It describes a modelling assessment of the underwater noise during impact piling operations to construct the Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Farm." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cbeaf7dfb0b7c46b993989ee30f3c1d469d212bb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a0fc77a075069967c03435db7beffcba .
