<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cbe00261666decc70940d6603d1797f242da46e5> <http://schema.org/description> "Ordnance survey images supplied to Net Gain with the location of saltmarsh and saline reedbeds as an outcome of meetings by Hester Clack (NE), Tammy Stamford (Net Gain Liaison Officer), National Trust and Bernard Bishop (Warden, Norfolk Wildlife Trust Cley Marshes) from Hester and Tammy. Meeting minutes are available in the Net Gain draft final recommendations, June 2011." .
