<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cb28607083da8796d5837a751aa37a87eb6fb8ae> <http://schema.org/description> "An assessment of the potential ornithological impacts of the proposed Ormonde offshore wind farm, off the Cumbria coast. The work evaluates whether the proposed wind farm may have any adverse effects on the ornithological nature conservation interests of this area, and determine whether any such effects may be significant.\r\n\r\nEnvironmental Statement Appendix 9." .
