_:f280b3248c01f4502ac25634fbce470a <http://schema.org/value> "Zostera plant density data" .
_:d5af9af764bf00fc5e611598da269710 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f280b3248c01f4502ac25634fbce470a <http://schema.org/value> "% of decayed blades" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:caf53e0131a35c77ee18b76926abfc3087a6e94f> <http://schema.org/description> "Zostera plant density data plus blades per plant, % of decayed blades and number of blades per plant recorded within 1m sq quadrats on the shallow middle and deepest parts of the bed. The survey work was carried out for the Helford Voluntary Marine Conservation Area Group, with funding from World Wildlife Fund for Nature UK and English Nature." .
_:f280b3248c01f4502ac25634fbce470a <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:caf53e0131a35c77ee18b76926abfc3087a6e94f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d5af9af764bf00fc5e611598da269710 .
_:d5af9af764bf00fc5e611598da269710 <http://schema.org/value> "Helford Voluntary Marine Conservation Area Group" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:caec65e0cf658845a4a844f8f81ae882d22a2097> <http://schema.org/description> "The environmental survey programme included a habitat investigation and environmental baseline sampling to determine presence of potential SAC features and baseline physico-chemical and biological conditions within the survey area. Potential areas of interest for the current study, when considering Annex 1 habitats, were submarine structures made by leaking gases." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:caec65e0cf658845a4a844f8f81ae882d22a2097> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c066c6479a29735e9b0e5ef996bb39ba .
