<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ca8acb1fbba44bc45fe3c61ed58b250e51c19541> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 49 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth \r\n(CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1996 along the Atlantic Meridional Transect (AMT) \r\nfrom the UK to the Falkland Islands. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the \r\nSeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. \r\nThe data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the Atlantic Meridional \r\nTransect (Phase 1) programme." .
