<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c9c39903cb40ab00b55b505e8368db59be18a5b8> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the survey was to:-\r\n• Identify the occurrence of Sabellaria spinulosa and, if present, describe the extent of development of\r\nreef communities likely to be of conservation importance;\r\n• Identify of other benthic habitats that might be sensitive to the construction and operation of a wind\r\nfarm;\r\n• Survey the seabed bathymetry\r\n• Collect geophysical data using a sub bottom profiler for seabed mapping geology\r\n• Collect sidescan sonar data for seabed mapping" .
