<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c88fec0fa64ceb7534495ba08edae512bd634a16> <http://schema.org/description> "Data provided by the Environment Agency to ISCZ for identification of highly mobile FOCI areas.\r\n \r\n Smelt are listed as a Species Feature of Conservation of Importance under the ecological network guidence and are a UKBAP Priority Species\r\n Species of principal importance for the purpose of conserving of biodiversity under the Natural Environment and Rural Communities Act 2006\r\n \r\n The data is available on request from the Environment agency charges may apply for comercial users\r\n \r\n JNCC and Natural England are licensed to use this data untill 17/11/2011" .
