<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c794abd7d2d9532d00c739e9f9041325371ac250> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October 1980. It incorporates profiles around moored instrument arrays in the Celtic Sea. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory as part of a density survey." .
