_:e4ed397600cf91703485b70bf139d42 <http://schema.org/value> "Irish Sea Zone" .
_:dc5d8a11b5d49b9563146ac322ed880a <http://schema.org/value> "OSIRIS Projects Ltd" .
_:dc5d8a11b5d49b9563146ac322ed880a <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:db43e27ab4683e99fe4df40a2d4a0854 <http://schema.org/value> "cable burial depth" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c75e4d57e43e58f19f71d2c58c2286bca3716c6f> <http://schema.org/description> "This report relates to seabed scour and cable burial monitoring that took place at the site of the Burbo Bank Offshore Wind Farm. Two relevant surveys have been undertaken: 1, a bathymetric survey by OSIRIS Projects Ltd to look at the success of rock dumping around turbine foundation bases; 2, a survey by CT Offshore to measure cable burial depth of all inter-array and export cables." .
