<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c6e7dee4e436351685f09d62d9b6b290f98f6751> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey carried out a cable route survey for Thanet Offshore Wind Ltd (TOW)\r\noff the coast of Kent. The object was to investigate a proposed cable route to the\r\nproposed Thanet Offshore Wind Farm (Thanet) site using single and multi-beam echo\r\nsounder, sidescan sonar, surface-tow boomer, and magnetometer equipment.\r\nPositioning control for the survey was the Fugro Starfix DGPS service." .
_:a77eb251129e11cb6369e8317ef9a6d7 <http://schema.org/value> "magnetometer equipment" .
