_:cd0fc81aa930751b669b59f75e0b8542 <http://schema.org/value> "Wash" .
_:e19c5abbc5f655b9e54e429528763b1f <http://schema.org/value> "sonar seabed survey" .
_:dec83754acdc2d319e5a37223a3e5293 <http://schema.org/value> "MT Højgaard" .
_:dec83754acdc2d319e5a37223a3e5293 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c528b67f93747b2f85e615232829909791ed4e95> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned by MT Højgaard in January 2011, to carry out a\r\npre-construction geophysical survey at the proposed Lincs offshore wind farm site,\r\nwhich lies approximately 8 - 12km off the Lincolnshire coast, between the River\r\nHumber and The Wash. The site is situated to the east of the existing Lynn and Inner\r\nDowsing wind farms. The survey was completed under Osiris Projects Terms and\r\nConditions and was carried out between 25th January 2011 and 12th February 2011.\r\nThe main objective was to undertake a complete sonar seabed survey (multibeam\r\necho sounder &amp; high frequency side scan sonar) of the entire wind farm site, which\r\nincluded a 250m ‘buffer’ around the designated boundary of the wind farm." .
_:cd0fc81aa930751b669b59f75e0b8542 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c5136100a56b282c29147305de17187ba2e96bff> <http://schema.org/description> "Arklow Energy Limited (AEL) commissioned four hydrographic surveys during Spring 2004, Autumn 2004, Spring 2005 and Autumn 2005. The reports feature results of hydrographic surveys around the cable route and turbine foundations. This note summarises the investigations undertaken during the Arklow EIA and bathymetric surveys around the wind turbines, to ascertain the characteristics of the Arklow bank and cross referencing the attributes to those of The Inner Gabbard and The Galloper banks. This will subsequently allow an insight into the potential impacts from placing turbine foundations and cables at Greater Gabbard." .
_:c8ce7d33222e4d046558013eb65bc84e <http://schema.org/name> "marine regions" .
_:c8ce7d33222e4d046558013eb65bc84e <http://schema.org/value> "Galloper banks" .
_:ed2df45f81b6edca5ac73cc3cc76866c <http://schema.org/value> "Arklow Energy Limited" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c5136100a56b282c29147305de17187ba2e96bff> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ed2df45f81b6edca5ac73cc3cc76866c <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:c8ce7d33222e4d046558013eb65bc84e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c8ce7d33222e4d046558013eb65bc84e <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard" .
