<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c4fffbe160c8685f49d6e7d4e2117990d34426cc> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during November 1978. It incorporates casts performed along the Ellett Line section (between the Anton Dohrn Seamount and Mull) in the North East Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
