_:f309a9c851087b488501de645854a994 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish Marine Biological Association" .
_:eab16017eea69baf55ebf6c7a80dd19 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:eab16017eea69baf55ebf6c7a80dd19 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:eab16017eea69baf55ebf6c7a80dd19 <http://schema.org/value> "Anton Dohrn seamount" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c3237788406fed67e43c81002c4085199c02db71> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 60 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates eastern parts of the Ellett Line section east of the Anton Dohrn seamount, CTD sections in the North Channel (Copeland-Portpatrick, Corsewall-Sanda and Kintyre-Antrim) between the mainland/Skye and the outer Hebrides and a section running NW from Lewis and across the Wyville Thomson Ridge. The data were collected during February and March of 1988. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association as part of the North Atlantic Norwegian Sea Exchange (NANSEN) project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c3237788406fed67e43c81002c4085199c02db71> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f309a9c851087b488501de645854a994 .
