<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c30c9a517da593a662339bf6d5bb2342af9331d2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a8c342c8226536fa0dc0a4e9d52e15e1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c30c9a517da593a662339bf6d5bb2342af9331d2> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in May 2018 by Orsted to carry out Geophysical and Benthic surveys at Horsea 03 Lots 5 and 8.\r\n The survey across the Lot 8 export route was completed under Bibby HydroMap's terms and conditions using MV Bibby Tethra, between 16th August and 3rd September 2018 with a 40m line spacing.\r\n The main objectives of the surveys were as follows: \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Cable route engineering\r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Geo-hazard assessment\r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Consenting requirements\r\n o Identifying archaeological restrictions\r\n o Identifying protected ecological habitats\r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Planning of Geotechnical investigations\r\n Ã¢?Â¢ UXO clearance for Geotechnical investigations\r\n This dataset comprises of the backscatter data across the survey area." .
_:a8c342c8226536fa0dc0a4e9d52e15e1 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:a8c342c8226536fa0dc0a4e9d52e15e1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
