<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2c86a047ca3e1a7e7e640b08038d69591461d2d> <http://schema.org/description> "The Herring Larval survey conducted by E.ON was undertaken to characterise herring spawning in the vicinity of the proposed Rampion development area. The survey methodology replicates that of the ICES International Herring Larval Survey. 23 stations were sampled in November 2014, December 2014 and January 2015 using a Gull VII high speed plankton sampler." .
_:e79e3cecd3d8262f4cf48038261fc446 <http://schema.org/value> "Gull VII high speed plankton sampler" .
_:cfec5121122b3f5967153bc39b98aba7 <http://schema.org/value> "ICES International Herring Larval Survey" .
