<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c269bdc8b58846ff1571ecb224d10398fbcdbd38> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d7fedde6a32e8786f61b9a68adf023bb .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c269bdc8b58846ff1571ecb224d10398fbcdbd38> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during December 1985. It incorporates CTD sections from Islay to the Shelf Break, Mull to Jura, radiating from Islay (NW, W and SW) plus a survey of the North Channel and Clyde Sea. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
