<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c15b386661a61f7ac3a386e09581d1b6e24c3f05> <http://schema.org/description> "\"The environmental survey was required to provide baseline data relating to the physio-chemical and macrofaunal benthic environment. The environmental survey comprised ROV mounted camera work for the groundtruthing of sample locations and grab sampling for physio-chemical and\r\n biological analysis. In total, 9 stations were investigated, each with associated seabed photography and video footage.\"" .
