<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c115ec88ba56c300eb1f4b01a9769cae7534ddfe> <http://schema.org/description> "Licensed survey and excavation on this designated wreck site, undertaken by the Royal Yacht Mary Archaeological Expedition formed in 1982, and following work undertaken on the site by Chester BSAC (recorded separately). Coordinates given for the site are derived from the RCAHMW record of the site. The size of the study area is not known, and the depths given as min/max are derived from the ADU reports of their work on the site." .
