<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c0b14f069e4c779465218553992b405dd5674cd8> <http://schema.org/description> "This project relates to the Electromagnetic Fields and Marine Ecology monitoring surveys undertaken at the site of the Burbo Bank Offshore Wind Farm. It investigates the ability of elasmobranch fishes to detect electric fields equivalent to those produced by offshore wind farms. The results of this research will assist investigators in determining whether or not an ecological impact will occur." .
