<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bf6233936b8327659bfab12d8ee2f266e50a754a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 4 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1995 from stations in the Ria de Vigo between 42 - 43 N, 8.5 - 9.5 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Marine Research, Vigo as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bf6233936b8327659bfab12d8ee2f266e50a754a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
