<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be9ab19cab4aa2774ce0c757c7477f012a8c169d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bb9b8f0e8ead42f9397c5670eae8c61e .
_:aad7dc5ace128ad0302a98308ba6414d <http://schema.org/value> "SSE" .
_:bb9b8f0e8ead42f9397c5670eae8c61e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bb9b8f0e8ead42f9397c5670eae8c61e <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard" .
_:bb9b8f0e8ead42f9397c5670eae8c61e <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:aad7dc5ace128ad0302a98308ba6414d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
