<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be9ab19cab4aa2774ce0c757c7477f012a8c169d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:aad7dc5ace128ad0302a98308ba6414d <http://schema.org/value> "Adus DeepOcean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be9ab19cab4aa2774ce0c757c7477f012a8c169d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aad7dc5ace128ad0302a98308ba6414d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be9ab19cab4aa2774ce0c757c7477f012a8c169d> <http://schema.org/description> "SSE contracted Adus DeepOcean to perform a multibeam bathymetry and sidescan sonar survey of the Greater Gabbard Offshore windfarm.\r\n\r\nArea to be surveyed for this project comprised all 140 turbines and inter-array cables, which are split into two sites and encompass an area of approximately 146 km2.\r\n\r\nThe survey requirements comprised the acquisition of acoustic data along cable routes, around\r\nstructures and other subsea features with the following coverage:\r\n\r\n50m either side of inter array cable routes;\r\n\r\n50m either side of concrete mattresses;\r\n\r\nA boxed area 0f 90x180meters around each monopile\r\n\r\n50m radius around each OSP (where vessel access permits);20m either side of inter array cable routes in the region of the Inner Gabbard and Galloper sandbanks." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be8699d6e3fc6dcebdd37e3fa0d43c4335bd9967> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:adc5e6d7880fa6382c707e7e9d126bb .
_:f407fbf0e1e0ea2ff5f6f0f41273e3a6 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
_:adc5e6d7880fa6382c707e7e9d126bb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be8699d6e3fc6dcebdd37e3fa0d43c4335bd9967> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic monitoring of the sea bed adjacent to the fish farm as a requirement of the CAR licence for the site. Grab samples collected in proximity to the farm and at two reference locations. Samples analysed for: benthos, redox, psa, carbon." .
_:f407fbf0e1e0ea2ff5f6f0f41273e3a6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
