_:d7392aed8779f02b91c366bbb8f5f3bd <http://schema.org/value> "benthic sampling" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:be356139923b143c9e18e774addb05caddfbd76f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b657d0e0af755db827e421b060f8de90 .
_:d7392aed8779f02b91c366bbb8f5f3bd <http://schema.org/value> "particle size analysis" .
_:b657d0e0af755db827e421b060f8de90 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
