<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bcefef62b2d5179336b2de93ed41145b6edac647> <http://schema.org/description> "EMU was commisioned by Offshore Wind Power and Amec Wind in 2001 to carry out a geophysical work at two proposed wind farm sites, Lynn and Inner DowsingIt involved the collection of benthic grab samples and the use of a range of sampling techniques for assessment. Samples were collected for analysis of benthic invertebrates and particle size and the echo-plus system was also employed to assess seabed type." .
