_:b481967a224393515c81fdb02e3cbdb6 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc3db500c7c966c343cc1c9910632ee7cf43e2b8> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 4 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically South East of the Santo Antao ridge, from October to December of 1969. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the National Institute of Oceanography." .
_:b3616b630779238d5154e894106f334d <http://schema.org/value> "Orsted" .
_:b3616b630779238d5154e894106f334d <http://schema.org/value> "Bibby HydroMap" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc3b024ba16a11745499d231d62e44e26f072feb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b3616b630779238d5154e894106f334d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c63c0f6bc70dc140595d5d007fec1fac <http://schema.org/value> "Horsea 03 Lots 5" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc3b024ba16a11745499d231d62e44e26f072feb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c63c0f6bc70dc140595d5d007fec1fac .
_:b3616b630779238d5154e894106f334d <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc3b024ba16a11745499d231d62e44e26f072feb> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in May 2018 by Orsted to carry out Geophysical and Benthic surveys at Horsea 03 Lots 5 and 8. \r\n The survey across the Lot 8 export route was completed under Bibby HydroMap's terms and conditions using MV Bibby Tethra, between 16th August and 3rd September 2018 with a 40m line spacing. \r\n The main objectives of the surveys were as follows: \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Cable route engineering \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Geo-hazard assessment \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Consenting requirements \r\n o Identifying archaeological restrictions \r\n o Identifying protected ecological habitats \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Planning of Geotechnical investigations \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ UXO clearance for Geotechnical investigations \r\n This dataset comprises of the SSS data across the survey area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc3b024ba16a11745499d231d62e44e26f072feb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b3616b630779238d5154e894106f334d .
