_:ee2399d4ccb59c9e1c0bc02fdddaa95c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbd805719ad64fc70221bd13774ba1a2786257bc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a236a254352133eb0c2e58c1611530ba .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbd805719ad64fc70221bd13774ba1a2786257bc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ee2399d4ccb59c9e1c0bc02fdddaa95c .
_:f0514c7257d8a7b79d9606b7c4d2e623 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbd805719ad64fc70221bd13774ba1a2786257bc> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the current study was to initiate site condition monitoring (SCM) of the inshore sublittoral sediment habitats of the cSAC. This was done to establish a baseline biological dataset that would facilitate the assessment of the condition of the inshore sublittoral sediment habitats in the future and to allow a judgement to be formed on the current condition of these habitats. The approach taken to achieve these aims was to perform an extensive dropdown video survey of the biotopes (habitats and their associated species) of the cSAC, concentrating on the shallow inshore sediments. Characterisation of the subsurface fauna and sediment composition of the main sediment biotopes was performed by means of grab sampling. Detailed surveying of the sea bed and subsurface communities at selected maerl sites was carried out using diving techniques." .
_:ad58ee371b3db56694120475a0b30581 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbce4cec58bfc678ba50d02fd6b023a188657d7e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbce4cec58bfc678ba50d02fd6b023a188657d7e> <http://schema.org/description> "2017 Anglia topographic dataset from the Channel Coastal Observatory Catalogue (number of records: 132" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbce4cec58bfc678ba50d02fd6b023a188657d7e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ad58ee371b3db56694120475a0b30581 .
_:ad58ee371b3db56694120475a0b30581 <http://schema.org/value> "Channel Coastal Observatory" .
_:ad58ee371b3db56694120475a0b30581 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b8a8a2e50d1dd6d3771a815cd5c8c9b0 <http://schema.org/value> "Kent" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbbee5d9937fb962ab4d289e4359c87668ce720b> <http://schema.org/description> "Phase 1 of the construction of an offshore wind farm situated midway between the Kent and Essex coastlines and more than 20km from each shore. Phase 1 comprises 175 turbines, 2 offshore substations, and 4 export cables to the shore. This particular part of the project is a synopsis report of all of the marine archaeological and environmental finds reported to the London Array Protocol for Archaeological Discoveries (PAD) from 2011 to 2015 during the construction and post-construction phases of the windfarm." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbbee5d9937fb962ab4d289e4359c87668ce720b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b8a8a2e50d1dd6d3771a815cd5c8c9b0 .
