<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbae6bed6637d7ace2f5acf80c39650045e365ea> <http://schema.org/description> "Series of University of Plymouth surveys undertaken in Falmouth. These surveys were conducted in response to proposed dredging activities to deepen the shipping channel. The surveys in this series involve towed underwater video systems and sediment cores collected by divers." .
