<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb0d3b8cc80b91e4b8656017fa1285aaeb4b5fb0> <http://schema.org/description> "Sabellaria alevolata presence records from a study of larval settlement and metamorphosis of two gregarious sabellariid polychaetes. Note grid reference or latitude/longitude is not included in the paper so the grid reference has been estimated as the centre of the shore in Widemouth Bay." .
