<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b70d5da8ed1407db994f332ea745bb230ffb6333> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:cdea689a39313432df8c4215867f9d88 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish legislation" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b70d5da8ed1407db994f332ea745bb230ffb6333> <http://schema.org/description> "This layer shows the distribution of polygon records of subtidal sand gravels, a Biodiversity Action Plan Habitat.\r\n \r\n This layer forms one of a set of data layers created for the Defra MB0102 contract. This work will support the delivery of a network of Marine Protected Areas as required to meet existing international and national obligations and commitments, including Marine Conservation Zones (MCZs), a new measure to be delivered as part of the Marine and Coastal Access Bill, and equivalent measures under Scottish legislation. The availability of these data layers will also be of importance in underpinning Marine Planning (e.g. licensing) in our marine area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b70d5da8ed1407db994f332ea745bb230ffb6333> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:deee2791dec71fd3eb8a234b156a4297 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b707988ec25717c2b47d58d4980c3dbf9a37d65c> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys of South Devon including Axmouth, Dawlish, Sidmouth, Teign Estuary and Torbay. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Axmouth littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Dawlish littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Sidmouth littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Teign Estuary littoral survey and 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Torbay littoral survey." .
