<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b7066f36cb55c2b900462b575c9cf9a394498183> <http://schema.org/description> "In order to monitor the abundance and composition of fish and epi-benthic species within and adjacent to the Ormonde offshore wind farm, otter and beam trawl surveys were undertaken during autumn 2013. . The results of the second year of post-construction surveys have been compared with those obtained prior to construction in April 2009 and October 2009, and post-construction in October 2012 and April 2013." .
