<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b61f9b6752b2fda02c8203217c3e48dd72126a23> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1a09c15f402548a4667c399b41ce1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b61f9b6752b2fda02c8203217c3e48dd72126a23> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bc7ef7dd8d60e3005f820837afd50717 .
