<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b55701701de29e5b3d832d0c1c36d727d85e0e2d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f824673919a9df914fd4dec0eb911fe1 <http://schema.org/name> "person" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b55701701de29e5b3d832d0c1c36d727d85e0e2d> <http://schema.org/description> "The Holderness Fishing Industry Group (HFIG) conducted a survey in 2017 investigating the short-term effects of the construction of the Westermost Rough offshore windfarm on the commercially important crustacean stocks in the area. This survey supports the research undertaken by HFIG in 2013 (baseline survey (Roach &amp; Cohen, 2013)) and 2015 (first year post build of the wind farm (Roach &amp; Cohen, 2015)), forming part of the continuing study of the effects of wind farm construction on commercial shellfish stocks." .
_:bb731c630a97e5402aed1f32c071332d <http://schema.org/value> "Holderness Fishing Industry Group" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b55701701de29e5b3d832d0c1c36d727d85e0e2d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f824673919a9df914fd4dec0eb911fe1 .
