_:f253aa47eb9ccb61d45fbfa418df4f5 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewables" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b54b59c6d7851d0a7231453165c6841790be0f92> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ba94acdd60d6c81fb3aff5b65f30d797 .
_:f253aa47eb9ccb61d45fbfa418df4f5 <http://schema.org/value> "UK Hydrographic Office" .
_:f253aa47eb9ccb61d45fbfa418df4f5 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:f253aa47eb9ccb61d45fbfa418df4f5 <http://schema.org/value> "EMU/Osiris" .
_:ba94acdd60d6c81fb3aff5b65f30d797 <http://schema.org/value> "Elevation difference plots" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b54b59c6d7851d0a7231453165c6841790be0f92> <http://schema.org/description> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) was commissioned by Centrica Renewables in September 2007 to complete an investigation into the form and function of Race Bank, and surrounding seabed features. This study has been completed to support the coastal processes investigations undertaken as part of the Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) for the proposed Race Bank Offshore Wind Farm (OWF). Historical bathymetry data obtained from the UK Hydrographic Office (UKHO) (scanned at high resolution) has been provided, along with 2006 bathymetry data obtained from EMU/Osiris. Elevation difference plots have also been provided. All of this data can be viewed in a GIS." .
_:ba94acdd60d6c81fb3aff5b65f30d797 <http://schema.org/value> "2006 bathymetry data" .
_:ba94acdd60d6c81fb3aff5b65f30d797 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b54b59c6d7851d0a7231453165c6841790be0f92> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f253aa47eb9ccb61d45fbfa418df4f5 .
