<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b4d00cbecef95099772fa669f2bccc8b227013e9> <http://schema.org/description> "New records of NIS made between 1st January 2003 and 31st December 2014 for UK Celtic seas and UK greater North sea. Data collated from multiple sources for use in the MSFD D2 UK assessment." .
