<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b42fa5d3ab2aa658f98239914088c23fa224111f> <http://schema.org/description> "The object of the environmental baseline survey was to acquire sufficient seabed information at 20 stations with which to establish the sediment physico-chemical characteristics and benthic community composition within the proposed platform locations. The results will be used for future monitoring during the life of the Clair Field." .
