<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b3cf73a2f2b7527bf174d8937c0b7594401f84ec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f9916ea838b398a9efb780d0a10b87fb <http://schema.org/name> "person" .
_:cf10d7cff966b78d2f450b61d6240410 <http://schema.org/value> "Resurgam Project" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b3cf73a2f2b7527bf174d8937c0b7594401f84ec> <http://schema.org/description> "Work carried out by a team of divers led by M.Bowyer between 1999(?)-2006 (the precise dates of the Resurgam Project are not known). The work comprised monitoring the condition of the site, and relplacement of anodes to halt corrosion of the vessel. A seabed deposit sample was also taken on behalf of the School of Ocean Sciences, University of Bangor. The Resurgam Project seems to have run in parallel with ADU monitoring and the ADU-led Submap project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b3cf73a2f2b7527bf174d8937c0b7594401f84ec> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f9916ea838b398a9efb780d0a10b87fb .
