<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2ca4a7b1ca026728b5c6d095cee898af46c2a6e> <http://schema.org/description> "This survey was conducted by the Field Studies Council Oil Pollution Research Unit for the Nature Conservancy Council during April, May and July 1986. The project aimed to review the available information and to conduct field work. The report contains site descriptions and locations as well as species descriptions, lists and abundances." .
