<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2775ca33b22205c1c77c7cc5b21aefc31088711> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2775ca33b22205c1c77c7cc5b21aefc31088711> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd (EGSi) was contracted to undertake the third post-construction marine geophysical and benthic ecology survey of the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (L&amp;ID) offshore wind farm sites and export cable route corridors. This document relates to Phase 2 of the survey, benthic ecology. A habitat and benthic sampling programme was carried out including the acquisition, analysis and interpretation of benthic sample data collected during the survey. Field operations were undertaken by EGSi on the vessel MV Wessex Explorer in October 2011, assisted by Benthic Solutions Limited, who subsequently carried out the analysis and reporting on behalf of EGSi." .
_:fa744dfde565e9b42e5909d46343236a <http://schema.org/value> "Benthic Solutions Limited" .
_:fa744dfde565e9b42e5909d46343236a <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
