<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b269c95cf35193a6e6a73338c63a13bd5c101a42> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during April 1976. It incorporates casts performed within the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section in the North East Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
