<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:affdae380250648663cd366a24fb1461d79585c7> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the existing commercial fisheries at the Gunfleet Sands 2 offshore wind farm. This took into account DEFRA, MCEU, CEFAS, DTI and BWEA guidelines and recommendations. Various methods were used to gather data for this study including obtaining MFA Fisheries Statistics, Satellite tracking and surveillance, radar surveys and consultation with local fishermen and KESFC officers." .
_:c08bd61b200c868fad5bad5b018c88b8 <http://schema.org/value> "radar surveys" .
