<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aff1f93a6cab85b5a89c98947a9f1b6d5c677137> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 22 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Ellett Line stations from the Anton Dohrn Seamount eastwards and the Cirolana Deep region of the Wyville Thomson Ridge. The data were collected during May 1979. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:de2e0930ef7868944021ba9d702be0e8 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish Marine Biological Association" .
