_:a1513676c30f43daeaabe78ed8e5ee9e <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Farm" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af75557c641220256f5f1cd4c0527222852f3ca7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a1513676c30f43daeaabe78ed8e5ee9e .
