<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af55b52ed18775817f01eb6aaa868baa265e5ec6> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July 1986. It incorporates deep CTD profiles on the Porcupine Abyssal Plain plus CTD sections from Anglesey to the Isle of Man, Isle of Man to Burrow Head and Isle of Man to St. Bees Head. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
