<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af377153d132fc05efe7a964fb0af337f8d6a549> <http://schema.org/description> "HiDef Aerial Surveying Limited (HiDef) has been commissioned by NatureScot (NatS) to undertake digital video aerial surveys of marine birds, in particular wintering waterfowl, across the Solway Firth Special Protection Area (SPA) (NatS zone) in February 2021" .
