<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af34df45f8f25f307a0f03e3477f8aeba9c3bee9> <http://schema.org/description> "Author: ABPmer This report examines the coastal regime at the site of the Gunfleet Sands 2 Offshore Wind Farm. A baseline description of each of the processes is provided along with a description to any change in these processes once the wind farm scheme is in place. The method of investigation is based on a combination of qualitative assessment of site data, empirical evaluation and detailed numerical modelling output to define the magnitude and significance of any changes to the coastal process regime." .
_:f90095a6f3fddc5f780f341b95b07c1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
