<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aec1fd4f3f39452dbf412e794c09376347c3e13a> <http://schema.org/description> "This polygon show a derrogation are within a CFP cod closure.\r\n The cod closure prohibits the use of demersal trawls, seine or similar towed net, any gill net, trammel net and tangle net or similar static net or any fishing gear comprising hooks, between 14th February and 30th April (Council Regulation EC No. 43/2009 Annex III Point 8.0). \r\n \r\n The derrogation allows the use of demersal otter trawls in the same time period provided that no other fishing gear is retained on board, that the net mesh size is either 70-79mm or 80-99mm and that no individual mesh size is greater than 300mm (ABPMer, 2010)." .
