<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ac8327aa0b4ea3b55903be3f13cb153bf6594f0f> <http://schema.org/description> "The Unexploded Ordnance (UXO) Threat &amp; Risk Assessment for the Centrica round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development. The purpose of this assessment was to provide a detailed UXO RiskAssessment for Area B (the southeast area of the main array site) by analysing the likely threat items, the determinants of their location and the proposed activities on the Area that could encounter, or initiate these threat items. This assessment was carried out by 6 ALPHA Associates. \r\nCorresponding Centrica Document No: R3-D-EN-013-0158-000000-003 \r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title: Irish Sea UXO Threat and Risk Assessment \r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1. Documents (.pdf), 2. GIS dataset (.shp)" .
