<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:abeb83c64e63752346cac56c97b2c61e9e09acbd> <http://schema.org/description> "Various Calibration certificates prepared by Svend Ole Hansen ApS, Campbell Scientific Limited and GE Druck for the Greater Gabbard Meteorological Mast in 2005. Svend Ole Hansen ApS prepared Certificates for Calibration of Cup Anemometer which were issued on 11th, 12th and 13th July 2005, Campbell Scientific undertook a Temperature Probe Calibration on 21st June 2005 and GE Drucks undertook a Ambient Conditions and Performance Data Calibration on 25th January 2005." .
