<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:abb3ad2d196755f3089378779134eccc832166de> <http://schema.org/description> "Records obtained from SEA6 report \r\n ASSESSMENT OF THE STATUS OF HORSE MUSSEL\r\n (MODIOLUS MODIOLUS) BEDS IN THE IRISH SEA OFF\r\n NW ANGLESEY\r\n E. Ivor S. Rees\r\n March 2005\r\n (Revised August 2005)\r\n \r\n Data set obtained from BGS SEA data portal in 2011.\r\n The data shows the locations of various Horse Mussel (Modiolus modiolus) beds\r\n These beds are a Habitat feature of Conservation Importance under the Ecological Network Guidance, an Annex 1 habitat under the Habitats Directive, a Biodiversity Action Plan Habitat and feature on the OSPAR lists. \r\n Data is publically available." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:abb3ad2d196755f3089378779134eccc832166de> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b18954e19b85444cd83abc34b3089310 .
