_:ba3bccb981761bd53278dbfcf3a28d84 <http://schema.org/value> "Plymouth" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aaa056f18595ca0d8cf9b9d3eebcfeb9114d015f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b14edeaa96e288703a06bcd1507de1f3 .
_:ba3bccb981761bd53278dbfcf3a28d84 <http://schema.org/value> "E1 station" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aaa056f18595ca0d8cf9b9d3eebcfeb9114d015f> <http://schema.org/description> "Mesozooplankton and planktonic stages of young fish data collected from E1 station situated 22 nm southwest of Plymouth in an area of mixing between coastal and channel water." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aaa056f18595ca0d8cf9b9d3eebcfeb9114d015f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
