_:eeeb63b9703428ff35d85d5d08ffe83e <http://schema.org/value> "NaREC" .
_:eab99cf969525146f7937d7d18e75d08 <http://schema.org/value> "Blyth" .
_:f8a7853a0f187f52dc13bbfd3191de08 <http://schema.org/value> "Unexploded Ordnance" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aa78a00e0a5ca6fdeaee4c380427804049a37cf8> <http://schema.org/description> "Items of Unexploded Ordnance (UXO) are regularly encountered within the North Sea and rarely\r\nbecome inert or lose their high explosives effectiveness with age. There is therefore, a risk that\r\nUXO could be encountered at the Offshore Wind Demonstrator Site, Blyth.\r\nCathie Associates Limited, on behalf of NaREC, has commissioned 6 Alpha Associates Limited to\r\nconduct a detailed UXO desk based study for this wind farm development." .
_:eab99cf969525146f7937d7d18e75d08 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
