<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a9b51ba700b86e50879ca74eeae34d6b7d394334> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology (WA) was commissioned by Fugro EMU Limited to complete an archaeological assessment of geophysical data acquired over the Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm and export cable route. WA was only required to assess data at the locations of 182 geophysical anomalies and historic records interpreted in the 2009 geophysical assessment as listed in the Written Scheme of Investigation (WA 2009)." .
