<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7fb277431fea18755200d5b0772b53088766fa7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f1233fd98d380b0a455d37cc76857a48 .
_:eacea38e36aa525c1ae74588b666c3a0 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:f583aec5118c144976d69f88a043848d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f583aec5118c144976d69f88a043848d <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
_:f583aec5118c144976d69f88a043848d <http://schema.org/value> "benthic macrofauna" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7f133e02a9ac238330f423f52656901b013f1bd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7f133e02a9ac238330f423f52656901b013f1bd> <http://schema.org/description> "The principal objectives of this study were to provide broad scale mapping of the physical conditions \r\nand associated biological communities within the proposed development site and close environs and\r\nto provide baseline information on the benthic macrofauna for subsequent monitoring programmes\r\nshould the development be licensed." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7f133e02a9ac238330f423f52656901b013f1bd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f583aec5118c144976d69f88a043848d .
