_:ddaa4ad8397609bb9df7236e79041de3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ddaa4ad8397609bb9df7236e79041de3 <http://schema.org/value> "Iberian Peninsula" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7db62fbdaa82922465662618f05809a0abeb7e1> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 8 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1998 from stations off the coast of the Iberian Peninsula. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
_:e1e652aed0a6bfc16767aaadbabcd0ea <http://schema.org/value> "Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research" .
