_:d7c9d88f6722eb1f3b7d633e50b47b0a <http://schema.org/value> "Porcupine Sea Bight area" .
_:d7c9d88f6722eb1f3b7d633e50b47b0a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
