_:fd9a132b3c7c26eae27ea454bb7d89f8 <http://schema.org/value> "Norfolk Vanguard" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a4cd1b48735a1ea397b852732b784b23be413924> <http://schema.org/description> "Norfolk Vanguard is a proposed offshore wind farm located in the southern North Sea, with a total installed capacity of up to 1800 megawatts. The project is located approximately 72km from shore at its nearest point, adjacent to sister project Norfolk Vanguard. The offshore cables will be brought ashore at Happisburgh South. A desk based assessment, assessment of marine geophysical data and geoarchaeological assessment of vibrocores were undertaken by Wessex Archaeology as part of the process of Environment Impact Assessment led by Royal HaskoningDHV." .
_:c690b0b2779fe3ecfc889a204eaf1801 <http://schema.org/value> "Happisburgh South" .
