<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a3a7210fc4157c85725bdad5406dde3746cdf160> <http://schema.org/description> "Insight Marine Projects Ltd has been contracted by the University of Exeter (Renewable Energy Group) to supply hydrographic survey services on the FaB Test wave energy site, located 5km offshore from Falmouth Bay, UK.\r\nThe purpose of the geophysical survey was to acquire data to provide site operators and device developers a baseline dataset which encompasses the entire FaB Test site and will assist with current and future project planning and execution.\r\n\r\nThe primary objectives of the survey are:\r\n- Multibeam bathymetry survey\r\n- Sub-bottom profiling\r\n- Side Scan Sonar\r\n- Sediment sampling" .
_:ee4b756aef928b712c75c6a2344dfcad <http://schema.org/value> "Sediment sampling" .
_:ee4b756aef928b712c75c6a2344dfcad <http://schema.org/value> "Sub-bottom profiling" .
_:f66dc23f3e4fc4000e222c32c2ed4f35 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
