<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a373bb1a972e27d962bb9ec76d5fd744ec7400d8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a16615ea9d90e4e5840bcd9c5e0cc029 .
_:aa134d973254d305b50a001a7b15e863 <http://schema.org/value> "Herne Bay" .
_:aa134d973254d305b50a001a7b15e863 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a373bb1a972e27d962bb9ec76d5fd744ec7400d8> <http://schema.org/description> "Emu Ltd was commissioned by GREP to undertake a hydrographic and geophysical survey of a\r\nproposed wind farm site and associated cable route located at Kentish Flats in the Thames Estuary,\r\nadjacent to Herne Bay. In addition to this some bathymetric data was also gathered over the adjacent\r\nprominent features of Middle Sand and Pan Sand. A small but detailed topographic survey was also\r\nrequired in the vicinity of the proposed cable landfall site." .
_:a16615ea9d90e4e5840bcd9c5e0cc029 <http://schema.org/value> "Emu Ltd" .
_:a16615ea9d90e4e5840bcd9c5e0cc029 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:aa134d973254d305b50a001a7b15e863 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames Estuary" .
_:aa134d973254d305b50a001a7b15e863 <http://schema.org/value> "Kentish Flats" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a373bb1a972e27d962bb9ec76d5fd744ec7400d8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:aa134d973254d305b50a001a7b15e863 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a16615ea9d90e4e5840bcd9c5e0cc029 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
