_:d496a8f13e6b3b24133f0cff42adb86e <http://schema.org/value> "Weybourne" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a2cb00326e33db3bd2b887feba557d60476b6c0b> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines various surveys that were carried out at Weybourne and Muckleburgh. Wildlife surveys of the Great crested newt, badger, water vole, birds and reptiles were carried out as well as habitat surveys consisting of desktop, habitat and botanical surveys." .
_:d496a8f13e6b3b24133f0cff42adb86e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a2cb00326e33db3bd2b887feba557d60476b6c0b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:d496a8f13e6b3b24133f0cff42adb86e <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
