<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a2a61f7657076358a0b0e6dd87bd7de063925e9a> <http://schema.org/description> "Journal paper detailing a laboratory experiment looking at the effect of cockle (Cerastoderma edule) density on near-bed dynamics and the stability of cohesive muddy sediments. The paper looks at the effects of cockles on near-bed flow, sediment erodability and cockle valve adduction." .
