<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a235641a03afe1085e40c3e899c3255617c73f5c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 18 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in July 1995 from stations in the north east Atlantic between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Hamburg, Department of Chemistry as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:ca8f0c86a1cdaef11359edf333acf364 <http://schema.org/value> "Department of Chemistry" .
