<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a14de4715d7e13f62da17f8eab958ea25e527093> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c64e665f34e5b36b94c533f49b9bdac7 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a14de4715d7e13f62da17f8eab958ea25e527093> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d4455b4cfdc606af2bfff0b4d42fd225 .
