<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0abbda4411004617a48ab8c4beed7c4bb9713e1> <http://schema.org/description> "Results from a variety of marine surveys carried out by MBA members and the MBS (Marine Biology Society at Plymouth University) once a month. Started in 2010 as a members group called SHARC (Surveying Habitats and Researching Coasts) and has been recently renamed to 'MBA members survey' for the second phase.\r\n Includes box cores on sandy shores, intertidal mud flat surveys, invasive species timed species searches (TSS), Intertidal fish surveys with push and seine nets, Crassostrea gigas transect surveys, Corella eumyota TSS, and Undaria pinnatifida TSS.\r\n Includes photographs of locations, species found and members carrying out the survey." .
_:e47bdcce724118cff5f138b3f704ba18 <http://schema.org/value> "Corella eumyota" .
