<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a076d7b6cf04256f2d8d1772c1e7b85e96edf23a> <http://schema.org/description> "HiDef Aerial Surveying Limited (HiDef) was been commissioned by NatureScot to undertake digital video aerial surveys of wintering waterbirds across the Moray Firth pSPA between January 2020 and March 2020." .
