<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9fb64fc644ce1b50b65c35ea60ee6955079af057> <http://schema.org/description> "A collection of Non-Native Species sightings from Cornwall and Isles of Scilly Federation for Biological Recorders (CISFBR). The species listed are Bonnemaisonia hamifera, Grateloupia turuturu, Sargassum muticum, Undaria pinnatifida, Spartina anglica, Asterocarpa humilis, Styela clava, Hesperibalanus fallax, Watersipora subatra, Caprella mutica, Diadumene lineata, Crassostrea, Crepidula fornicata and Ficopomatus enigmaticus." .
_:faed3f83af6f81e9051410bd183fdea8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f142ff849485c2f71f0807417d7dfcb0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:cde7a38d71181370266312e9833bb990 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:cde7a38d71181370266312e9833bb990 <http://schema.org/value> "Celtic Array Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9faa5aa54e717e34845f6304ded3a87562d00bde> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f142ff849485c2f71f0807417d7dfcb0 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9faa5aa54e717e34845f6304ded3a87562d00bde> <http://schema.org/description> "Celtic Array Ltd previously contracted Halcrow Group Ltd (Halcrow) in October 2012 to undertake a horizontal direction drill- HDD Feasibility Study to assist with the development of the proposed offshore Rhiannon wind farm in the ISZ – Irish Sea Zone. In January 2013, Celtic Array requested Halcrow to undertake a review of the preliminary geophysical survey and drawings which were produced by EGS (International) Ltd in Autumn/Winter 2012 during the marine geophysical survey of the proposed Rhiaanon offshore windfarm on behalf of Celtic Array. Halcrow was to review the relevance of this Geophysical survey drawings to the Bull Bay site (7a) and Site 12 landfall areas. Halcrow Group Ltd prepared this Technical Note in accordance with the instructions of Celtic Array Ltd for their sole and specific use. Any other persons who use any information contained herein do so at their own risk. Corresponding Centrica Document No: SE-D-EN-046-0117-501037-001 Available dataset : GIS in Shapefile formats ; AutoCAD data in dwg format (linked to R3 2012 Halcrow HDD Feasibility Study), reports and drawings in pdf formats" .
_:cde7a38d71181370266312e9833bb990 <http://schema.org/value> "Halcrow Group Ltd" .
_:faed3f83af6f81e9051410bd183fdea8 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:cde7a38d71181370266312e9833bb990 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
