<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f4fb0eb258b3c64974070c9e156ff493372a9df> <http://schema.org/description> "Two meteorological monitoring masts are located on Shell Flats in Morecambe Bay, UK. The systems were originally installed in June 2002 in order to measure and record wind, pressure, rainfall, temperature, humidity and solar radiation, as part of ongoing investigations into a proposed offshore wind farm. The instruments are connected to Campbell loggers (CR10x), and GSM data telemetry systems. The masts were refurbished in 2011. This package contains the met mast datasets, both raw and processed. Other documents associated with the mast are also provided, including calibration certificates, assembly drawings, photographs, service reports, sensor configuration diagrams and a refurbishment installation report." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f4fb0eb258b3c64974070c9e156ff493372a9df> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cd3be459eb6421406472b5921bd4758e .
