<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9e7a5643c53b03e3db1026a2aef50b36a739f844> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey carried out a geophysical survey for DONG Energy Burbo Bank\r\nExtension (UK) Ltd in the Irish Sea; the objective was to investigate the proposed\r\nBurbo Bank Extension Area using single beam and multi-beam echo sounders, sidescan\r\nsonar, pinger, sparker and dual magnetometer equipment. Positioning control for the\r\nsurvey was the Fugro Starfix DGPS Service." .
