<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9df40ff9b4306872b7ff3a6fa03a32d826476f78> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1986. It incorporates CTD profiles collected as part of a study of upwelling and filament development off the Iberian coast. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
