_:e4a42df5cef817505f35851ea20f26bb <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:e4a42df5cef817505f35851ea20f26bb <http://schema.org/value> "Clyde Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9da2e1b69640e177175204b8751f92029565b0ea> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 119 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Ellett Line section between the Anton Dohrn Seamount and Mull; a CTD survey from the mainland to Lewis; a CTD survey of the shelf west of Islay, the North Channel and the Clyde Sea. The data were collected during January of 1987. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
