_:d6af40e49d72bf11198ca58a23b08fcd <http://schema.org/value> "acoustic backscatter intensity" .
_:bf5075b8c1ce81330adfce5d4604b0e3 <http://schema.org/value> "RWE Npower Renewables Limited" .
