<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:999f0d658291b56a66b87f852b5320be4c8517a4> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the Environmental Impact Assessment carried out at the site of the Kentish Flats offshore wind farm. The Environmental Impact Assessment reviews many factors that may affect or be affected as a result of the construction of the Kentish Flats offshore wind farm." .
