<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9949164b01617aa8abf7f1fc8afe08a6e57a0d2b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during December 1994. It consists of one profile off Sellafield and four on the shelf west of Scotland. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
