_:da06ba00def02ca37fb3f36e8bee8951 <http://schema.org/value> "East Irish Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:98a0925519e35c4dbd67fa37c5da2478211e6c03> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:da06ba00def02ca37fb3f36e8bee8951 .
