_:f152d525315715eb7f99824ff5d09e0f <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:98752e7537aa2273af9f087c9e9e30a0eb73977a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c465aaee608b2eb7663ca0bdf4d7e79b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:98752e7537aa2273af9f087c9e9e30a0eb73977a> <http://schema.org/description> "To acquire high quality biological data of suitable resolution to characterise and work towards a baseline for future monitoring of the sediment rock broadscale habitats and Habitat Features of Conservation interest (FOCI) found inside the MCZ and adjacent un-designated areas of the MCZ. These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
