_:b1f77ca30fc80dae0224308321ca7d4f <http://schema.org/value> "CCW" .
_:f367053232fb641f23c88ce2cc73fc34 <http://schema.org/value> "Ramsey Sound" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:984855caffbecefe4a87168cc45cc65ca47ceccc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:984855caffbecefe4a87168cc45cc65ca47ceccc> <http://schema.org/description> "Following 12 months of bird observations for the whole of Ramsey Sound, CCW requested that further survey should concentrate on the Deltastream deployment site." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:984855caffbecefe4a87168cc45cc65ca47ceccc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1f77ca30fc80dae0224308321ca7d4f .
