<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:982bc9a8d5da72964dc469018a30a4f9d75e2dc7> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 54 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the north-east coast and Dogger Bank, during June and July of 1999. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
