<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:972f76ffded51827543ec8d19fda948d818ca30e> <http://schema.org/description> "This data layer shows the extent of an Environment Agency No Go area within the Dee Estuary, this will now have transfered to the North West Inshore Fisheries and Conservation Authority (NWIFCA)" .
