<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96ce7fdc8f3fd66b5229f0829f697ef2a836f1bb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d3311015a61ea9f6a728c4950f2b8892 .
_:d3311015a61ea9f6a728c4950f2b8892 <http://schema.org/value> "Sheringham Shoal" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96ce7fdc8f3fd66b5229f0829f697ef2a836f1bb> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the navigational risk assessment undertaken at the site of the Sheringham Shoal offshore wind farm. The scope of work for the study was to make a fit-for-purpose navigational risk assessment for the project, recommend minimum hub clearance, recommend a safe and cost effective arrangement of navigational aids and risk reducing measures, to recommend the definition of appropriate safety and exclusion zones and to outline SAR(Search and Rescue)plans." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96ce7fdc8f3fd66b5229f0829f697ef2a836f1bb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ee7e666131ccae9b4a370c0cc3d75320 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96b9f647bfe53c32282bae460f4547573c04e823> <http://schema.org/description> "Two consortia, Elsam A/S, ScottishPower Generation Ltd. and Eurus Energy Europe B.V. and DONG VE A/S and Statkraft are respectively planning to develop the West Duddon and Walney, Round 2 Wind farm sites. A bathymetric and geophysical survey is part of this planning process and OSAE Offshore Survey and Engineering Gesellschaft für Seevermessung mbH has been contracted to carry out such a survey." .
_:ee7e666131ccae9b4a370c0cc3d75320 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:a38cb5eb09c2e49ddd1426a3c3bb806f <http://schema.org/value> "ScottishPower Generation Ltd." .
_:a38cb5eb09c2e49ddd1426a3c3bb806f <http://schema.org/value> "Eurus Energy Europe B.V." .
_:ee7e666131ccae9b4a370c0cc3d75320 <http://schema.org/value> "Walney" .
