_:a38cb5eb09c2e49ddd1426a3c3bb806f <http://schema.org/value> "Elsam A/S" .
_:a38cb5eb09c2e49ddd1426a3c3bb806f <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:a38cb5eb09c2e49ddd1426a3c3bb806f <http://schema.org/value> "DONG VE A/S" .
