_:ee7e666131ccae9b4a370c0cc3d75320 <http://schema.org/value> "West Duddon" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96aaa54e34535b3d03588bda19174c55d0e52e68> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:eaf1b8849b68bcda60f5dfa134859fe5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96aaa54e34535b3d03588bda19174c55d0e52e68> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:eaf1b8849b68bcda60f5dfa134859fe5 .
_:eaf1b8849b68bcda60f5dfa134859fe5 <http://schema.org/name> "ecosystems" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96aaa54e34535b3d03588bda19174c55d0e52e68> <http://schema.org/description> "This report aims to provide an assessment of the benthic habitats and associated assemblages within and adjacent to the areas of potential impact resulting from the construction and of the WMR OWF." .
_:eaf1b8849b68bcda60f5dfa134859fe5 <http://schema.org/value> "benthic habitats" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9693e9d266461568f14a0c41a45a7bafb94a476b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9693e9d266461568f14a0c41a45a7bafb94a476b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:da1ad9ba4d4ad4661f4b23e02b03f5b6 .
_:da1ad9ba4d4ad4661f4b23e02b03f5b6 <http://schema.org/value> "RWE" .
_:da1ad9ba4d4ad4661f4b23e02b03f5b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9693e9d266461568f14a0c41a45a7bafb94a476b> <http://schema.org/description> "This series contains a selection of reports and graphics detailing the airborne noise modelling surveys and monitoring proposals developed for Atlantic Array Offshore Windfarm. Included are the three relevent annexs from the Environmental Statement providing, first, a discussion of airborne noise propagation in offshore environments and the models used in the assessment of piling and operational noise for the Atlantic Array offshore wind farm project, second, calculations of the prediction of piling noise effects associated with the construction of the Atlantic Array Offshore Wind Farm for 5 and 8 MW turbine layouts and, third, calculations of the prediction of operational noise effects associated with the operation of the Atlantic Array Offshore Wind Farm for which two layouts are considered, 240 x 5 MW wind turbine generators (WTGs) and 150 x 8 MW WTGs.\r\n In addition there is an internal RWE report on likely monitoring positions for assessing the impact of construction noise of the electrical substation and the Atlantic Array. Some of these positions were to be used as possible monitoring locations for operation noise of the Atlantic Array." .
_:da1ad9ba4d4ad4661f4b23e02b03f5b6 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:968a9c5897a20343aed4d6ebf99d9214f1efedda> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ba011bd1791959fcb37854fe853b009e .
_:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 <http://schema.org/value> "epibenthic trawl surveys" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:968a9c5897a20343aed4d6ebf99d9214f1efedda> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 <http://schema.org/value> "drop down video surveys" .
_:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 <http://schema.org/value> "benthic grab sampling" .
_:ba011bd1791959fcb37854fe853b009e <http://schema.org/value> "marine communities" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:968a9c5897a20343aed4d6ebf99d9214f1efedda> <http://schema.org/description> "The EIA process for an offshore wind farm requires a full understanding of the marine\r\necology of the area which may be affected. This requires a full review of existing benthic\r\nsurvey data (marine ecology desk study) as well as benthic surveys of the wind farm site,\r\ncable routes and adjacent areas. For this site, surveying the offshore environment involved\r\nbenthic grab sampling and epibenthic trawl surveys, as well as drop down video surveys on\r\nrocky ground where grab/trawling was not possible. Intertidal biotope mapping was also\r\nundertaken along the cable route.\r\nThese baseline surveys were necessary for the characterisation of the marine communities in\r\nthe vicinity of the cable route and wind farm site, and to identify the location of any Annex 1\r\nhabitats (under the Habitats Directive) present. Comparison of these results with postconstruction\r\nmonitoring will allow an assessment of any changes that may occur after\r\ninstallation of the facility." .
_:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 <http://schema.org/value> "Intertidal biotope mapping" .
_:ba011bd1791959fcb37854fe853b009e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ba011bd1791959fcb37854fe853b009e <http://schema.org/name> "ecosystems" .
_:e6903d119608d61b8f758861f7672cf0 <http://schema.org/value> "Habitats Directive" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:968a9c5897a20343aed4d6ebf99d9214f1efedda> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e6903d119608d61b8f758861f7672cf0 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:968a9c5897a20343aed4d6ebf99d9214f1efedda> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c4bc31140e977af8450c2c13eca22853 .
