<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9589140ff0fd734656ca2517f0b6bb53481072a1> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 120 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in December 1997 from stations in the North East Atlantic Ocean, off the coast of the Iberian Peninsula. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Instituto Hidrografico, Portugal as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9589140ff0fd734656ca2517f0b6bb53481072a1> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ca026df89ad65f6b705792e004e96b2d .
