_:c5520c6493fb54904c37e3cf671a7399 <http://schema.org/value> "Robin Hood's Bay" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:955edb977b3a762f3a4ac0030b7d12711e68db57> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c5520c6493fb54904c37e3cf671a7399 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:955edb977b3a762f3a4ac0030b7d12711e68db57> <http://schema.org/description> "This report covers geophysical surveys and associated archaeological assessments of the wreck sites reported as those of UB-41 (UKHO No. 62887) and the UB-75 (UKHO No. 6438). Both are believed to be German submarine wrecks dating from World War I (WWI) recorded as being lost during 1917 and are located approximately 15km ENE of Robin Hood's Bay, North Yorkshire. Wessex Archaeology were commissioned to carry out the project by English Heritage - now Historic England. Where the report refers to English Heritage these functions have been transferred to Historic England." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:955edb977b3a762f3a4ac0030b7d12711e68db57> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
