<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:937de8a1737808106eddada109b82ee64fe73038> <http://schema.org/description> "Monitoring survey undertaken by EMU on behalf of Tarmac. The primary aim of the survey was to undertake a repeat monitoring survey of the Licence Areas 435/396 and adjacent Black Bream Nest areas. Subtidal Habitat Mapping from multibeam data. Ground truthing using drop down video." .
