_:b6eaa993afa9f1ea64f3d54c6af8a792 <http://schema.org/value> "Sheringham Shoal" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9309b7a7a678dadb2097239bbab9630361979433> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9309b7a7a678dadb2097239bbab9630361979433> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the archaeological baseline studies carried out at the site of the Sheringham Shoal Offshore wind farm. The baseline runs from Lower Palaeolithic 680,000-c. 250,000 BP to Modern 1800-present. During this time climatic and environmental conditions in Britain varied considerably. This project examines the change through this time and the impacts on the study areas." .
