_:f3a8e22f5cb492340137d051d076fb6 <http://schema.org/value> "Plymouth inshore fishing grounds" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8e546dc4693daa922b9861765a385c8352100552> <http://schema.org/description> "24 years of survey data for 92 species recorded in 784 otter trawls, with a mean duration of 52 minutes. Trawls made at 130 fishing \"marks\" in the Plymouth inshore fishing grounds, the majority at station L4." .
