<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8caef041e32a82887ebbf170bc97668275e01a7c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b9175dc3ba53d600a98994e574dcafae <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8caef041e32a82887ebbf170bc97668275e01a7c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dadb0c0d8cb8683d3114d827920b3c8a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8caef041e32a82887ebbf170bc97668275e01a7c> <http://schema.org/description> "A geotechnical investigation was conducted for Eneco Offshore Wind Projects of the potential cable corridors for the West of the Isle of Wight offshore windfarm zone (Zone 7). Cone Penetration Tests (CPT), were performed at 16 scheduled locations, and Vibrocore samples were recovered from 14 scheduled locations along the potential cable routes.\r\n This report presents;\r\n - An overview of the site investigation.\r\n - Preliminary results of the sampling and in-situ testing performed offshore." .
_:b9175dc3ba53d600a98994e574dcafae <http://schema.org/value> "in-situ testing" .
_:b9175dc3ba53d600a98994e574dcafae <http://schema.org/value> "sampling" .
