<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8b4492492cd9dcd91bf5e5ce24e42a57683eb80d> <http://schema.org/description> "The group of shapefiles are designed to accompany the excel spreadsheet. This spreadsheet covers the shoreline surveys undertaken every year by Dr Jane Lancaster for Cumbria Sea Fisheries Committee (Now North West Inshore Fisheries and Conservation Authority.) these surveys have been undertaken on an annual basis since 1993. The annual report are available from the NW IFCA, the accompanying data was supplied to the ISCZ by Dr Jane Lancaster." .
_:d608f53164256df8d208f05565db5b21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
