<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8b0b9215f57572be2c649cd49da807dc06cd6c33> <http://schema.org/description> "A Natural England commissioned survey conducted by Kent Wildlife Trust. The aim of the survey was to monitor and assess the condition of the reefs and caves within the Thanet Coast SAC, resulting in a species inventory and assessment of abundance as well as the production of detailed biotope maps." .
