<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8b0a89a8ec8550416c906b256b3d08ca2ca5f8aa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8b0a89a8ec8550416c906b256b3d08ca2ca5f8aa> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 38 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - June 1999 along the Atlantic Meridional Transect (AMT) from the Falkland Islands to the UK. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the Atlantic Meridional Transect (Phase 1) programme." .
