<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8b0842938ced0c9e46748faf8ebb28c50b51e54d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 65 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during November - December 1993 from stations off Tagos and Sado between 38 - 39 N, 8 - 10 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Instituto Hidrografico, Portugal as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8b0842938ced0c9e46748faf8ebb28c50b51e54d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b6b7cb1da0519104d827080cdbdc2f7a .
