<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a90751a2dbb50aad8132d19384671056f136d8d> <http://schema.org/description> "This project details the Benthic surveys that were carried out at the site of the Gunfleet Sands 2 offshore wind farm. Previous benthic data collected by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd in February 2002 for GS1 has\r\nbeen collated as part of the baseline for this study, this included 65 sites, 12 of which were\r\nsampled in replicate. This has been supplemented by additional data gathered for six sites\r\nby Osiris Projects Ltd in April 2007, to provide sufficient coverage of the area that could\r\npotentially be affected by the proposed GS2 development." .
_:aa53735912a3eb21ed42d703f1aab218 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
