_:fea1a8f57aa59975e87343e7ac299091 <http://schema.org/value> "Great Cumbrae Island" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a3e2db368419d2c07a1fd1416177d486da9e159> <http://schema.org/description> "A continuous long term study into the characteristic biodiversity of a sandy shore (Kames Bay) was carried out by students during a marine biology field course at the University Marine Biological Station Millport (UMBSM). The sheltered beach at Kames Bay is a site of special scientific interest (SSSI) and is situated on the southern coast of Great Cumbrae Island, Firth of Clyde." .
_:fea1a8f57aa59975e87343e7ac299091 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
