<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a0cd662c8589b5f6f6493a7c43ccf155a8b1ab3> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f5666307491455fcca6a327f4e7f6477 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a0cd662c8589b5f6f6493a7c43ccf155a8b1ab3> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 2 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically at the Ireland Trough and the Porcupine Seabight, from August to October of 1979. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:f5666307491455fcca6a327f4e7f6477 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a030c809cfe6745e3cbfbab381fb0a1bf04054d> <http://schema.org/description> "Brown and May Marine Ltd. was commissioned by DONG Energy to undertake post construction fisheries surveys within the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Wind Farm development. The post construction surveys used the same vessel and gear specifications and survey methodology as the pre-construction surveys, undertaken in 2007" .
_:e05a9c8b49ba6c0fe8e2b025418d980c <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
_:b3239eeb4423192fb9ce928d0cc66559 <http://schema.org/value> "Gunfleet Sands" .
