_:e49227bfb96f1d6d1b361161b76a16cf <http://schema.org/value> "Norfolk" .
_:d1529f2bb9eb4fc35562fb2ba74ebdcc <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:89c73bbf6206aeba49374ea5fa18d29e4984cd58> <http://schema.org/description> "Centrica are proposing to construct an offshore wind farm off the coast of Norfolk\r\nand Lincolnshire. RPS Transport has been commissioned to undertake a route\r\nassessment study to establish suitable routes for construction vehicles associated\r\nwith the onshore cable route required to connect the wind farm to a substation. The\r\nproposed cable route will join land to the north of Sutton Bridge and connect with\r\nWalpole substation.\r\nThis assessment details potential access routes to and from the construction\r\neasement strip and sub station from strategic roads and considers possible\r\nhighway improvement measures that would be necessary to ensure safety and\r\nminimal disruption to other road users. Several versions of the access assessment report are provided within this series." .
_:fac50e51c778ec7f33da1fade7949b2 <http://schema.org/name> "migratory marine species" .
