<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8987ea5478dda253554a8cd740fd07af74ad1e48> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during March 1975. It incorporates casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating part of the Rockall-Malin Head section. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8987ea5478dda253554a8cd740fd07af74ad1e48> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
