<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:895a58db78e3a91b9c0e20bae54f7d052a74b0e1> <http://schema.org/description> "Geophysical survey carried out at the Triton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm site by Osiris in 2012. Data collected includes multibeam bathymetry (XYZ), magnetometer (TEXT), sub-bottom profiler (pinger; SGY) and side scan sonar (XTF and mosaics)." .
