<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:87c9befdd338ff14a16c64a3b1eb3de89aeac5cc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:87c9befdd338ff14a16c64a3b1eb3de89aeac5cc> <http://schema.org/description> "Surveys were undertaken in 2005 and 2006 with the objective of obtaining data on long term trends in contaminant persistence and biological recovery around a number of established producing fields selected on the basis of good long term monitoring data sets. Surveys were undertaken at Alba (in 2005), Beryl, Brae, Murchison and Nelson (all in 2006). The sampling and sample processing methods used were compatible with those used in previous operator surveys." .
