<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:877f2e35aa114f4c9f1949287495818481ca1687> <http://schema.org/description> "A report highlighting the relationship between fishing practices and cetacean species. Focusing on Gillnetting and Harbour Porpoise. Data is available in a PDF, Word, Excel and photograph format including, history, biology, methods, strandings data, and a final report." .
