_:c5c11a028e58b27e5170bb62dd07aeb3 <http://schema.org/value> "University of London" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:873181e1b8dce1e5134aeeba76fe63a38d2a11d7> <http://schema.org/description> "A PhD was carried out at the University Marine Biological Station Millport and presented to the University of London.\r\n The study investigated the effects of algal complexity on the ecology of motile epifaunal and assessed the effects of algal structure on epifaunal communities." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:873181e1b8dce1e5134aeeba76fe63a38d2a11d7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
