<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:86fad60bdd985d53545b72b1b01035e1c64d8a74> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental monitoring for the Burbo Extension Project, with a specific focus on Habitats Directive (92/43/EEC) Annex I habitat and habitats of conservation or ecological importance in order to satisfy requirements of the two English marine licences (EN010026) and one Welsh licence (13/17/ML)." .
_:b2d83465b4f9a15db12924df0f50f589 <http://schema.org/value> "Welsh licence" .
