<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:86c015c85bec5163bf9d1776faf63ea05595fe84> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March 1988. It incorporates a section between the Isle of Man and St. Bees Head including two 25-hour anchor stations (54 30N, 3 39W and 54 29N, 3 43W). The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:accf7c5c88297dea7ad543f2065a47f3 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
