_:fc196680429dd1b3dad56bdccdd8a04a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:84d0c00dcb025a201f8b52951de0e244532df383> <http://schema.org/description> "This report summarises the geoarchaeological assessments undertaken on the material collected at Hornsea Project One Offshore Wind Farm. This report presents the results of the Stage 3 Archaeological Sub-sampling and Assessment and incudes specialist's reports as appendices. The key aim of this work was to offset the impact of development, as identified in the Environmental Statement, on sites or deposits of archaeological or palaeoenvironmental significance by conducting a staged archaeological assessment of geotechnical cores in order to develop our understanding of the palaeoenvironment of the region." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:84d0c00dcb025a201f8b52951de0e244532df383> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
