_:d4ddf7636e509a0ee393c66b700b4a6d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:849818f69b529f7da54734294b8fa95659246588> <http://schema.org/description> "From 1946-1951, Dr. Norman S. Jones sampled the benthos around the south of the Isle of Man from over 200 sites. The sites were re-sampled from 1994-1996 as part of the Dredge Disturbance Project; a MAFF-funded project to study the environmental impact of scallop dredging." .
