<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:846a0fedc864cd321ed20c73ceaf4b462c6c210d> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic faunal survey was conducted in 1994 in Area 395 at Selsey Bill by Southern Science Ltd for METOCEAN PLC. Six samples were collected using a Box Dredge." .
