_:ccdc22eec156866151aa5e5b8a393fd1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:846827aefcce6060e03477b6847f63aaf7dee345> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series summarises the findings of the first year of post construction fish community surveys undertaken\r\nto date of tis report in the area of the Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing Offshore Wind Farm (LID). Detailed data reports for each of\r\nthe fishing surveys are appended to the report. The surveys undertaken (2m beam and otter trawling, shrimp trawling,\r\npotting and longlining) generally replicate the pre-construction surveys undertaken in 2004 and 2005 and\r\nutilise local fishermen and fishing vessels. A local commercial fisherman also recorded long-line catches\r\naround the wind farm.\r\nNeither the summary nor data reports compare the data collected in this first year post-construction with\r\nthe baseline on request of the client as it was felt that a minimum of two year of post construction data is\r\nrequired before attempting a comparison to reduce the impact of non-normally distributed data. The long line survey data is also present in this series." .
_:ccdc22eec156866151aa5e5b8a393fd1 <http://schema.org/value> "longlining" .
_:ebd07b77ad7d91c476648eccb9f92c3c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
