_:ce5985a7d3758b50d67dc87934e60af7 <http://schema.org/value> "Renewable Energy Limited" .
_:ce5985a7d3758b50d67dc87934e60af7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:83bc96c9de3f213e6b2b34a6637ea0b857af2748> <http://schema.org/description> "Renewable Energy Systems Limited (RES), working in association with Centrica\r\nRenewable Energy Limited (Centrica) commissioned RBA Research to assist in a resident\r\nopinion study regarding the proposed Lincs Offshore Wind Farm Project. The study took\r\nthe form of an information leaflet about the project, which contained a\r\nquestionnaire. The leaflet and questionnaire had the overall aims of:\r\n\r\n• giving residents the latest information on the ongoing development of offshore wind\r\nfarms in the area,\r\n• gaining local opinion towards the newly proposed Lincs project, and towards\r\nrenewable energy in general, and\r\n• maximising response rates. This series presents the leaflet (which contained the questionnaire), the results and the report from the public consultation." .
_:ce5985a7d3758b50d67dc87934e60af7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:83bc96c9de3f213e6b2b34a6637ea0b857af2748> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ce5985a7d3758b50d67dc87934e60af7 <http://schema.org/value> "RBA" .
