<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82dc46fdef03860d3cd21cfaffd45617574274c8> <http://schema.org/description> "Metadata only, contact DASSH or originator if you are interested in this dataset. 1-2 monthly samples of phyto- and zooplankton from sites on West Coast of Sweden. Year round sampling." .
