<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82834a5d88f2fb53c1718dcaf039af0a9a0afed7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a3fdd297ccfc05d5f02c28d5227c7a84 .
_:e290de377c11773e6d1e4dcf3b65391f <http://schema.org/value> "Lincs Marine Licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8268eb6f4273684d0b1942d8b46b5a6722fe4f5a> <http://schema.org/description> "A FLiDAR has been positioned just outside of the Burbo Bank Extension Offshore Wind Farm boundary. This series documents all report and data collected/generated from this instrument." .
