<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82595e91906c918adabce9a2e8eef26ecb60f7dc> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 37 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the South Atlantic Ocean area specifically South Georgia, during December of 2000 and January of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the British Antarctic Survey." .
_:e9399bc2637b82a00e5f020f4d680e72 <http://schema.org/value> "South Atlantic Ocean" .
