_:e01fa03f3c2b1d2ae2b0c43ddeac0ab4 <http://schema.org/value> "ross worm Sabellaria\r\nspinulosa" .
_:ff300cc60b419bc69822f8ccb9e2418a <http://schema.org/value> "Race Bank" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82412a8348a8529182847acbde8b2759654ab187> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c4365ffff97a366bcdc2340574e84002 .
_:c4365ffff97a366bcdc2340574e84002 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82412a8348a8529182847acbde8b2759654ab187> <http://schema.org/description> "A survey was carried out during April 2010 in order to establish the horizontal position and depth of cover of\r\nsix inter-array cables, installed by MPI Offshore in May and June 2007 using the LBT1, below mean seabed\r\nwithin the Lynn Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) site. A number of sections of the six inter-array cables were\r\nfound to be out of specification for protection by burial . As such, Centrica Renewable Energy Ltd\r\n(CREL) on behalf of GLID Wind Farms TopCo Limited (GLID) proposes to carry out remedial burial works on\r\nthe six cables deemed to be out of specification within the Lynn OWF site.\r\n\r\nThe Lynn OWF site lies within the boundary of the Inner Dowsing, Race Bank and North Ridge cSAC. Some\r\nof the qualifying features for which this cSAC is proposed under the Habitats Directive are: 'sandbanks which\r\nare slightly covered by the sea at all times' and 'reefs', in this case biogenic reefs of the ross worm Sabellaria\r\nspinulosa (JNCC, 2010). Consultation was therefore undertaken with Natural England who advised on using\r\nthe most recent dataset showing the locations of Annex I habitats within the area, as provided by Earth\r\nSciences &amp; Surveying (EGS) Ltd (EGS, 2011), in assessing the potential for impacts on the habitats and\r\nspecies within the vicinity of the cable remediation works. This information will enable Natural England to\r\nprovide advice on any nature conservation issues in relation to the interest features of the cSAC." .
_:bf5b1a1a80f0f0c5b9b3b40add381ddb <http://schema.org/value> "GLID Wind Farms TopCo Limited" .
