<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8226342d0a9a4c8487514ca1d05471839c397b65> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 15 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in July 1997 from stations at La Chapelle Bank in the Bay of Biscay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by Vrije Universiteit Brussels Department of Analytical and Environmental Chemistry as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
