<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:81763ae129d814ac7856abdff33d5c13e03d845e> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1993. It incorporates a CTD survey of the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume, the Wash, and the Southern (south of 54N) North Sea. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:81763ae129d814ac7856abdff33d5c13e03d845e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a77c1ce5ec2760342a830cc11a0dd53f .
