<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8148df9cf22bc1cb9e5169006885cf5246ddec2d> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 39 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and surrounding regions (Celtic Sea, St. George's Channel, North Channel and Clyde Sea) during August of 1979. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
