_:a090c26db85f006c196d487df486a0b0 <http://schema.org/value> "north Kent coast" .
_:cadf054dfe9b0b39a05404ed914f4f3b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:80171986be6df1ca4b53e21ff7992261f44545e7> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology was commissioned by London Array Ltd. to undertake Stage 3 sample assessment of material collected from six vibrocores recovered from an area off the north Kent coast. This project outlines the analysis and outcomes of the work undertaken." .
_:cadf054dfe9b0b39a05404ed914f4f3b <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
