<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f8df67bd4ff08747fc8866c0b8ab23e5c9d2a84> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 89 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in December 1992 from stations in the North Sea coastal zone from Great Yarmouth to Berwick upon Tweed. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Rivers, Atmosphere and Coasts Study (RACS)." .
