<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f86172422edc155471f27f7bed3a6a624d27816> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 66 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) and the Strait of Gibraltar (Mediterranean Sea) areas specifically running from the West European Basin to the south of Portugal. The data were collected during February and March 1984. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f86172422edc155471f27f7bed3a6a624d27816> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
