<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f504fbc3b101517d39b860860d67c5d065ce17c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b6f7302955d9d4288378e7225d0b860b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f504fbc3b101517d39b860860d67c5d065ce17c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during February 1992. It incorporates CTD surveys and anchor stations in the Southern North Sea, Humber Estuary and the Wash. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
