<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7dea3a7446238aa0b3793503cf3a9803cfd5e7c4> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1986. It incorporates deep CTD profiles over the Madeira Abyssal Plain in the northeast Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
