_:b80dc27235a457e280787194e2247685 <http://schema.org/value> "River Dee" .
_:b80dc27235a457e280787194e2247685 <http://schema.org/value> "Merseyside" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7d7a4088ea89dc1b3a611373611183acbc3aa64f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec71f24a5233e0b5c7ac2a6b5b02f03a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7d7a4088ea89dc1b3a611373611183acbc3aa64f> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions of Mammoet Van Oord, a multi-beam bathymetry survey has been\r\nperformed over the proposed Burbo Offshore Wind Farm development site, off the north\r\ncoast of the Wirral peninsula, Merseyside, UK. In addition, further multi-beam bathymetry\r\ndata were collected within a 400m x 400m, box-shaped area of seabed at Mostyn Deep, in\r\nthe outer estuary of the River Dee." .
_:b80dc27235a457e280787194e2247685 <http://schema.org/value> "Wirral peninsula" .
_:ec71f24a5233e0b5c7ac2a6b5b02f03a <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
