<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7c3224ffcc6370ba31f5afc592001a21a658214b> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi) were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to\r\nundertake the 2015 post construction (Year 3) hydrographic and geophysical surveys of the\r\nLincs and L and ID (Lynn and Inner Dowsing) windfarm array cable routes. Additionally, a benthic\r\nsurvey was required for the Lincs OWF post construction survey.\r\nThis series details the operations and results of the surveys." .
