<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b979bd12c0a6d1d0ad6f43bf92f79d4a7956339> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology (WA) was commissioned by Blyth Offshore Demonstrator Ltd (BODL)\r\nto carry out an archaeological assessment of high-resolution geophysical survey data\r\ncollected in 2016 over the Array 2 and Export Cable Route (ECR) of the proposed Blyth\r\nOffshore Demonstrator Project (BODP). This work follows on from the previous assessment\r\nof 2015 geophysical data over the development (Wessex Archaeology 2015) and the\r\nbaseline set out in the existing scheme-wide WSI (v8, Wessex Archaeology 2017).\r\nThis assessment consists of a review of sidescan sonar, magnetometer and multibeam\r\nbathymetry data acquired by Gardline Geosurvey Limited (Gardline) between May and July\r\n2016 and nearshore survey data acquired by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd. (Titan) in\r\nMay 2016 over the Array 2 and ECR areas of the BODP." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b979bd12c0a6d1d0ad6f43bf92f79d4a7956339> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cac5a0340b679b7398f5a78adc67218d .
