_:def939246206261483c66406949323 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f7667474c75bdd58c7aeab841d2607b <http://schema.org/value> "Loughborough University" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7a8ab408933985aaf0b4ea305ae6c9cfb2cbf251> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:def939246206261483c66406949323 <http://schema.org/value> "Creyke Beck A" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7a8ab408933985aaf0b4ea305ae6c9cfb2cbf251> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f7667474c75bdd58c7aeab841d2607b .
_:f7667474c75bdd58c7aeab841d2607b <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:def939246206261483c66406949323 <http://schema.org/value> "Creyke Beck B" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7a8ab408933985aaf0b4ea305ae6c9cfb2cbf251> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:def939246206261483c66406949323 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7a8ab408933985aaf0b4ea305ae6c9cfb2cbf251> <http://schema.org/description> "This project presents the underwater noise assessment undertaken by the National Physical Laboratory and Loughborough University to estimate the likely underwater noise levels generated by pile driving of wind turbine foundations for the Dogger Bank Creyke Beck A and Creyke Beck B projects, and assess the likely impact of subsea noise from construction, operation and decommissioning phases of the wind farm projects in support of the Environmental Impact Assessment.\r\n\r\nUnderwater sound emissions were modelled for a number of single sound sources (piles) within Creyke Beck A and Creyke Beck B. In addition, multiple concurrent sound sources were also modelled." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7a4e0bb7d26a5faaee6ed89fb8b58bd9217fe9e5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d05b6d36da7b741b59d112a38c9d7fb4 .
