<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:79285c4191ed1cad8d3f5bb25a31203fe02b3ef0> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology was commissioned by English Heritage (EH) to undertake an Undesignated Site Assessment of the wreck site located at Gun Rocks, Outer Farne Islands. The work was completed as part of the Heritage at Risk (HAR) contract for archaeological services in relation to to marine designation." .
