<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:787679f349558b4cd56a98734afdad7d1da4bf86> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry environmental baseline and geophysical site survey acquired under licences P1078, P1077, P277, P920, P493, P234 in October 2022 to re-validate the significant data EnQuest are already holding and identify any changes in the area since the initial data was gathered. The block numbers traversed were 3/28, 3/27, 9/2, 9/3." .
