_:b4a439a27320a146d540345e9d58a9fc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b4a439a27320a146d540345e9d58a9fc <http://schema.org/value> "otter and beam trawl" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:76186119c97aefeb3f1f3a78028c24e7e8b2941f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b4a439a27320a146d540345e9d58a9fc <http://schema.org/value> "shrimp trawl" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:76186119c97aefeb3f1f3a78028c24e7e8b2941f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b4a439a27320a146d540345e9d58a9fc .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:76186119c97aefeb3f1f3a78028c24e7e8b2941f> <http://schema.org/description> "The surveys were carried out as part of the environmental monitoring programme outlined within FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms respectively. This series details the findings of the first and second year of post-construction surveys, and makes comparisons with the data collected during pre-construction surveys. The second year post-construction surveys (potting, shrimp trawl, otter and beam trawl and longlining) generally replicated that of the first year post-construction and pre-construction surveys (August 2004 to July 2005) and utilised local fishermen and fishing vessels." .
_:b4a439a27320a146d540345e9d58a9fc <http://schema.org/value> "longlining" .
