_:d9f853c941dcddc2185fa481adcb70b7 <http://schema.org/value> "Shetland Islands" .
_:d9f853c941dcddc2185fa481adcb70b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:760b0ef89b36c01949fec19e9a282f92869f1baa> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 12 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically along the shelf edge east, north and west of the Shetland Islands, during January of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:c87754b11f3b5167dba1249868cddba6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
