<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:74bcf4cd04144c5616a750186c6a3b4c0e24c90d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 41 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1993 from stations in the English Channel, Bay of Biscay, Ria de Vigo, Ria de Arosa and Ria de Muros. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Université Libre de Bruxelles, Laboratory of Chemical Oceanography and Water Geochemistry as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:74bcf4cd04144c5616a750186c6a3b4c0e24c90d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e89fcaa06943d863ffa3cb44c9dfe94e .
