<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7481fb9c11bee09c2bba93031e8dd31f8d6ba152> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species abundance data from a survey carried out between April and May 2003 to give an indication of the impact and spatial extent of the Braer oil spill." .
