<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:738a9bfad31b64767f88c846569369f678b28940> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:738a9bfad31b64767f88c846569369f678b28940> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d7b23d2a875fa54a2373ed4a34f1a8d .
_:de4f8eee4bbff391469d81138c0888c1 <http://schema.org/value> "Pettico Wick" .
_:d7b23d2a875fa54a2373ed4a34f1a8d <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:738a9bfad31b64767f88c846569369f678b28940> <http://schema.org/description> "The aim of this study was therefore to establish monitoring transects at a series of rocky shore sites that represent the range of rock features and biotopes present in the cSAC, and to carry out a baseline survey of them so that the communities of animals and plants can be monitored in future years. A total of 12 transects sites were established and surveyed, between Pettico Wick near St. Abbs and Boulmer in Northumberland. The transects were fixed using a range of techniques that should enable future surveyors to relocate the defined areas easily and accurately. The site location sheets are given in an Appendix to this report." .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Rotifera" .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Arthropoda" .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Sipuncula" .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Phyla" .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73721b9632e606c396866c2301e08dacce38af1c> <http://schema.org/description> "Collation of marine fauna records collected between 1948 and 1975 by taxonomic group experts. Phyla and other groups that were not included in the lists were: Ctenophora (Comb-jellies / sea gooseberries) Platyhelminthes (Flatworms) Nematoda (Roundworms) Gastrotricha (Hairworms) Rotifera (Wheel animals) Nermertea (Ribbon worms) Cephalorhyncha Echiura (Spoon worms) Sipuncula (Peanut worms) Chaetognatha (Arrow worms) Phoronida (Horseshoe worms) Entoprocta (Goblet worms / Kamptozoans) Brachiopoda (Lampshells) Arthropoda: Crustacea: Cirripedia (barnacles) were not listed. Chordata: Mammalia (seals, whales and dolphins) were not listed." .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Gastrotricha" .
_:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 <http://schema.org/value> "Entoprocta" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73721b9632e606c396866c2301e08dacce38af1c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fe11a25cca84d55bec26af683dd31f4 .
