<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:720d58d36237b002cac184595c73671af710344f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ce7436440abe298b622ec7363534a8d1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:720d58d36237b002cac184595c73671af710344f> <http://schema.org/description> "SeaGeneration (Wales) Ltd. has appointed Royal HaskoningDHV (RHDHV) to undertake a desk-based assessment of the effects on the coastal and sea bed physical processes and geomorphology of a proposed export cable route and cable landfall associated with The Skerries Tidal Stream Array.\r\n\r\nUsing a desk-based assessment, the ES assessed the effects of these two cable routes and cable landfalls on the coastal and sea bed physical processes and geomorphology over different spatial and time scales. The significance of the effect was then defined as either 'major', 'moderate', 'minor', or 'negligible' according to a ranking matrix which combined the magnitude of change with the sensitivity of the receptor. Please note Appendix A \"Geophysical Survey Charts for Corridor of Cable Route 3 and Landfall L3\" are present in a separate series - \"2013, Osiris Projects, Skerries Tidal Array, Geophysical Survey\"." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:720d58d36237b002cac184595c73671af710344f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bcecb4863d8289cf867b275084303cd5 .
