<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7055a0fa450962956300276cd89d895899bf2ee1> <http://schema.org/description> "Various Seasearch surveys were undertaken including a specific survey to monitor the effects of scallop dredging on sea fans. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 2007 Seasearch survey of Exmouth, 2007 Seasearch survey of Exmouth Mearl Beds and Pink Seafan sites, 2007 Seasearch survey of Exmouth to Beer Head, and 2007 Seasearch survey of Lyme Bay." .
