_:be3f09b3ac572819ddc8736fa51adf99 <http://schema.org/value> "Saltash" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6feaca58de51af71c3c9de365c8003adcf74356c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:be3f09b3ac572819ddc8736fa51adf99 .
_:be3f09b3ac572819ddc8736fa51adf99 <http://schema.org/value> "West Hoe" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6feaca58de51af71c3c9de365c8003adcf74356c> <http://schema.org/description> "A study to investigate the sediments and benthic fauna of the River Tamar in the vicinity of SWW sewage outfalls at Ernesettle, Saltash, Camels Head and West Hoe. Multiple grab samples were taken by boat at each of seventeen stations on the 24th and 25th of September, 1992. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6feaca58de51af71c3c9de365c8003adcf74356c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f77129294b2197bd97c9aeefb19bcc8f .
