<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6fcd97b2aaf8c29e65e548065ba6a2689c084b4f> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 129 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Celtic Sea area specifically on the shelf edge during July and August 2005. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the Seasonal Thermocline Production Control project." .
