<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ef7e1a222b46621d9ab355772f9e797aa70a159> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 69 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the South Atlantic Ocean area specifically around South Georgia, from December of 2001 to February of 2002. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the British Antarctic Survey." .
