<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ee6a2b7bd086b2b83bdcbc84157f01c9524aa2f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dac9c95a500a0acfa06c02c5024d680f .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ee6a2b7bd086b2b83bdcbc84157f01c9524aa2f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a13852cddd84d7029eb4fb1b3fe3ac18 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ee6a2b7bd086b2b83bdcbc84157f01c9524aa2f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f3d8d26e8c2f3d78011f9c8e6229b886 .
_:dac9c95a500a0acfa06c02c5024d680f <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ee6a2b7bd086b2b83bdcbc84157f01c9524aa2f> <http://schema.org/description> "Natural Power Consultants (Natural Power) has been invited by Blyth Offshore Demonstrator Limited (BODL) to\r\ncarry out pre-construction benthic monitoring surveys at the Blyth Offshore Demonstrator Project. Pre-construction\r\nmonitoring is required in order to comply with the Marine Licence conditions to establish an ecological baseline\r\nprior to construction work commencing in 2017.\r\nThis Risk Assessment and Method Statement (RAMS) document details the Health and Safety arrangements in\r\nplace to demonstrate a safe system of work whilst undertaking pre-construction benthic and fish survey work of the\r\nBODL project using the survey vessel RV Princess Royal, and should be read in conjunction with the Blyth\r\nOffshore Demonstrator Project Contractor Health &amp; Safety Minimum Requirements.\r\nSurvey methods will include benthic grab surveys, set net surveys, potting surveys, epibenthic beam and otter\r\ntrawl surveys, intertidal surveys and drop down video (DDV) surveys." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ee6a2b7bd086b2b83bdcbc84157f01c9524aa2f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
