_:ba48d3c3d2d70417ffc65023c8aefe69 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6dc0cfede63e6ce0baa8189fa2d262c623bf94fe> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in April 2017 by DONG Energy to carry out a bathymetric\r\nsurvey on the West of Duddon Sands Offshore Windfarm (WDS01) and the Walney 1 and Walney 2\r\nOffshore Windfarms in the East Irish Sea. This project was undertaken in 4 separate parts\r\ncomprising: Survey 1 – Crossing and Proximity Agreement Survey (CPA) for WDS01; Survey 2a – Consent survey at WDS01 covering a selection of 6 turbines, associated array cables, the offshore sub-station (OS) and export routes; Survey 2b – CPA for several crossings at WDS01; and Survey 3 – An Asset Integrity Survey (AIS) undertaken at Walney 1 and 2 offshore windfarms\r\n(WOW01 and WOW02).\r\nThis series details the results of the survey of the export cable." .
_:ba48d3c3d2d70417ffc65023c8aefe69 <http://schema.org/value> "East Irish Sea" .
_:ba48d3c3d2d70417ffc65023c8aefe69 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
