<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6da0dc401ad18e56c77222817c90f97eb29930be> <http://schema.org/description> "Sublittoral survey for 8 locations in/around Plymouth sound with a focus on nudibranch. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
