<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d928d3fbf283650c187866f7fe32390fd2b6871> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a20d630406ace000ad08a65672eda395 .
_:a20d630406ace000ad08a65672eda395 <http://schema.org/value> "Benthic Solutions Limited (BSL)" .
_:a20d630406ace000ad08a65672eda395 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d928d3fbf283650c187866f7fe32390fd2b6871> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd was contracted to undertake the 2013 Post-Construction hydrographic and geophyscial survey (Multibeam and side scan sonar systems) of the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (L&amp;ID) Wind Farms and export cable routes. Additionally, an environmental survey was required for the 54 No Cable Zones. \r\nWith respect to the Scope of Work, the total survey operations were carried out in three phases as below:\r\n? Phase 1 – Scour, trial pit and cable survey- carried out between 3rd October 2013 and 7th November 2013\r\n? Phase 2 – High-resolution MBES survey of 10 turbine foundations - carried out between 7th and 8th November 2013.\r\n? Phase 3 – Environmental survey of No Cable Zones (NCZ) - carried out between 8th and 14th November 2013.\r\n\r\n EGSi subcontracted Benthic Solutions Limited (BSL) to carry out the environmental survey operations." .
_:a20d630406ace000ad08a65672eda395 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d928d3fbf283650c187866f7fe32390fd2b6871> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a20d630406ace000ad08a65672eda395 <http://schema.org/value> "EGS (International) Ltd" .
_:ad981b9045da02a79da50eec73783bc2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
