_:a11d7045dc1611fc2699cb149b95cf16 <http://schema.org/value> "Balanced Seas MCZ project" .
_:a11d7045dc1611fc2699cb149b95cf16 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
