<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6cce49dee135d3c7c611ef9f1560496802ca263d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1996. It incorporates two CTD grid surveys of the Northern North Sea between the Orkneys and the Norwegian mainland. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
