<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6c34cd4f59008549a6c65dd487ff5931241e188a> <http://schema.org/description> "The Marine Data Exchange currently holds over 100 geotechnical surveys from more than 30 offshore renewables projects. . Geotechnical series made publicly available on the Marine Data Exchange up until 2022 (ranging from surveys conducted between 2002 and from 2016) have been reviewed as part of the BGS Geotechnical Data project." .
