_:e128c68c9697820b63ec8e235df3baa6 <http://schema.org/value> "England" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b6a01cd8cde95c51a48d81fed74657263b9f28c> <http://schema.org/description> "A report summarising the extent of Smelt Osmerus eperlanus in England and Wales. Information from fisheries and wildlife organisations, from the literature and from questionnaires carried out in 1966, 1969, 1980 and 2002 on the location of was Smelt Osmerus eperlanus gathered. The results are summarised in two tables, the first indicates the location of the river, lake or marine system containing the Smelt and its national grid reference; and the second is a table showing the location of the Smelt and literature reference which listed its locality." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b6a01cd8cde95c51a48d81fed74657263b9f28c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d1b37a4e5267d056ff3bda88eb3e50e9 .
