<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b54d4634cfc9ad743621787968ad23950d8092b> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi) were contracted to undertake a post-construction survey of a\r\nnumber of selected turbines, one substation and several array cables within WOW 1 &amp; 2.\r\nThe aim of the survey was to assess the extent of any changes to seabed and scouring\r\naround the turbine monopiles and the substation compared to the previous surveys within\r\nthe windfarm and also to identify any exposures along several array cables." .
_:c711891cde4b3a4c2051d7597feb025a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
