<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b508f57f91199994964a553fab3fa42cb20bb11> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental survey for Chevron North Sea Ltd / Chevron Upstream Europe at the Aberlour prospect at UKCE block 213/28 in the Faroe Shetland Channel. The objective of the survey was to describe the physio-chemical and biological characteristics of the Aberlour propsect area." .
_:c55fc86ff7dfc0bb894b6bc52eb8672a <http://schema.org/value> "Faroe Shetland Channel" .
_:c55fc86ff7dfc0bb894b6bc52eb8672a <http://schema.org/value> "Aberlour prospect" .
_:ebba6335978b54c31f444e84cf77003c <http://schema.org/value> "Aberlour propsect area" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b508f57f91199994964a553fab3fa42cb20bb11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c55fc86ff7dfc0bb894b6bc52eb8672a <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:ab913594e79012c17bae49947938e266 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b4f3dfe3d0f31d6b279b46324a1067216d096ca> <http://schema.org/description> "RWE npower renewables Ltd (NRL) has gained exclusive rights to develop the Bristol Channel Zone (BCZ) as part of The Crown Estate Round 3 leasing programme. NRL have identified a potential development area for an Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) within the BCZ, known as Atlantic Array. As part of the initial assessment of the development area, it is proposed that a meteorological mast (met mast) will be constructed at the site. This series contains various reports associated with the proposed Met Mast, including the Food and Environment Protection Act (FEPA) licence." .
_:ab913594e79012c17bae49947938e266 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b4f3dfe3d0f31d6b279b46324a1067216d096ca> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ad367440f577ce0b5a85585a866c3bc6 .
