<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b0530a652b1366d8a69f612a4f79dadee249b03> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 69 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 2003 along the Atlantic Meridional Transect (AMT), a distance of almost 13,500 km, from the Falkland Islands to the UK. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of East Anglia School of Environmental Sciences as part of the Atlantic Meridional Transect (Phase 2) programme." .
_:de5b367c54e89e824d73546fb2e3f009 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:de5b367c54e89e824d73546fb2e3f009 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b0530a652b1366d8a69f612a4f79dadee249b03> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e956a3a629b7786ed7c395f627cc7fbb .
