_:e02dbcad6376abe5919868b81704ec45 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6af090cbaea005ed3149bdb574d261d2407705ad> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e02dbcad6376abe5919868b81704ec45 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6af090cbaea005ed3149bdb574d261d2407705ad> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f7e7fd8568b9f14fa8720868c0236aae .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6af090cbaea005ed3149bdb574d261d2407705ad> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 11 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in October 1993 from stations in the NE Atlantic between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
