<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:68e362f27df96433d504fd0ea5b6382c64d6df9a> <http://schema.org/description> "This report, Marine Biodiversity Action Plan habitats and species of the Isles of Scilly is an update to the Isles of Scilly Biodiversity Audit 2008. Surveys were carried out on the following Biodiversity Action plan Habitats: Intertidal boulders, fragile sponges and Anthozoans on sub-tidal rocky habitats, seagrass beds and tide-swept channels.\r\n The report contains JNCC standard biotope classifications of the habitats analysed during the intertidal surveys, GIS mapping showing the distribution of the habitats around the Isles of Scilly and digital photographs of the sites visited as well as interesting faunal assemblages.\r\n Report only, no structured data." .
