<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:682f2295fef3773ec0d0e43205a0dac61f99bc88> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d55eda573303ffdbb512424df040ecf3 .
_:d55eda573303ffdbb512424df040ecf3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
