_:fe4de8f97f4ae6c72aea5aa32b801453 <http://schema.org/value> "Portsmouth" .
_:fe4de8f97f4ae6c72aea5aa32b801453 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:eba8ff9eea28543dd45aa6e16f97783c <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6796f5ee08661c75d8af05e3de0d2a0371441a82> <http://schema.org/description> "Author: The British Marine Aggregate Producers Association (BMAPA) Report number: R515 This report is an account of key events of the year 2003 for The British Marine Aggregate Producers Association (BMAPA) and aggregate dredging. The report details the ongoing review of licenses with The Crown Estate for more responsible resource management. Various work is described including the development of Gunwharf Quays in Portsmouth and working with English Heritage in the Bristol Channel to identify archaeological areas of interest." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6796f5ee08661c75d8af05e3de0d2a0371441a82> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:eba8ff9eea28543dd45aa6e16f97783c .
