<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66b935acc1950965f7ce7e6851367d5e150b7d73> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a21d774c9aa6f7619a8af38f97c9ab87 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66b935acc1950965f7ce7e6851367d5e150b7d73> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a235d936dde208215c8c4c21dd2fbd31 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66b935acc1950965f7ce7e6851367d5e150b7d73> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a21d774c9aa6f7619a8af38f97c9ab87 .
