_:aabb5a11f60556a62efb86881a0eb993 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66b5ce2d3b1924a3a49b4c935484ffd984c9de46> <http://schema.org/description> "Designated site assessment of this wreck site. The work was undertaken by Wessex Archaeology (WA) and comprised a diver inspection and synthesis of information about finds from the site and previous archaeological work. It made recommendations that a plan for the site be drawn up, to include future investigation, conservation, access and publication. The work follows recording and excavation on the site by licensees; and monitoring and geophyscial survey carried out by the Archaeological Diving Unit (ADU). Coordinates for the centre point of the site, and the size of the study area are derived from the WA report cited in the project bibliography. The depth of the site is not given there, and is derived from the ADU reports recorded separately as englishh1-94850." .
_:acb939f13817484f4a2cefbaf343aa1e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c940fbefc2ab3898e6a93a3bea3a0e6a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
