<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:65def01950dd9b8b05a141f688fb7f3824ced15e> <http://schema.org/description> "Project to provide written clarification to curator (English Heritage) regarding the Environmental Statement produced by DONG Energy in advance of development consent for Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm. This addendum consists of two parts: Part 1clarifies statements contained within the original ES; Part 2 reports on the results of a magnetometer survey and sedimentary sequence modelling." .
