<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:65413b0d129a1dde60cc2032048b2b317c1e8879> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f92d5542cd67e16e5611c634513f8710 .
_:cd2522364839b82f77071e226ca1e07c <http://schema.org/value> "CEFAS" .
_:f92d5542cd67e16e5611c634513f8710 <http://schema.org/value> "Lowestoft" .
_:f92d5542cd67e16e5611c634513f8710 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:65413b0d129a1dde60cc2032048b2b317c1e8879> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cd2522364839b82f77071e226ca1e07c .
