<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6513af7b8399cb2588e18beb2fe6d32999508b79> <http://schema.org/description> "This map shows the locations of point source pollution e.g. wastewater effluents from sewage discharges, trade effluents, surface water outfalls and thermal cooling. The original data was from SEPA, but the SSMEI pilot grouped the sites into waste type and converted the spreadsheet into a map." .
