<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64e1314c0d75c64a187257d5844c6c5c7d22f3f6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:faf8c675f76d1515909d0574f7bb6de0 <http://schema.org/value> "Fugro Survey Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64e1314c0d75c64a187257d5844c6c5c7d22f3f6> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions of Total E and P UK Plc (TEP UK), Fugro Survey Ltd performed a baseline environmental survey of the Laggan area for the proposed field development options in UKCS block 206/1, using the survey vessel Fugro Mercator. The aim of the survey was to map physical and biological features in the development areas and identify any potential habitats of conservation importance." .
_:bccd602cd206a19e2354532f9bcd8b9a <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
