<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64d624b0afc17e80b87e5f6d5ae1a1221b398712> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f6d9bca9581ed55b6c91794b0c90dc88 .
_:f6d9bca9581ed55b6c91794b0c90dc88 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64d624b0afc17e80b87e5f6d5ae1a1221b398712> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 48 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically along a transect offshore of Stonehaven and across the Wee Bankie/Marr Bank study area, during March and April of 2002. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:e98791176902e8a225e0ff9454ff3782 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64ab2f8a5741719c3af6d7ae772fe06eac29e50c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e350587fa7cb0f98fc9212ff666aa3e2 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64ab2f8a5741719c3af6d7ae772fe06eac29e50c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e350587fa7cb0f98fc9212ff666aa3e2 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:e350587fa7cb0f98fc9212ff666aa3e2 <http://schema.org/value> "Helford River" .
_:e350587fa7cb0f98fc9212ff666aa3e2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64ab2f8a5741719c3af6d7ae772fe06eac29e50c> <http://schema.org/description> "During the 1986 to 1999 period, six intensive surveys were carried out at each of six sites covering the north and south banks of the Helford River, both sides of the Gillan inlet and an exposed headland. The results of all these studies and brief, more recent, notes, are drawn together here in this report to inform and assist in any future investigations." .
_:e350587fa7cb0f98fc9212ff666aa3e2 <http://schema.org/value> "Gillan inlet" .
