<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63babbec25a7a10b5952ace295fb6da9817fc520> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1985. It incorporates full-depth CTD profiles from 7 stations along a section in the Northeast Atlantic from 37N to 50N between 14W and 20W. The CTD package was also fitted with a transmissometer and an oxygen sensor, but the oxygen sensor only worked for the southernmost station.The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:b316c1805a9bd75d27eb124027fc3c45 <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory" .
_:b316c1805a9bd75d27eb124027fc3c45 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ab2ac388819e039cac9b71ff0920a719 <http://schema.org/value> "Northeast Atlantic" .
