<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6352a948cfdc620de13152b219328425bd47815b> <http://schema.org/description> "The following document outlines the outputs and data analysis in relation to a single sea-bed mount ADCP survey campaign undertaken by Applied Renewables Research Ltd (ARR Ltd) to the west of Portnahaven, Islay, Inner Hebrides, Scotland. Current and wave measurements were recorded. The instruments were deployed on 18th February 2014 and recovered on 12th July 2014." .
_:b450938ecebdc52122f9182e1c7b1259 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
