<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:62e2793394c76c27a5c6e30bc8cb42935caefbcc> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in October 2015 by E.ON to carry out rock bag post installation survey using a high resolution multibeam system at the Humber Gateway Offshore Wind Farm. The survey was carried out between 3rd October 2015 and 6th October 2015. The main objective of the survey was the accurate positioning and high resolution images of all deployed rock bags." .
