<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:62459eb82759205bd5f358a1834c6f56715663d5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e2881c96a445069b9104a8f21b6decf <http://schema.org/value> "HR Wallingford" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:62459eb82759205bd5f358a1834c6f56715663d5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e2881c96a445069b9104a8f21b6decf .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:62459eb82759205bd5f358a1834c6f56715663d5> <http://schema.org/description> "HR Wallingford has been commissioned by Westermost Rough Ltd. to provide support to the Marine Licence\r\n(reference L/2011/00305/1) condition 3.1.37 with regard to the development of a Coastal Monitoring Plan\r\nand Response Procedure (CMPRP) for the Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm. The purpose of the report provided within this series is to comply with Marine Licence condition 3.1.37. The report presents the\r\nproposed Coastal Monitoring Plan and Response Procedure (CMPRP) which forms part of the\r\nEnvironmental Monitoring Programme (EMP). It also includes a description of the existing East Riding of\r\nYorkshire Council’s (ERYC) regional coastal monitoring programme and a brief baseline assessment of\r\ncoastal processes and past monitoring." .
_:e2881c96a445069b9104a8f21b6decf <http://schema.org/value> "Westermost Rough Ltd." .
_:b64a9f2f2c8105eb8e6a2f6bbc6f4275 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
