<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:60d5d99dff9381df907023aed67dde0efae658e9> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned in July 2012 by DONG Energy (UK) Ltd to carry out\r\na magnetic and topographic survey of the intertidal area at Middleton Sands,\r\nLancashire, England (OS Grid: 340800E, 457800N). The survey was completed\r\nunder DONG Energy (UK) Ltd’s standard Terms and Conditions and was carried out\r\nbetween 19th and 30th August 2012." .
