<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5fe6341a3c1ce2e66ce1508d7f656aa4858ff7b6> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ef5f2502ec88aac376e662fdd6294855 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5fe6341a3c1ce2e66ce1508d7f656aa4858ff7b6> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 61 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in June 1997 from stations off the coast of the Iberian Peninsula. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Vrije Universiteit Brussels Department of Analytical and Environmental Chemistry as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
