<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5ed6ef8415bc705cc5c7fa7c69bdecabca6f535e> <http://schema.org/description> "A combined geophysical and environmental survey at the proposed location Balvenie. The geophysical survey was required to provide seabed, sub-seabed, anchoring conditions and drilling hazard information for the location, emplacement and operation of a semi-submersible drilling rig at the proposed well location." .
