<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5dd371231f11dd6d097fd165fbdb35a7611edca9> <http://schema.org/description> "The rates and processes of sediment-water exchange of nutrients and trace metals in samples taken from intertidal sites in the mid and lower reaches of the Tamar Estuary. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
_:c7b021ccd708696c87e5bdd17dae285e <http://schema.org/value> "species" .
_:f8c71dcf3fe9ba19b3ebdebd5ace336d <http://schema.org/value> "Tamar Estuary" .
