<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5d7cf4233db661548d8ae94c6ae849c9803586a8> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey were commissioned by Dong Energy Burbo Bank Extension (UK) Ltd to survey the proposed Burbo Bank Extension Inshore Area. This work was undertaken by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd between 04-Jan and 14-Jan-2012. The geological data acquisition programme was carried out by MV Titan Voyager, which sailed from Conwy and returned to Conwy upon completion of survey operations.\r\n Reporting for the project has been sub-divided into two volumes. One volume covers the results of the geophysical survey, and an operations report covers all fieldwork." .
_:cde4d43dcf0f41d0c27c76fca28005a9 <http://schema.org/value> "Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd" .
