<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5d55851303e28f6478eeeb561100c563d6f81181> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 41 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically along the standard JONSIS, Fair Isle-Munken and Nolso-Flugga survey lines and at stations in the Norwegian Sea. The data was collected during December of 1999. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:fb54f30edcd0ad5d8a3a9bd8927f6104 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
