<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c53e87fbef24ab7a017f8ff12efa58bc99daef7> <http://schema.org/description> "Emu Limited was commissioned by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to set up and maintain a Wave Data Acquisition System in the vicinity of Round 2 wind farms at Lincs and Race Bank. The scope of work comprised of real time monitoring of wave data within the development area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c53e87fbef24ab7a017f8ff12efa58bc99daef7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aabd5c3489fb0bcf1f760372f06eba7c .
