<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c3e59fa76efe6231cf300f0e90ad5fc18ce907f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b3a482e606fcc371a79b4b8296716fb3 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c3e59fa76efe6231cf300f0e90ad5fc18ce907f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cb8cbb9a6e334d6cd93bddce561181fe .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c3e59fa76efe6231cf300f0e90ad5fc18ce907f> <http://schema.org/description> "This report is an annex to the Environmental Statements (ES) prepared by AMEC Wind\r\nEnergy and Offshore Wind Power Ltd in connection with the development of offshore\r\nwind farms at Lynn and Inner Dowsing off the Lincolnshire coast.\r\nThe report addresses a number of issues raised by the Centre for Fisheries,\r\nEnvironment and Aquaculture Science (CEFAS), the Environment Agency and English\r\nNature with respect to the influence that the wind farm developments may have on the\r\ncoastal processes." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c3e59fa76efe6231cf300f0e90ad5fc18ce907f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
