<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5c368b2fa5f4121a0ed501dc333ceb850af4336c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1994. It incorporates CTD profiles from the Arctic Sea including partial sections across Denmark Strait and Fram Strait and a section west of Bear Island. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
