<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5bc461fc89843bb215e27346b9c4b11191afd8a5> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 18 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1991 from stations in the North Atlantic between approximately 37 - 55 N, 12 - 35 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Liverpool Department of Earth Sciences as part of the UK's contribution to the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
