<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5b46a4dad4a953b797ca47ef1642097b1cf23649> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG Energy to undertake a Multibeam Echosounder (MBES) survey at the Gunfleet Sands 3 Offshore Windfarm in the Thames Estuary.\r\nThe scope of work, for the October 2013 survey included:\r\n\r\n1. MBES survey of 50m wide corridor along Export Cable Route between the WTG F0 and the HDD exit point [See Figure 1].\r\n2. MBES survey of the WTG foundations and inter-array cable.\r\n\r\nThis series covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 6th &amp; 7th October 2013, along the Export Cable Route and around Turbines F00 and G00. The survey work was carried out using the PLA survey vessel ‘Yantlet’, with bathymetric data being collected using a hull-mounted Reson SeaBat 8125h MBES." .
_:c1df2f505b860136e469951ffb5a11cb <http://schema.org/value> "Thames Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5b46a4dad4a953b797ca47ef1642097b1cf23649> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c1df2f505b860136e469951ffb5a11cb .
