_:a7ef3d970cc4c8bd59bc23f1b7ff6e34 <http://schema.org/value> "NPower Renewables" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5b1202c4727f81c863d09773511ba284bcda2793> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
