<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:59ec8b83cea4e6d7b3778e993f3bfb9c4f01a351> <http://schema.org/description> "This project contains the results of benthic surveys at the Gunfleet Sands I and II offshore windfarm sites. The surveys were carried out by RPS hydrosearch on behalf of DONG Energy. Results include maps of bathymetry, sediment types, seabed features and sidescan sonars. Data was collected in May 2007." .
