<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5992c982dc45bdef896c1208e618a31a26ecdad3> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys comparing habitat diversity to fauna and flora diversity of the Torridge estuary. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
