<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:597c5d6ba217d1b2e0b09a89d69507368c176b25> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a3a84742103aab4a1294cbdd2e4a30a7 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:597c5d6ba217d1b2e0b09a89d69507368c176b25> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 20 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1999 from stations on the Western Iberian Continental Margin. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:597c5d6ba217d1b2e0b09a89d69507368c176b25> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b514982aa2fc522ddfb696b0374b49e3 .
