<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c739abf36dcef326ed4bc1ab5e5525c88489c2> <http://schema.org/description> "Dataset containing kelp understorey algae abundance and biomass information from dive quadrat surveys. The study was carried out by the Dan Smale Lab at the Marine Biological Association (Plymouth). The purpose of this study was to look at differences in kelp understorey biodiversity at different sites around the UK." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c739abf36dcef326ed4bc1ab5e5525c88489c2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f108ccaaa4ca248b75fb69fe3a7567fe <http://schema.org/value> "kelp understorey biodiversity" .
_:d8db7cf931fc2fb2979fcc2fdc9e7c88 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f9685f4f528d3eaf02b0413cd68055f2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c452254fe137e6ac6fce32331f6740f7df354d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a98689480d32b81210492da3cfed7607 .
_:a98689480d32b81210492da3cfed7607 <http://schema.org/value> "Partrac Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c452254fe137e6ac6fce32331f6740f7df354d> <http://schema.org/description> "Partrac Ltd were contracted to undertake a sediment monitoring survey at the Ormonde offshore wind farm (OWF). This occurred over a Spring tide (3rd to 5th July 2012). Three locations were surveyed: at the northern turbine in the array (OR-D8), around the southern turbine in the array (OR-A1), and a control station 2km from the OWF. A YSI 6600 multiparameter instrument comprising CTD (conductivity, temperature, depth) sensors and a nephelometer (optical sidescatter turbidity) was used in conjunction with an OSIL MiniBAT towed system to collect data on water column turbidity conditions (in particular those near to the seabed)." .
_:a98689480d32b81210492da3cfed7607 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c452254fe137e6ac6fce32331f6740f7df354d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a98689480d32b81210492da3cfed7607 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
