_:b7344d84a0d4e853e9525669774f44 <http://schema.org/value> "Dee Estuary" .
_:bc8748cbd22c2939a1edd00fff6e6658 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ab82892fdd9758163d11140adc8ab532 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:bc8748cbd22c2939a1edd00fff6e6658 <http://schema.org/value> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c13069d6522b6afb2c4ffdb5f0871038ae52db> <http://schema.org/description> "A Natural England commissioned intertidal survey conducted by the Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies (CMACS). The aim of the survey was to provide a baseline dataset for future management and condition monitoring of the intertidal interest features in the Dee Estuary. Phase I Biotope Mapping including sediment cores for fauna and Particle Size Analysis." .
_:bc8748cbd22c2939a1edd00fff6e6658 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ab82892fdd9758163d11140adc8ab532 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ab82892fdd9758163d11140adc8ab532 <http://schema.org/value> "Particle Size Analysis" .
