<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5525fd5139e08dbce9e252b12be7275ad1fbbec4> <http://schema.org/description> "Metocean data collected at the Morgan and Mona offshore wind farm sites. Seabed frame mounted instrumentation comprising Nortek Signature (currents and waves), tide gauge, Optical Backscatter sensor (suspended sediments) and vertical profiles of seawater properties. Data collection period November 2021 - February 2023." .
