<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:531d2567078f0c5169d091eeb1ad408977c646ec> <http://schema.org/description> "18 sites were surveyed using a Hamon Grab (0.228m2; 16 litres). A total of 187 species were identified. Formal analysis using Bray and Curtis on MDS. Typical of south coast gravel and sand habitats, (previous study 1994, number 96/2/1490)" .
