<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:52da04e110727b7ff9a6d581d8b06da1dbdf39ab> <http://schema.org/description> "This assessment formed part of a phased project, each stage informing the next. It revealed data recorded by three logs from the geotechnical contractor. The sediments from these recorded geological conditions. [Au(adp)]" .
_:c512a82b0960f0393b2e00a211a5735e <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:f3a1482287ec491c9fbb7bd1175f5176 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
