<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:50896b95accf784c4c3fa3e486ef972da5f3d957> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of these surveys was to address the potential for shallow gas at the four proposed MetMast locations for this Centrica project, situated within the Irish Sea Round 3 Zone ahead of any shallow geotechnical work that is undertaken. This dataset was produced by RPS. Corresponding Centrica Document No: R3-D-EN-013-0128-000000-010 \r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title: Metmast shallow Gas Study \r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1. Documents (.pdf)" .
