_:d06bda609164dab63398444f85cacad7 <http://schema.org/value> "Seacore" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4f2f53d77cd44fb0237f8133a0b39361a355a35d> <http://schema.org/description> "Seacore were commissioned by npower renewables Ltd to undertake preliminary geotechnical site investigation work at the Gwynt y Môr offshore wind farm site." .
