<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4df0b6af849ba6847c159116b812b7f29ea90644> <http://schema.org/description> "A geotechnical investigation for Walney Offshore Windfarm in the Irish Sea. GEO carried out a Cone Penetration Testing campaign with vibrocore sampling. The geotechnical work has included 51 CPTs at 51 wind turbine positions plus 1 CPT at a transformer station." .
