_:a14b0e36c8f604d1a6edb1f2249def48 <http://schema.org/value> "PML Applications Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4d6c324a4e94f93f1105243c3be5645e95cb00fc> <http://schema.org/description> "A subtidal condition assessment and NTZ benthic monitoring survey conducted by PML Applications Ltd as part of a contract for Natural England. Site selection for this survey was predetermined by NE to correspond with previous surveys. Maps of sampling sites with biotope information are presented using GIS." .
