<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4d5ac36f75788936eb126334d1f5e3c49fc47689> <http://schema.org/description> "Environment Agency database (compiled by Ian Humpheryes) contained species richness for all grab samples. The samples containing the top 25 percent richest species number were extracted and used to support the similar biodiversity data provided by national contract." .
