<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4ccee939ef7b96cbbf7bd62fd05c29648e7adf60> <http://schema.org/description> "This document provides a summary of the fish species likely to be present within the Outshore Point Wave Farm project area and discusses potential impacts to fish species from the installation of Oyster wave energy machines. The discussion centres around which impacts should be discussed further within the impact assessment and those that should be scoped out." .
