_:a86f02309b36141f892312df71cd2616 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:b1791197237f437700ed08c2c4ca5a61 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b34b12500a1423c17feb004c920c25dda7e9051> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 98 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the Continental shelf edge, Rockall Trough &amp; Bank and the Anton Dohrn (Ellett line). The data were collected during April and May of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b34b12500a1423c17feb004c920c25dda7e9051> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
