<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4adc2241ed6753405482022ebc7f990c0c7c1821> <http://schema.org/description> "Details and data for baseline marine bird and mammal surveys carried out at the project site in Bardsey Sound and associated studies carried out by Bangor University and SEACAMS partners. The Series is available to be used in any future marine licence applications (tidal or other projects) at this location. Data will have wider potential application and interest." .
