<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4abf90c83968335699adfd5b693841f9f55bc966> <http://schema.org/description> "In order to monitor the abundance and composition of fish and epi-benthic species within the area, otter and beam trawl surveys were undertaken in and adjacent to the Ormonde offshore wind farm. The results of the October 2012 post-construction survey have been compared with those obtained prior to construction in April 2009 and October 2009." .
