<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49f390bb5532340cdd60286403d0b3874c6639ae> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f92b9c2ae821a7b42b10cd6c42ac825 <http://schema.org/value> "Stakmap/Fishermap" .
_:f92b9c2ae821a7b42b10cd6c42ac825 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:f92b9c2ae821a7b42b10cd6c42ac825 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49f390bb5532340cdd60286403d0b3874c6639ae> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f92b9c2ae821a7b42b10cd6c42ac825 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49f390bb5532340cdd60286403d0b3874c6639ae> <http://schema.org/description> "This geodatabase contains manually digitised GI created during the Stakmap/Fishermap participatory mapping research project. The geometries have been cleansed and non polygonal features have been converted into polygons using a 300m buffer. \r\n This feature class summarises the additional information used to describe the interviewees that reported anchoring recreational watercraft. Numbers of interviewees/grid cell are recorded and the mean, minimum and maximum active days per annum and years experience are also presented per grid cell. Individual records have been summarised onto a grid 3/4 nautical mile longitude by 3/8 nautical mile latitude.\r\n This summary data set represents the activities of all interviewees, the summarisation process is considered to anonymised the data to a sufficient degree to protect the individual's privacy. As an added measure of protection, data from interviews has only been included in the amalgamated summary/grid layers if the following conditions have been met. \r\n 1) Permission has been granted for the individual data to be used, or\r\n 2) Five or more separate interviews are represented within a single record." .
_:b05e9615601061a9f7f6e41f9df4a396 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49e5490bf87980692e7088ccbf89dd037e763179> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b05e9615601061a9f7f6e41f9df4a396 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:b05e9615601061a9f7f6e41f9df4a396 <http://schema.org/value> "Carbon Trust" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49e5490bf87980692e7088ccbf89dd037e763179> <http://schema.org/description> "The Crown Estate requested guidance from Carbon Trust and Frazer-Nash Consultancy to understand the influence of power density for future floating offshore wind farms. The focus of this study investigates inter-turbine wake effects in relation to fatigue loading and its variation as the density of turbines changed, aiming to answer the key questions below: \r\n - Is floating wind wake effect fatigue loading and its relationship to power density a key driver for floating wind? \r\n - Is there a significant difference between fixed and floating wake effects due to a floating \r\n foundations additional six degrees of freedom? \r\n - Can a baseline be established for the relationship between power density and fatigue for floating \r\n wind? \r\n The project was divided into three distinct reports, building on each prior reports findings." .
_:b05e9615601061a9f7f6e41f9df4a396 <http://schema.org/value> "Frazer-Nash Consultancy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49e5490bf87980692e7088ccbf89dd037e763179> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b05e9615601061a9f7f6e41f9df4a396 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49cf77d3d34c4a381da3f4b945773ccfa188639b> <http://schema.org/description> "The shapefile contains polygons that indicate the location of crustaceans based on available data and from fishermen's knowledge. The attribute table contains infromation that indicates gear types, seasonality, months present, importance, spawning areas and other comments relating to the location." .
_:ebf0df18f11735b8480d177686b8b1ed <http://schema.org/value> "crustaceans" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49cf77d3d34c4a381da3f4b945773ccfa188639b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ebf0df18f11735b8480d177686b8b1ed .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49cf77d3d34c4a381da3f4b945773ccfa188639b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
