<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:491079d1b191e8afdb0dcd39b2e0c25c4e12efd1> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 34 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the South Atlantic Ocean area specifically the Drake Passage, during November and December of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Southampton Oceanography Centre." .
