<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:48894df3c96de02e1dbdcd2ca284881bc9779058> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:48894df3c96de02e1dbdcd2ca284881bc9779058> <http://schema.org/description> "In order to facilitate English Natureâ??s work, dedicated to identifying, selecting and designating cSACs in the offshore areas of English territorial waters, this work aimed: To validate the distribution of habitats derived from BGS data, and amending and augmenting with new information, at an appropriate scale(s);To add information on relevant habitats not identified from the BGS data in the course of relevant data collation;To fill in significant spatial gaps not covered in the BGS data; To produce a revised map showing known areas of Annex I habitat, including relevant target notes and text; To collate biological information relevant to the habitats listed below and summarise this in brief descriptions of specific geographic areas or locations of habitat and To provide the findings of the study as a standalone report and also a useable GIS workspace with acquired data." .
_:eb9af428cce40beddcbfd168b44db47f <http://schema.org/value> "GIS" .
