<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:47d045e41a541402ff96691e6b8814d67391ccf4> <http://schema.org/description> "Maintenance works were undertaken at the Greater Gabbard Meteorological Mast from October 2006 to June 2008. The various maintenance work was carried out by RadTech/CarlC, Power Point Systems Ltd, Comsec Rigging Services Ltd and Radius Technologies Ltd. The work carried out included removal of existing deployed Latchway cable, installation of new Latchway cable, fitting of new Fog Detector and install power/signal cables, inspection of the Instrumentation, Datalogger systems, Power and Navigational systems." .
