_:d53f30eb418f9f694a81e3e1fc14f5ad <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:479859812da1ee18730b427fc27a27859d550446> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d53f30eb418f9f694a81e3e1fc14f5ad .
