_:bc6354ad966d21afb49606bc32185130 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:474d7105dbcf1925b153441fe8251970ee5bc8b2> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 21 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August 1994 from stations in the North West Indian Ocean and Arabian Sea, between 18.5 - 20 N and 58 - 59.5 E. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
_:d0114b665d74595d1bd90df7d41f7d7f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
