<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:453578caf89dc3bc0f1b13facbb3f8ade384d0fa> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 7 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel areas specifically between the Isle of Man and Liverpool Bay, during the month of March 1978. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
