_:bb3a59f3d9a1c22b440418491da2cfcc <http://schema.org/value> "DONG\r\nEnergy" .
_:eaf307cf92a6e8107ac332b816aeff79 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:43a9a855511817f7db66b1a5f0cdb83715ee9080> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG\r\nEnergy to undertake a Multibeam Echosounder (MBES) survey at the Gunfleet Sands 3\r\nOffshore Windfarm in the Thames Estuary.\r\n\r\nThe scope of work, for the September 2014 survey included:\r\n1. MBES survey of 50m wide corridor along Export Cable Route between the\r\nWTG F0 and the HDD exit point [See Figure 1].\r\n2. MBES survey of the WTG foundations F00 and G00 and inter-array cable.\r\n\r\nThis report covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 5th &amp; 6th September 2014,\r\nalong the Export Cable Route and around Turbines F00 and G00. The survey work was\r\ncarried out using the PLA survey vessel ‘Yantlet’, with bathymetric data being collected using\r\na hull-mounted Reson SeaBat 8125h MBES." .
_:bb3a59f3d9a1c22b440418491da2cfcc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:43a9a855511817f7db66b1a5f0cdb83715ee9080> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
