_:a3eea719ff04650b3fb6825bbcbbd648 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e661df85a7f226c259945c5c9534837e <http://schema.org/value> "English Channel" .
