<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:429ec0eb3bb6ac6dd8de3e4c49b5838ac335d8f4> <http://schema.org/description> "Partrac Ltd was contracted by SSE Renewables to undertake collection of metocean data (tidal\r\ncurrents, waves, turbulence, turbidity) at Cantick Head, Island of South Walls (Hoy, Orkneys),\r\nScotland. Two instrumented, ballasted bed-frames each comprising a 300 kHz T-RDI acoustic\r\nDoppler current profile (ADCP) and an Aquatec-Seapoint logging turbidity sensor, were deployed\r\nat two sites (Site 6 and Site 8) onto the seabed over the period 15th November, 2010, to 4th\r\nJanuary, 2011." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:429ec0eb3bb6ac6dd8de3e4c49b5838ac335d8f4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
