_:a5e1b65d12b6f1ee016e5920517edbc7 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
_:a5e1b65d12b6f1ee016e5920517edbc7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:423d97162163b0413de6917ce4fef3dda4b25516> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited (FAOL) was contracted by DONG Energy to perform a geotechnical\r\ninvestigation for the design and installation of foundation and demonstration wind turbines. The work initial comprised 2 x PCPT using the Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited Wheeldrive Seacalf Seabed CPT unit." .
_:a5e1b65d12b6f1ee016e5920517edbc7 <http://schema.org/value> "Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited" .
_:a5e1b65d12b6f1ee016e5920517edbc7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:cb85412ef5569b26f2460d75918adee7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:423c01e222e9cb345aeb441f307042a17743f7cb> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental baseline survey conducted 15 and 15/10/2006 along a proposed pipeline and umbilical route between the Curlew FPSO and the proposed Curlew C UC-P1 Well location in UKCS 29/7" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:423c01e222e9cb345aeb441f307042a17743f7cb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
