<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:42279ee84c3d973b50514bf765ec0a447bc07e53> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines Navigations and Risk Assessment surveys carried out at the site of the Gunfleet Sand 2 Offshore Wind Farm. The surveys undertaken include vessel traffic surveys and traffic analysis." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:42279ee84c3d973b50514bf765ec0a447bc07e53> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d7e04949b544073806a2659c500f8467 .
