_:b42790e8318340ecfdfc97ee407509e9 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica\r\n(Lincs) Limited" .
_:e572b2a6cfb45393b9fbc66255f6928a <http://schema.org/value> "Lincolnshire" .
_:e572b2a6cfb45393b9fbc66255f6928a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b42790e8318340ecfdfc97ee407509e9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4213707443a3ecebe0b8c519da1e20d7183e42b0> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited has performed a geotechnical investigation for Centrica\r\n(Lincs) Limited to assess the soil conditions for the proposed Lincs Windfarm Export\r\nCable Route Survey in the North Sea, offshore Lincolnshire. A summary of the site work\r\nis presented in Table 1.\r\nGeneral soil conditions encountered were variable but in summary comprised loose to\r\nmedium dense slightly clayey to clayey fine to medium sand. In some cores this is\r\nunderlain by interbedded soft clay and sand. Very dense or hard material was\r\nencountered at shallow depths at a number of locations." .
_:b42790e8318340ecfdfc97ee407509e9 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ea8631fc1285aca423e434d401a71148 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4200523bdcad3225878e0dbfe607b836d942b4ef> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ea8631fc1285aca423e434d401a71148 .
_:eb9994e5301ec0f70b6aee73ae7956c5 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4200523bdcad3225878e0dbfe607b836d942b4ef> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:eb9994e5301ec0f70b6aee73ae7956c5 .
