<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:41d6a83e7658a2b240c9eede88ba074641b7140c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 36 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in November 2006 from stations throughout Liverpool Bay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the National Oceanography Centre (formerly the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory), Liverpool Bay/Irish Sea Coastal Observatory initiative." .
_:b95bac3e58cd301746178c3c12e00ddf <http://schema.org/value> "EGS (International) Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4189af14defe90676f77a800e4d95796a25a0793> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4189af14defe90676f77a800e4d95796a25a0793> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b95bac3e58cd301746178c3c12e00ddf .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4189af14defe90676f77a800e4d95796a25a0793> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd was contracted by Centrica in 2011 to undertake a geophysical survey of the Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing (L&amp;ID) Offshore Wind Farms and export cable route corridors (Figure 1) in order to determine the nature and distribution of broad scale sediment types and identify seabed features. This survey is the phase 1 of the third post-construction geophysical survey of the L&amp;ID wind farms and was carried out in order to fulfil the FEPA licence requirements.\r\n\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title Lynn and Inner Dowsing Offshore Wind Farms : Year 3 Post-Construction Survey (2011) Phase 1 – Geophysical Survey\r\n\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1. ESRI shapefiles(.shp); 2.Images(.tif, ) ; 3.tide(.tid); 4. Spreadsheet (xlsx) 5. Documents and Charts (.pdf); 6. Raw data (.all, .xtf, asvp)." .
_:b95bac3e58cd301746178c3c12e00ddf <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica" .
