_:f8ab2f1f75a853f3550bc884ade0740 <http://schema.org/value> "FORCE Technology" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:41300785dc08ccb03abb5fb2ae861a3aa6a55e8c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f8ab2f1f75a853f3550bc884ade0740 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG" .
_:f8ab2f1f75a853f3550bc884ade0740 <http://schema.org/value> "Division for Maritime Industry" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:41300785dc08ccb03abb5fb2ae861a3aa6a55e8c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f8ab2f1f75a853f3550bc884ade0740 .
_:f8ab2f1f75a853f3550bc884ade0740 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:41300785dc08ccb03abb5fb2ae861a3aa6a55e8c> <http://schema.org/description> "This project comprises the work carried out by FORCE Technology, Division for Maritime Industry, (DMI) according to the consultancy agreement between DONG and FORCE Technology. The report covers the results of the real-time simulations carried out in the simulation study in the proposed fairway. The report furthermore comprises conclusions and documentation of the simulations.\r\nThe overall objective of the simulations is to evaluate whether passages through the fairway between the Walney Offshore Windfarm and the Ormonde and Barrow Windfarm is reasonable safe. Different extreme weather conditions of wind and current were considered." .
_:f8ab2f1f75a853f3550bc884ade0740 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bb7782ab2b09ad2e8e955806127a8d88 <http://schema.org/name> "migratory marine species" .
_:c3e2a73620287a18640d7129973f5083 <http://schema.org/value> "CAR licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:411b7a661541dded86ad5674ade5bbaa3c56d7c8> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic monitoring of the sea bed adjacent to the fish farm as a requirement of the CAR licence for the site. Grab samples collected in proximity to the farm and at two reference locations. Samples analysed for: benthos, redox, psa, carbon." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:411b7a661541dded86ad5674ade5bbaa3c56d7c8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bb7782ab2b09ad2e8e955806127a8d88 .
