_:a48ac9342995b58f1f56e857baf098ec <http://schema.org/value> "Berwickshire" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:410e0d73187df3c62daa7ed21e883cae9768ad70> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a48ac9342995b58f1f56e857baf098ec .
