<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:410e0d73187df3c62daa7ed21e883cae9768ad70> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:410e0d73187df3c62daa7ed21e883cae9768ad70> <http://schema.org/description> "This report presents the findings of surveys carried out at seven locations within the Berwickshire and North Northumberland Coast European Marine Site" .
_:a48ac9342995b58f1f56e857baf098ec <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
