<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4052f384ffe4b7436004ae5f5eee22525962a09e> <http://schema.org/description> "Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd. was commissioned by ScottishPower Generation Ltd. to conduct a combined baseline benthic survey for WoDS and Walney Offshore Windfarm projects. Survey operations were conducted in April/May 2005 and comprised of a programme of grab sampling and beam trawling to provide infaunal, epifaunal and associated sediment samples to characterise the benthos and sediment quality over the area of interest. This report details results of the combined survey of both sites." .
