_:fd136ed121d1b30aa81fbc6bd536f488 <http://schema.org/value> "Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:401abe5ceddf7e07a22f839414af75bf091f1ed5> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 6 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically at the north of Scotland, outskirts of Aberdeen Bay, Scapa Flow, SW of Papa Bank and NW of Orkney. Data were collected during June and July of 2005. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:df0422ad9ef234cd1c4c6292b775d4ff <http://schema.org/value> "Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4008b295e405228558c4d8c31d83cad6fca3eb58> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:df0422ad9ef234cd1c4c6292b775d4ff .
_:e28b073e82f7f935e8df495497f4c60a <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:df0422ad9ef234cd1c4c6292b775d4ff <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:e28b073e82f7f935e8df495497f4c60a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4008b295e405228558c4d8c31d83cad6fca3eb58> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 48 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and the Rockall to Malin Head section. The data were collected during July of 1991. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:e28b073e82f7f935e8df495497f4c60a <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
