<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3fa9756c89dbb6fe0dd82a54c6bd2ab041c3901a> <http://schema.org/description> "Diver core survey undertaken at a Maerl beds in Wyre Sound and off Tingwall, Orkney by Heriot-Watt University for SNH on the 10th, 12th and 14th June 2015. Sampling was for the purpose of a Heriot-Watt University PhD project where SNH were the studentship partner. Replicate core samples were collected by divers at three sites in Wyre Sound and one site off Tingwall." .
_:b5752974bd22ec8568e4ced66586b882 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
