<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3f975d8773d885ecb76b2c342d50e25ab85facf1> <http://schema.org/description> "The intertidal strandline survey aims to record marine life within the intertidal envrionments. This survey is conducted within the intertidal environments of Alderney, Channel Islands. The rationale of the survey is to a) record marine life on Alderney and b) engage local residents on the marine environment." .
