_:f5a456ceba30002794d6e97f4769587e <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:a60b0717dc3a3a93b51cc91357f1ae20 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:a60b0717dc3a3a93b51cc91357f1ae20 <http://schema.org/value> "Lincolnshire" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3eab566556d01b31b2d8b05d48c2b1f6d5551522> <http://schema.org/description> "The Lincs OWF Project involves the development of an offshore wind farm off the coast of Skegness (Lincolnshire) by Centrica Renewable Energy. High resolution multibeam bathymetric and high resolution side-scan sonar geophysical survey data were required along the newly laid LINCS LS41-42 array cable.\r\n\r\nMultibeam echo sounder (MBES) and Side-Scan Sonar (SSS) data were acquired." .
_:f5a456ceba30002794d6e97f4769587e <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewable Energy" .
_:f5a456ceba30002794d6e97f4769587e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
