_:ab3ec6a765f678aabe8a720aa30b5b98 <http://schema.org/value> "CAR licence" .
_:ab3ec6a765f678aabe8a720aa30b5b98 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
