<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d251856b33a1a895136ff697753eaa2fec690ef> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 44 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January - February 2000 along the Ellett Line between Scotland and Rockall. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Association for Marine Science." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d251856b33a1a895136ff697753eaa2fec690ef> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b9f3d65a6618830d90645956e26282ec .
