<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3c8c7a6d9b42886d90ec6bd12f3b58b9757760df> <http://schema.org/description> "The Humber Gateway Export Cables Laying Plan has been produced as a requirement of the Humber Gateway Marine Licence, and submitted to the Marine Management Organisation. The Plan sets out the route of the two export cables and the methodology of cable laying and installation. The export cables have been installed in Quarter 3 and 4 of 2013." .
