<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3bdc3dc3ba1125111d5021623fff7fe68d002522> <http://schema.org/description> "In this project observations from two moorings deployed on Gunfleet Sand from January 2002 to February 2003 were made, with wind data collected from an anemometer (meterological or met) mast deployed at the southern end of Gunfleet Sand. The moorings recorded water level, current, wave and turbidity data, while the met mast collected wind speed and direction at six heights" .
