_:af13c1d96e6a8534641b4b3ce7148c0e <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3b835febc559d4bbc40269e5b865f726112689da> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 33 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1998 along the Atlantic Meridional Transect (AMT) from the UK to the Falkland Islands. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the Atlantic Meridional Transect (Phase 1) programme." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3b835febc559d4bbc40269e5b865f726112689da> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:efbbd859f22b044bd231ea8c5a9ee0f3 .
