_:ea8fcf72bc6c47b52a680b4cefd4b15d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3b39f2343096b878f4837ac98c08b24a4675142e> <http://schema.org/description> "Brough Head Wave Farm Limited (BHWFL) is proposing to develop a 10 MW wave energy\r\ndemonstration project off Marwick Head on the west coast of Orkney. This document reviews the extent\r\nof coverage and gives details of the review of the seabed survey footage, including describing the\r\nbiotopes present in the area." .
_:ea8fcf72bc6c47b52a680b4cefd4b15d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:ea8fcf72bc6c47b52a680b4cefd4b15d <http://schema.org/value> "Marwick Head" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3b2a3bd3a2c4d470a6ac9e8fc287c9e877b5a736> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
