<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3b189708865dbb78dd577ad6ab3f6578277c8a98> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys in and around South Devon and Cornwall, including St. Georges Island and the Dart Esutuary. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 1994 Devon Wildlife Trust St.Georges Island Cornwall Littoral survey and the 1994-1995 Devon Wildlife Trust Dart Estuary Littoral survey." .
