<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3a1ffad79620305c2258893671139625e18d46e7> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in July 1983. It incorporates a survey supporting a neutrally-buoyant float experiment in the vicinity of 32 N, 20 W, a section along 24 W between 29 N and 24 N and a section between 24 N, 24 W and 20 N, 22 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
