<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3a034f963295ac7df53a26b6b1bf69ba0590075e> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1986. It incorporates a 15-hour anchor station of hourly profiles at 54.65N, 3.73W in the eastern Irish Sea. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
