<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:39dbcfa6ac607981975cef7e8a7c7ffeca2530b1> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 17 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1999 from stations at La Chapelle Bank in the Bay of Biscay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Liège Department of Astrophysics Geophysics and Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
