<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:39c78da3e08b43a776c6f1f0285ee59ab89d664f> <http://schema.org/description> "The met mast at Race Bank was transferred in February 2014 from CENTRICA to DONG Energy. In November, 2014 RES installed a monitoring system with a small meteorological station. This series contains all reports and datasets from DONG Energy. All datasets and reports from before the transfer to DONG Energy can be found in series '2006-2013, Centrica and AMEC, Race Bank, Offshore Wind Farm Meteorological Mast'." .
