<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3921d48b320ec25f5c5da5c5c9902679b4102cec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c1b55ce79465764284001931a7a5e936 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
