_:f258591871c3e3b18b03c0442084a5be <http://schema.org/value> "London Array" .
_:f258591871c3e3b18b03c0442084a5be <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:39143418dcceeada474fa15dd4200a3c65ff63e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:39143418dcceeada474fa15dd4200a3c65ff63e2> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the EIA of the London Array Offshore Wind Farm specific desk studies were commissioned on the key bird species found in the area. For the red-throated diver, this included: feeding ecology (Cork Ecology 2004); and a desk review of their population ecology (NERI 2005)." .
_:f258591871c3e3b18b03c0442084a5be <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
