_:ce3afa0c56f9ebd23121548d0579149e <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:bf49bfa819aa55a436a09b6c514cb28e <http://schema.org/value> "North Channel" .
_:bf49bfa819aa55a436a09b6c514cb28e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3829d01c82e4cf44a2481499577cae4a9446de49> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 10 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and surrounding regions (Celtic Sea, St. George's Channel, North Channel and Clyde Sea) during June 1981. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
_:bf49bfa819aa55a436a09b6c514cb28e <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
