<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:37e602908046ec96b40d91c175ae90e591c88ab9> <http://schema.org/description> "Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) has commissioned ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) to investigate future morphological change across the Race Bank offshore wind farm site, with a view to providing estimations of future bed levels change at individual turbine locations. In particular, the work has developed estimations of the potential deepest and shallowest sea bed levels that are likely to be encountered over the next 20 and 40 years." .
