<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:37e5ac392ab19c84f2a295048197af9f584f7121> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 69 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the area specifically around the east coast of Scotland, Moray Firth and the Firth of Firth, during February of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
