_:fd21dbc54a24ded532e08f2463d8c85e <http://schema.org/value> "Lidar - bathymetric survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35a092f805be773795a3d8e4b056a5b495ae55db> <http://schema.org/description> "This processed bathymetric data set has been derived from a Lidar - bathymetric survey. The source data was collected, validated and processed for the purpose of Safety Of Life At Sea (SOLAS). The data set must not be used for navigation or to create products that could be used for navigation." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35956c02d7476d738075d7ee52aa44129d77dc54> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b4ce664a953dae5aba738e44b45a816f .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35956c02d7476d738075d7ee52aa44129d77dc54> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:cf011d81d6ce79c1a61851d389d840c0 <http://schema.org/value> "beam" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35956c02d7476d738075d7ee52aa44129d77dc54> <http://schema.org/description> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies Ltd (CMACS) undertook a benthic sampling survey in the Southern North Sea during November/December 2004 and April/May 2005 to inform the envirnomental impact assessment for the proposed Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Farm. There was a suite of offshore ecological survey work comprising drop down camera survey, grab sampling and beam and otter trawling which together provide a benthic ecological characterisation of the proposed development site." .
_:b4ce664a953dae5aba738e44b45a816f <http://schema.org/value> "Southern North Sea" .
_:dbbf73825ce7a65584c78fd092efa6f8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
