_:b99359e61d57880d2e23e6da39cf902a <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3552857125135adf63521602d720c7dfe9de7d0e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3552857125135adf63521602d720c7dfe9de7d0e> <http://schema.org/description> "Data collected from stakeholders within the Southeast of England region (Balanced Seas region), by Balanced Seas project team between January 2010 and October 2010. Interview data was processed to create a gridded 1km x 1km layer of relative effort for the specific recreational activity (according to the number of interviews undertaken across the Balanced Seas region). First output was published July 2010, although updates were made after this date due to more interview data." .
_:b99359e61d57880d2e23e6da39cf902a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b99359e61d57880d2e23e6da39cf902a <http://schema.org/value> "Balanced Seas project team" .
_:b2a415c49daf2a1c372ae74de3374496 <http://schema.org/value> "Balanced Seas region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35527f5033808592e9a80d2ee2dd87160ded495e> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 50 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically to the east of Scotland, during January and February of 2000. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:e235bdf79165801abfc34316f541a72e <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
