<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35023632f9660be83ee0586d4b4f763a8e0de5d4> <http://schema.org/description> "Twenty-four potential or actual saline lagoons were considered and assessed. Only the Fleet is clearly a saline lagoon. These other sites merit further consideration for various reasons. Sites stretch from Lodmor, Weymouth to Cleson Meadows, Plymouth. Descriptions are mainly limited to physical conditions. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder." .
