<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:32c75395e5996e9c32f1afded8bcabfcb3a2821a> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys of North Devon including Hartland Quey, Babbacombe, Budleigh and Plymouth. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1992-93 Devon Wildlife Trust Hartland Quay littoral survey, 1992-94 Devon Wildlife Trust Babbacombe littoral survey, 1992-94 Devon Wildlife Trust Budleigh littoral survey and 1992-94 Devon Wildlife Trust Plymouth littoral survey." .
