_:b980ef8ea966a1fe2054f6290f2d4944 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:324f843f37b0510bdb013c347ff6a0ba238ddaf1> <http://schema.org/description> "Subtidal benthic soft sediment repeat sampling is carried out\r\nwith SAC's across Wales to monitor Large Shallow Inlets and Bays, Estuaries and Sandbank features. Some of these data are collected in conjunction with the Environment Agency as part of their Water Framework Directive monitoring programme so other data from these locations or the surrounding area may be available upon request from the EA." .
_:b980ef8ea966a1fe2054f6290f2d4944 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
