_:ea9ba72349270133b4a55c3a15351d25 <http://schema.org/value> "Crepidula fornicata" .
_:d52b43253b6ce84a60196ad43a0eb8a1 <http://schema.org/value> "Outer Harbour" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:31a7ab4833501c3ea5e3f76075613ff870e5c76e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
