<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:30d5a0313472905ef22b73cf1b7538fa62647e7a> <http://schema.org/description> "This project looks at the effects of dredging on adjacent sediment composition, S. spinulosa aggregations and benthic communities. Eight sampling events were undertaken over two years. The first one immediately prior to the start of dredging, and the other seven at various intervals thereafter. It also tries to determine the life-cycle of S. spinulosa." .
