<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3099c59166e4cbe1def5b068759533d86513d6da> <http://schema.org/description> "Magellan House Marketing was commissioned in the Autumn 2001 by GREP, a wind farm development company, to carry out a public consultation programme for their proposed offshore wind farm on the Kentish Flats. The brief for the project was to inform and where possible involve in discussion, all local residents, and local and national organisations that might have an interest in the windfarm, thereby giving them an opportunity to comment and/or air their concerns." .
