<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2ef4447fe9052da5ef5c14f9350cecd6a1305ce8> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series presents wind, wave and level criteria for the proposed marine current turbine generating facility to be constructed within Strangford Narrows. Criteria are provided for two sites within Strangford Narrows as well as for a location outside the southern mouth of Strangford Narrows." .
