<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2e53548b5aaf5afefb926d63e1d02c2dbb60a1b4> <http://schema.org/description> "An assessment of the fish and shellfish stocks in the eastern Irish Sea. The report was prepared as a desk study which drew on information provided by the DEFRA, FSU, CEFAS, advice from NWNW SFC, published literature and the internet.\r\n\r\nEnvironmental Statement Appendix 7." .
