<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2e30c8d6d65764cb9d5c4d4f2719e0681ef5304e> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the environmental monitoring under the conditions of the Ormonde Offshore Wind Farm Marine License (L/2011/00201/10), Vessel based transect surveys of sea birds in and around Ormonde offshore wind farm were conducted in May, July, August and September. The series includes reports and data from the ornithological surveys." .
