<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2e0a0d2028c2d0380f5e6275016f1d8062fde771> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2e0a0d2028c2d0380f5e6275016f1d8062fde771> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 94 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates parts of the Ellett Line (Rockall to the Anton Dohrn Seamount and Mull to the shelf break); sections from the Scottish mainland to Harris and Lewis; Scotland to Northern Ireland (3 sections) and Islay to Kintyre plus a CTD survey of the Clyde Sea. The data were collected during November and December of 1984. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2dfd763ba0d3c287cf44768eb98f4f4c57d24de1> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c73db841a94c3d7c02ba7ca34a83dd4d .
