<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2dfd763ba0d3c287cf44768eb98f4f4c57d24de1> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in July 1964 along the European continental shelf in the Western Approaches. Samples were collected using a number of methods including a 4 ft rectangular dredge, and an anchor dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
