<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2b9b0a7eb7b1362cd51077faac446458f659e72d> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned in April 2013 by Centrica Renewable Energy Ltd.\r\n(CREL) and Renewable Energy Systems Ltd. (RES) to carry out post-construction\r\nsurveys on the LINCS Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) and associated export cable route.\r\n\r\nThe survey was completed under LOGIC Terms and Conditions. The survey works\r\nconducted by MV Chartwell were carried out between 4th and 8th May 2013. The\r\nsurvey works conducted by MV Freja were carried out between 16th and 26th April\r\n2013. Multibeam and side scan sonar were carried out." .
_:ca1ba78c7abdc5dbea939a5877ea529c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
