<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2b262bc2b7013224c6d989aa57e5fad04c0fa46d> <http://schema.org/description> "Volunteer divers recorded species observations on record cards for the Underwater Observation Scheme established in 1977 as part of the Underwater Conservation Year. This dataset represents the records card collected in MNCR Sector UK11 Liverpool Bay and Solway." .
