<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a74fa63d720f2eef73cdebba9cd721df7b61ebe> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a74fa63d720f2eef73cdebba9cd721df7b61ebe> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fe70d9e590615549b19d55fa5b32277f .
_:fe70d9e590615549b19d55fa5b32277f <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:fe70d9e590615549b19d55fa5b32277f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a74fa63d720f2eef73cdebba9cd721df7b61ebe> <http://schema.org/description> "Report following an ecological study assessing the effects of the first 5 years of the Lundy No Take Zone (NTZ). The report introduces Lundy, it's natural history and the NTZ. Three monitoring programmes were designed to test a number of hypotheses. These monitoring programmes looked at lobsters and crabs, scallops and sessile epifauna. For each of the monitoring programmes the assessment methods, results and analysis are presented. Finally, a general discussion including interpretation of the results and a summary is presented." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a6f59ce7e1694fd965a2c1e243e3b2f53c17ce9> <http://schema.org/description> "The objectives of this study were to: record the sensitivity and resilience of the benthic community to diving impacts; monitor the site for evidence of diver induced damage either side of a peak diving period and provide an expert eye judgement on whether the fauna is depauperate in relation to the types of community found at other locations across the BNNC reef feature." .
_:ed9dac6502128f97c86bda3b689fb629 <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a6f59ce7e1694fd965a2c1e243e3b2f53c17ce9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ed9dac6502128f97c86bda3b689fb629 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a6f59ce7e1694fd965a2c1e243e3b2f53c17ce9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
