_:b83c83ceeb5a7f85ff623763846ad648 <http://schema.org/value> "Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory" .
_:fb3b8aefc68b7176a590de270f0f897d <http://schema.org/value> "north coast of Scotland" .
_:b83c83ceeb5a7f85ff623763846ad648 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:293b8207faacc7a0cb6f2d1dfc286bcfcdebab87> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 80 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, at each trawling position from the Inner Seas off the West Coast of Scotland, the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel, and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically from the north coast of Scotland to the north west and north east of Ireland including the waters surrounding Northern Ireland and the Isle of Man. The data was collected during November and December 2003. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
