<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:292863e4370d045b4e499a588f31ae03047d4072> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG Energy to undertake repeat Multibeam Echosounder (MBES) and Side Scan Sonar (SSS) surveys at the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Windfarm in the Thames Estuary. The surveys are required for the FEPA Licence Numbers: Gunfleet Sands 1 31919/09/0 and Gunfleet Sands 2 33723/09/0." .
