<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:27dafcdbf29bb90ccbac0bc19442c98862e92b44> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 16 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Greenland Sea, Norwegian Sea area specifically at the Norwegian Sea, Lofoten Basin, Svinoey NW (standard section) during October and November 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Marine Research, Norway as part of the Monitoring the Atlantic Inflow toward the Arctic (MAIA) project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:27dafcdbf29bb90ccbac0bc19442c98862e92b44> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cc604dc661ed127c045210882695be17 .
