<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:27a4fad320c20c9364de882a7faee42a72cc4bf6> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during August 1978. It incorporates triangular surveys around each of the Joint Air Sea Interaction Experiment (JASIN) moorings NW of the Anton Dohrn Seamount. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
