<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:270b591ab3dfface5bc929504334cc74c9307cca> <http://schema.org/description> "Seasearch surveys from the Dorset coast during 2008.\r\n Photographs were taken on all Dorset Wildlife Trust charter weekends and are held by DWT in Dorchester. \r\n Records are verified post survey and biotopes are assigned according the information available by DWT using the MNCR 04.05 key." .
