_:b2b73d7abe1049e5791b334cda4d7ff0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:24ad108824e19f109f0843020a9e22f7a5573cae> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a921dd59fd0055df695c26e3dfa688f6 .
