_:cc774af1f3cb0c38b1bf96919fce615d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22cfaaf55f5413362fe572a7ac149fd842e1dfde> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:af842e47612d2815a9c1e9d83431a9db .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22cfaaf55f5413362fe572a7ac149fd842e1dfde> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 86 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the the Extended Ellett Line, that runs from Iceland to Rockall and on to Ardnamurchan Point in Scotland, during June of 2009. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Association for Marine Science as part of the Oceans 2025 programme." .
_:af842e47612d2815a9c1e9d83431a9db <http://schema.org/value> "Ardnamurchan Point" .
