<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22b9be127c904edfab6452e31590117c054eb8b5> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1987. It incorporates a single CTD profile from the Irish Sea (54 27.5N, 3 48.7W) from 44 reported deployments for the cruise. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
