_:ceee2b2beb625db03834b06c8cfaf137 <http://schema.org/value> "British Oceanographic Data Centre" .
_:b906a4f4283b835a6bbd9b9357afebe7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
