_:ac7b0ac7a2bd8f4aef70b7e835386016 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ac7b0ac7a2bd8f4aef70b7e835386016 <http://schema.org/value> "DTi" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:21410b7a44d5bb4e8b872181eed895e2dedddc20> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:21410b7a44d5bb4e8b872181eed895e2dedddc20> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the assessment carried out by DTi to examine the effects of Offshore wind farms on birds. The specific objectives of the project were to:\r\n-produce a review of the available reports, data and information relating to the effects of offshore wind farms on birds\r\n-establish the locations of offshore sites and areas that hold important bird populations\r\n-identify the bird migratory routes that may encroach upon prime offshore wind energy development areas\r\n-identify gaps and uncertainties in the existing knowledge and recommend further studies that are needed to address these\r\n-provide an inventory of planned and ongoing studies" .
_:ac7b0ac7a2bd8f4aef70b7e835386016 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
