<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2066395c28bec201a298e7c692517610fcbb0f3f> <http://schema.org/description> "Report following surveying of subtidal sandbanks within the candidate Special Areas of Conservation (cSAC) at the Isles of Scilly, Fal and Helford. The survey was undertaken as part of the designation process of the cSACs. The objectives were to undertake sediment sampling and establish monitoring sites and baseline values for attributes (such as sediment characteristics and species composition). This dataset contains the biodiversity data collected in the survey collated by site." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2066395c28bec201a298e7c692517610fcbb0f3f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ac460c9a35ada94800097d36fcbb94ed .
