<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f3e3f2302af02afee5069c120671bd3793244b2> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Bay of Biscay and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically the Madeira Abyssal Plain (Great Meteor East), during June and July of 1985. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:a910b499117d946056f2ab7ac12f73e2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
