<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f33768b31d634fb9c20745cc9f54c9693ed7f80> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 87 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and CTD surveys of the Land-Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) section and the Clyde Sea. The data were collected during September of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:c2ce51f4b68f549718f65422fb7ee314 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
