<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1da925d158b7652b36d21958397ac452edc8d2ae> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 171 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August-September 1995 from stations on the Malin shelf break, at approximately 56.5 N, 9.0 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1da925d158b7652b36d21958397ac452edc8d2ae> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e4baddf3cc41205b9c19ed510b329b23 .
