_:fa6e68d8ff2a5648c8e79ea6c0797d91 <http://schema.org/value> "Lundy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1d9158e98bf519ff6fe19767bd8a2799911b4a00> <http://schema.org/description> "Species data collected from Lundy. Intertidal and offshore presence and count data recorded on Lundy between 1947 to 1951." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1d9158e98bf519ff6fe19767bd8a2799911b4a00> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
