_:b072f29b4f50be4f295508b1eaff4281 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f108642060cbb63cf317878cf73e0715 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1d4462025d2334986d930b2fd2f85228f500df8f> <http://schema.org/description> "Data collected from stakeholders within the Southeast of England region (Balanced Seas region), by Balanced Seas project team between January 2010 and October 2010. Interview data was processed to create a gridded 1km x 1km layer of relative effort for the specific recreational activity (according to the number of interviews undertaken across the Balanced Seas region). First output was published July 2010, although updates were made after this date due to more interview data." .
_:f108642060cbb63cf317878cf73e0715 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
