<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a5c4dfb64744ccb4b25d64d023ade66f163c5be> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 21 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1993 from stations in the North East Atlantic Ocean, in a grid centred at approximately 49.25 N, 12 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Leibniz Institute for Baltic Sea Research as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
