<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:19da741f300ee0b45195545064c17b76480c3db8> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 35 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in February 2007 throughout Liverpool Bay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the National Oceanography Centre (formerly the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory), Liverpool Bay/Irish Sea Coastal Observatory initiative." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:19da741f300ee0b45195545064c17b76480c3db8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f876849d536f991818be867154d9fe36 .
