<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:188592515e478d10e48a96734a41d58aca5e8b22> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August 1979. It incorporates measurements for a density survey around moored instrument arrays in the North Channel and on the Malin Shelf. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory." .
