_:b0025dee940e61b744003d7de5c3b0ac <http://schema.org/value> "Sizewell Power Station" .
_:f0ec813858e79de24e841e3f0296407f <http://schema.org/value> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies Ltd" .
_:f0ec813858e79de24e841e3f0296407f <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:17e9e690b8b2a1d3bad904f11c6c02707e40cfe7> <http://schema.org/description> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies Ltd (CMACS) was commissioned by Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Limited (GGOWL) to undertake baseline terrestrial and interitdal ecology surveys to identify habitats and species present at and adjacent to potential areas of onshore works (cable route and sub-station) south of Sizewell Power Station. Focus for the survey was provided by two possible locations for an onshore sub-station footprint areas and cable routes were known at the time of survey." .
