_:b0a8ac1c725b4d7edbc034e1344332df <http://schema.org/value> "saltmarsh vegetation" .
_:b0a8ac1c725b4d7edbc034e1344332df <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
