<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:16b0aa023dd4834c26fb64baa68d302f4139ed4f> <http://schema.org/description> "These are the by-catch data (excluding fish) but includes all other organisms along with stone content of dredges for the 1992 - 1997 scallop survey. In this study, spatial differences in the distribution of of by-catch assemblages from scallop fishing grounds in the North Irish Sea were examined." .
