<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:153904740c01f5ebe678e5e9b8ac02eb99bc128e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b9c65d64e78791bf84897760afb3a9f8 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:153904740c01f5ebe678e5e9b8ac02eb99bc128e> <http://schema.org/description> "Scotrenewables Tidal Power Ltd (SRTP) has been awarded an Agreement for Lease (AfL) for a\r\ncommercial tidal energy project to be located at Lashy Sound between the islands of Eday and Sanday in\r\nOrkney. Lashy Sound is in close proximity to a number of designated sites for wildlife; the Calf of Eday\r\nSpecial Protection Area (SPA) is designated for internationally important numbers of breeding seabirds\r\nand the Sanday Special Area of Conservation (SAC) is designated for nationally important numbers of\r\nbreeding harbour seals. A 24 month programme of baseline surveys was undertaken for the proposed Lashy Sound tidal array.\r\nThe aim of these surveys was to characterise the use of the proposed SRTP development site by birds,\r\nmarine mammals and basking sharks." .
_:affb73a26a990f1af2341636ec8180d2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b9c65d64e78791bf84897760afb3a9f8 <http://schema.org/value> "Orkney" .
