<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12d5d50d32e8b948888cadc51af177f848378ba7> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the investigation for cable landfall sites for the Irish Sea Zone (ISZ), there was a requirement to collect one month of oceanographic (wave and tidal current) data from three potential cable landfall sites off the Anglesey coast. This is to provide calibration data for a hydrodynamic model of the area. This report summarises the QC procedure and results from data collected from Nortek AWACs (Acosutic Waves and Currents) deployed at sites 8 and 12.\r\n\r\nThe QC process was done by Patrac Ltd , on behalf of Celtic Array Ltd.\r\n\r\nAvailable data set are Raw data in WPR format, Wave and Current Data Site in xls format, plots images in png formats and reports in pdf formats\r\n\r\nAssociated reports are SE-D-EV-128-0117-501035-001; SE-D-EV-128-0117-501035-002" .
_:c4ba7bba1c74eaef2bdf2367e9d33a24 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
