<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12606ae53602660d7ef55b0c005e1aa178578c55> <http://schema.org/description> "Dudgeon Offshore Wind Farm is located on relatively flat, uniform seabed over 32km north of the town of Cromer in north Norfolk. The project is subject to an Environmental Impact Assessment to systematically examine and assess the impacts and effects of the development on the environment. The whole Environmental Statement, including appendices, is shown here." .
_:f70b203f739ad599771122b9194f82a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f70b203f739ad599771122b9194f82a <http://schema.org/value> "Cromer" .
