_:f70b203f739ad599771122b9194f82a <http://schema.org/value> "north Norfolk" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12606ae53602660d7ef55b0c005e1aa178578c55> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
