<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:11eda20f71a26cb53cacdba81b213d9af71b2a80> <http://schema.org/description> "On behalf of Vestas, CNS provided the Cable Installation Barges CIB Pontra Maris and the Fetsy L, complete with support anchor handling vessels and tow tug for the installation of the export cables. From this installation spread, the cables were simultaneously laid and buried from the Mean High Water Line to the wind farm location, all cables were within the pre-determined corridor. There was no evidence of anything which would impede the laying and burial of the cables along the proposed route." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:11eda20f71a26cb53cacdba81b213d9af71b2a80> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d8a8853536d34912df55473a7254bcee .
