<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:11d5e3840cc2453b2656686c769e2d3d98bd975c> <http://schema.org/description> "This report provides the Environmental Monitoring Plan (EMP) for the pre-construction baseline monitoring for the Teesside Offshore Wind Farm. To discharge the FEPA consent conditions the key topics that require pre-construction baseline surveys for subsequent monitoring and assessment purposes are seabed morphology, benthic ecology, fish, marine mammals, electromagnetic fields and marine archeology.\r\nThis metadata file has been created by The Crown Estate for the purpose of publishing the dataset onto the Marine Data Exchange." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:11d5e3840cc2453b2656686c769e2d3d98bd975c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a6e4d9d36c61589b42216307fb989aa2 .
