_:e493d0f5d5885c12400540628f3283d8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f52972741ef9f9a677785b44dc142a0e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e493d0f5d5885c12400540628f3283d8 <http://schema.org/value> "Napier University School of Life Sciences" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:116c489bd09d9b1d887fe96932353bd678dd7a2b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 156 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1996 from stations in an area centred around 56.3N, 9.0 W in the North East Atlantic. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Napier University School of Life Sciences as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
