<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ea33ee9927bccc03c92e8a570388d6090a6c9b5> <http://schema.org/description> "Hamon grab, camera sledge and drop camera deployments were carried out on a pr-defined sample grid. Sampling areas were defined using 100% MB coverage of the site. These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is available on request from BGS." .
