<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ea1ca4542442337bc036c4db57377a0b3e1df7e> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the 1957 RV Sarsia Cruise No.1 on the European continental slope west of Brittany. Samples were collected using a mix of 4ft rectangular, bowed and new 3ft dredges. Data supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH for the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
