<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da552726dd44b2c788c6c1d628c81ccb9b1b339> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ff268098907d2ffe19d3fc56fb69ed3e .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da552726dd44b2c788c6c1d628c81ccb9b1b339> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 14 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1999 from stations off the coast of the Iberian Peninsula between 42 - 43 N, 9 - 10 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Liège Department of Astrophysics Geophysics and Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
_:ff268098907d2ffe19d3fc56fb69ed3e <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
