<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0cd6afc18c970e330d9347a08c0a351d50605001> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ea03ad7dea5d9d58116677828bba114c .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0cd6afc18c970e330d9347a08c0a351d50605001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0cd6afc18c970e330d9347a08c0a351d50605001> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 19 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Atlantic Ocean area specifically around the Marsala Seamount and the Cruiser Tablemount, during May and June of 1981. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0cd30084771a68d3372285d8f4b4d54ee4d9b888> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ff69484c9d1ca361647efdcbd73a4ed7 .
_:b63a65bdd3ed64a5541191262c82e70e <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory" .
