_:a233c3393e0635586933d90a8b53fe74 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c8ebe89f39c304aa9878c1b8cd1890df632ffe3> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 226 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in October 1990 from stations covering the southern North Sea, Rhine estuary and Dover Straits. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences as part of the North Sea Project Plumes Process Study." .
_:b42c9c7f783b0ad137ccfbe599693f03 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:b42c9c7f783b0ad137ccfbe599693f03 <http://schema.org/value> "Loch Sween" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c66810a0412cf5038a240ae7bbe015439ef7968> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c66810a0412cf5038a240ae7bbe015439ef7968> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b42c9c7f783b0ad137ccfbe599693f03 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c66810a0412cf5038a240ae7bbe015439ef7968> <http://schema.org/description> "This survey included dive surveys along two transects in the Linne Mhuirich rapids system in Loch Sween. The survey involved a diver operated video and digital stills survey and included a repeat survey of the east rapids transect undertaken in 1999." .
_:b42c9c7f783b0ad137ccfbe599693f03 <http://schema.org/value> "Linne Mhuirich rapids system" .
_:b42c9c7f783b0ad137ccfbe599693f03 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c55810f01b400d9b85bcb580d4486def09a5384> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bc4bdea63e73075bc7a614fc9c1de6ac .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c55810f01b400d9b85bcb580d4486def09a5384> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology was commissioned by RPS Group plc, on behalf of Centrica Renewable Energy Limited, to undertake Stage 4 ostracod and pollen analyses and amino acid racemisation (AAR) dating of samples taken from borehole BHID25, collected during the geotechnical surveys for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing Offshore Wind Farms. This report is the Stage 5 or final report detailing the results of the Stage 4 analyses and dating and summarises the earlier Stage 1 to 3 assessments and geoarchaeological recording" .
_:d03105bfc6e74d91c4d277f139916aa2 <http://schema.org/value> "geotechnical surveys" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c55810f01b400d9b85bcb580d4486def09a5384> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d03105bfc6e74d91c4d277f139916aa2 .
