<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0b9f6b6c3de95487e0540153a7cfe8f280cb58e1> <http://schema.org/description> "The proposed site at London Array has been assessed by independent analysis and consultation with all the required consultees operating the television, radio and communications networks. The proposed wind farm is\r\nexpected to have no effects on television, radio or communications fixed links. As a consequence there are expected to be no EMI related constraints on the siting of turbines within the proposed site boundary." .
