<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0b192aaca2366c34f71b967529bc16df7337b8e3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0b0e73b0af3cac11ebd584931d0a9991334a2e8c> <http://schema.org/description> "The work includes a seabed and a sub-seabed survey of the construction area and the export cable corridor. The main aims with the survey are to:\r\n -Map and quantify the possibility for unexploded ordnance (UXO) within the turbine construction area and the export cable corridor.\r\n -Acquire and interpret high quality seabed and sub-seabed data for project planning/execution, including shallow geology, local topography, seabed sediment distribution, seabed features, seabed obstructions, wrecks and archaeological sites, possible occurrence of Sabellaria Spinolusa, evaluation of possible mobile sediments, etc.\r\n -Improve the geological/geotechnical understanding of the shallow stratigraphy and soil properties in the turbine site and export corridor for planning/execution of turbine foundation installation and cable routing, installation and protection.\r\n Contractor: Fugro EMU Surveyed: May- Oct 2013" .
_:f05229d44760f60ab93025ed587ec908 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
