<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ab0dc77ddd49c53380387d14218eed5412bbed2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a3f3d4069d55a55e8227a3000ba5e61a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ab0dc77ddd49c53380387d14218eed5412bbed2> <http://schema.org/description> "Volunteer divers recorded species observations on record cards for the Underwater Observation Scheme established in 1977 as part of the Underwater Conservation Year. This dataset represents the records card collected in MNCR sector IR04 Greater Galway Bay." .
_:d3043ebfcc46d8448d8ca1dbcb86e54d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:a3f3d4069d55a55e8227a3000ba5e61a <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:ce517c6ed4caf7ffeee383e7bff5cd0d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bd0ec68f324482590c39e0d1fa52ccf4 <http://schema.org/value> "Ramora UK" .
_:a10a1c42582490c340cb8c8b6cd3e893 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:ce517c6ed4caf7ffeee383e7bff5cd0d <http://schema.org/value> "Kent" .
_:ce517c6ed4caf7ffeee383e7bff5cd0d <http://schema.org/value> "Herne Bay" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0aa05e055078b1768fcdaa956e7ffbd1b9a94b06> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology (WA) was commissioned by Royal Haskoning DHV on behalf of Vattenfall Wind Power Ltd to carry out an assessment of finds made by Ramora UK during their search of inshore/beach areas for UXO targets as part of the proposed Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm Extension.\r\n\r\nThe Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm Extension (KFE) is an extension to the existing Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) situated off Herne Bay, Kent in the outer Thames Estuary. It will include the installation of 15 new turbines and monopole foundations to the south and west of the existing OWF. There will be 10-12km of inter-array cable and up to two new export cables each approximately 8.5km long and including cable crossings (WA 2014).\r\n\r\nThe finds assessment consists of a review of information and images from the 47 targets found by Ramora UK and assessment of these finds for archaeological potential." .
_:ce517c6ed4caf7ffeee383e7bff5cd0d <http://schema.org/value> "outer Thames Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0aa05e055078b1768fcdaa956e7ffbd1b9a94b06> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bd0ec68f324482590c39e0d1fa52ccf4 .
