<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0a52523ca92228a9646cb4046686cceb6a5a40f1> <http://schema.org/description> "Emu Ltd was commissioned by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited in 2009 to undertake a post construction hydrographic monitoring survey of the Lynn and Inner Dowsing wind farm sites and export power cables to shore in order to determine the bathymetry, seabed types and distribution of benthic habitats in the wind farm and associated surrounding areas\r\n\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title: Lynn and Inner Dowsing Hydrographic Monitoring Survey\r\n\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1.GIS layers and MXDs; 2.Images(.jpg) ; 3.Videos ; 4. XYZ9.txt) 5. Documents and plots (.pdf)" .
