<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:09603248612b7d2839d6fd9c56f5421381ed4ca0> <http://schema.org/description> "This series contains the reports and datasets for the South and North Seawatch Midi 185 buoys, deployed by Fugro EMU just outside of the wind farm boundary in September (South - 53°14.320’ N, 000°54.007E) and October (North - 53°19.537’ N, 000°48.212E) 2015." .
