_:e42b0d85e315b42649528f1a92272bd3 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08e483bb77dc3d9edc973f48cba6de177019a349> <http://schema.org/description> "The Pre-Construction Baseline Monitoring Report read in conjunction with the attached survey reports, constitutes the Pre-Construction\r\nBaseline Monitoring Report for Array 2, as required under Condition 5.2.14 of the Marine Licence. It presents\r\nthe findings of the pre-construction Annex I habitats; benthic ecology; fish &amp;amp; shellfish; ornithology; marine\r\nmammals and geophysical surveys.\r\nSection 3 summarises the Marine Licence conditions that have been discharged either wholly or partially\r\nthrough the production of monitoring plans, the pre-construction surveys, and the production of survey\r\nreports.\r\nPre-construction survey reports for Benthic Ecology (BOD-101-04-NPC-MWL-00008-A-01 and 00010-A-01), Fish\r\nand Shellfish Ecology (BOD-101-04-NPC-MWL-00007-A-01) and Birds and Marine Mammals (BOD-101-04-BODMWL-\r\n00022-A-01) are appended to this report (Annex A-C)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08e483bb77dc3d9edc973f48cba6de177019a349> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e42b0d85e315b42649528f1a92272bd3 .
