_:ac88a2dae7308b0a8cd5fe8072c7cd1e <http://schema.org/value> "Rhyl" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08871d0cd0a5f0e416e5227eac0f169cf233a166> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ac88a2dae7308b0a8cd5fe8072c7cd1e .
_:b465ea77fd577d7be3f69dd2a3860427 <http://schema.org/value> "UXO’s" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08871d0cd0a5f0e416e5227eac0f169cf233a166> <http://schema.org/description> "In October 2013 Environmental Scientifics Group (ESG) were commissioned by Dong Energy UK\r\n(DONG) to conduct an intertidal geophysical survey over an area of foreshore at Rhyl in\r\nDenbighshire. The area to be surveyed is the proposed cable landing point from an extension to\r\nthe existing Burbo Bank Offshore Windfarm site. A detailed specification was provided which\r\nstated the objective of the investigation was as follows:\r\n1. Detect Potential UXO’s\r\n2. Provide Topography for the entire investigation area\r\n3. Provide sub-bottom data\r\nThis will be used to assist with the design, consenting and construction of the proposed export\r\ncable route.\r\nThe scope of work for the intertidal operations, specified the following:\r\n1. Multi-sensor magnetometer survey\r\n2. RTK GPS Survey\r\n3. Seismic refraction survey of the centreline of the proposed cable route.\r\nThe survey was carried out in accordance with the specification and works were conducted\r\nbetween 27 November 2013 and 13 December 2013." .
_:a59ff7e14e01e9b8a605caf9eb641e79 <http://schema.org/value> "Seismic refraction survey" .
_:a59ff7e14e01e9b8a605caf9eb641e79 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
