_:c7e23d127876cacf7e75f6ccab905f0d <http://schema.org/value> "Forvie Central" .
_:b7fa1877718331d8783c090ce0cb04ec <http://schema.org/value> "multibeam swathe bathymetry" .
_:c7e23d127876cacf7e75f6ccab905f0d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0860b891282a1b16d820e3654e45cc0470687999> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Survey Limited (FSLtd) undertook an environmental baseline survey, in UKCS 3/20, at the Forvie Central location. This volume details the results of the environmental survey and utilises the particle size, organic carbon, heavy metal, hydrocarbon and macrofaunal data from the environmental survey in addition to the multibeam swathe bathymetry and sidescan sonar data from the geophysical survey." .
_:b7fa1877718331d8783c090ce0cb04ec <http://schema.org/value> "sidescan sonar data" .
_:b7fa1877718331d8783c090ce0cb04ec <http://schema.org/value> "macrofaunal data" .
