<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0845e83526e041d864fec818dd20588c913e6bcd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0845e83526e041d864fec818dd20588c913e6bcd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bd35aa6de5f77b5bb42feca1ea3ef347 .
_:bd35aa6de5f77b5bb42feca1ea3ef347 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Plume" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0845e83526e041d864fec818dd20588c913e6bcd> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1991. It incorporates CTD sections and anchor stations in the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume and the Wash plus a CTD section E-W across the North Sea along 53N. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
_:bd35aa6de5f77b5bb42feca1ea3ef347 <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
_:bd35aa6de5f77b5bb42feca1ea3ef347 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Estuary" .
_:e667172795e39b7c2bdfe494cb4df78d <http://schema.org/value> "Narec" .
_:e667172795e39b7c2bdfe494cb4df78d <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:e667172795e39b7c2bdfe494cb4df78d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e667172795e39b7c2bdfe494cb4df78d <http://schema.org/value> "National monitoring facilities" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:082fdc96dce3e312aed97ed52a0dd6d6ed1c23d6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:082fdc96dce3e312aed97ed52a0dd6d6ed1c23d6> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series provides a summary of historical metocean data which Narec has acquired in proximity to\r\nthe site, and is intended to provide an overview of conditions which occur on site.\r\nData is taken from multiple instruments which were deployed by Narec both on the seabed using\r\nupward looking acoustic measurements, and a Waverider Buoy. Information from processed data\r\nreports and National monitoring facilities is also presented." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:082fdc96dce3e312aed97ed52a0dd6d6ed1c23d6> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e667172795e39b7c2bdfe494cb4df78d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0814f2de89a010750dd1d30d26c8db74c3159c6d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
