<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0814f2de89a010750dd1d30d26c8db74c3159c6d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:acc8ffb641085f1676cdbef3bf93d600 .
_:acc8ffb641085f1676cdbef3bf93d600 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:acc8ffb641085f1676cdbef3bf93d600 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0814f2de89a010750dd1d30d26c8db74c3159c6d> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 45 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in the North Sea area. Specific locations include Stonehaven Transect using a Seabird CTD sampler deployed using a vertical dip and the Wee Bankie/Marr Bank study area by CTD-fluorometer-transmissometer dips during September and October 2003. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0814f2de89a010750dd1d30d26c8db74c3159c6d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e8cdecd5db2e11073ac176afd71cb5ea .
