<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0803389cd5b999a91166db9bda5de6a0e9aeebde> <http://schema.org/description> "Surveys of Lundy, 2 general surveys and 1 specifically looking at corals and anemones. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 2005 Marine Conservation Society Seasearch survey of Lundy, 2006 Seasearch Lundy Coral and Anemone Survey, and 2006 Seasearch Lundy Coral and Anemone Survey." .
_:df3e27d0d6dbb8bb99ee110cde8ca75e <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
