<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:07d0541e9378585c13ae6b9d0aa5a22327343cff> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:07d0541e9378585c13ae6b9d0aa5a22327343cff> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 60 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October - November 1998 in the vicinity of 59 20 N, 1 E in the northern North Sea. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the PROcesses of Vertical Exchange in Shelf Seas (PROVESS) project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:07d0541e9378585c13ae6b9d0aa5a22327343cff> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:db3f6ab6f3f6a2bc868904168e882a55 .
