<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:076dab3388f14663280a34bd216828f6d6ab931a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October 1980. It incorporates profiles at nine of the ten radiocaesium stations across the Scottish shelf. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
