<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0759037e05ab6e2c00a9accb8275b0a0d6b60c38> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 110 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during December 1988 - January 1989 from a pre-determined 123-station survey grid covering the southern North Sea (south of 56N). A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project water column survey." .
_:d4dfb30aac2506bd560d00a7517bbf71 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
