_:d22b0fcfff3fd570cda5537b1d868cca <http://schema.org/value> "Spain" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:06d14eba25eee06daae6be8b9b7a1eeaf8ef3680> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in September 1974 in the canyons off the north coast of Spain. Samples were collected using either a 4ft rectangular dredge or an anchor dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
_:a3a76bc6beb16b913d42f858a0a7ef45 <http://schema.org/value> "Dr. Eve Southward" .
