_:c3a090dc97658862c649103088e0406e <http://schema.org/value> "EDF Energy Renewables" .
_:c3a090dc97658862c649103088e0406e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:04e469acd66ed3ef66b919a1f03577b578673495> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned by EDF Energy Renewables, in July 2017, to undertake a 350m x 350m debris survey around turbine 14B on the Teesside Offshore Wind Farm (OWF), prior to the emplacement of a jack-up rig on the site. Once mobilised, the client also requested a further survey of the remainder of the wind farm site. The location of the windfarm is presented in Figure 1, below and the relevant turbine identified. The survey was completed under Bibby HydroMap’s Terms and Conditions and was carried out between 24/07/2017 and 30/07/2017. The main objective of the surveys was to identify any object or conditions, which may constrain the emplacement of the jack-up rig." .
_:ded3a7d2a18e4386fcedb72e216343a8 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:f67393e2ba0341f3a3238b0077dc07f1 <http://schema.org/value> "north east Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:04c72788cf6732f05c32609de2a967ebc1d8b917> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 8 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1994 from stations in the north east Atlantic Ocean between 38 - 50 N, 11 - 16 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Research Center for Marine Geosciences, Kiel as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:04c72788cf6732f05c32609de2a967ebc1d8b917> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ded3a7d2a18e4386fcedb72e216343a8 .
