<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:048c5e9898bb89db161282480c8291e407896025> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 33 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during June - July 1977. It incorporates four shelf stations of the Ellett Line/Anton Dohrn Seamount section; a section on the continental shelf between St Kilda and Barra Head; a section south of Barra Head to Stanton Banks and a number of stations between the North Channel and the Little Minch. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
