<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:042d17d400103d4d2fbdf25f9fe3cd741d327433> <http://schema.org/description> "Modiolus modiolus presence records from selected sites in Strangford Lough and Belfast Lough. No latitude/longitude included therefore co-ordinates from a central point within the Lough have been used." .
