<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:030a4da2c5759757ae794982b647e100506f904d> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions of Barrow Offshore Wind Limited, Osiris Projects were\r\ncommissioned to undertake an inspection survey covering the Barrow Offshore Wind\r\nFarm export cable route, in conjunction with scour monitoring surveys at all of the\r\nindividual turbine locations within the main development area. Data acquisition took\r\nplace using the survey vessel MV ‘So Fyne’, during the period 31st March to 3rd April\r\n2009.\r\nHigh-resolution side scan sonar, swath multi-beam and single beam bathymetry data\r\nwere acquired along a number of parallel survey lines, which were generally run at 25m\r\ncentres, in order to accurately map the seabed along the cable route." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:030a4da2c5759757ae794982b647e100506f904d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bb4263d6508d783024d08105a83b9e92 .
