<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:029ea02d38e14584d881d14f42e44b617817da67> <http://schema.org/description> "In response to the desk study and Phase 1 Habitat Survey, a vegetation survey was conducted on the shingle beach and grassed bank to the south of the seawall on the 23 September 2004. In addition the standing water\r\nmargins were inspected for protected or otherwise notable species." .
