<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:02400fce7d6cb5e39de0c2b9b7b3325caf50da38> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 15 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the shelf seas to the west of Scotland, during June and July of 2009. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Association for Marine Science as part of the Oceans 2025 programme." .
