<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:01bf2ff68533f3041ca2c65e20a1555288b3581c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 157 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in May 1999 from stations off the coast of the Galician Coast. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Instituto Hidrografico, Portugal as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
